<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Teke-Tyee</book>
  <para style="h">BIGYIGHILI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Big</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bigyighili</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bigyighili bi bantumu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bigyighili bi bantumu</para>
  <para style="imt">OSOMO</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu me mukaana wu a myele wu ósono Luke. Wu a nsomo, « Nsia Yimbwe yi ósono Luke». Mukaana wu li mu osuo esala ki ósi bantumu. Mu wu a nsomo, nde ásuo bu báburu Yiisu, bu óli bumweẽ bu nde ŋa nsie yi, lipfu li nde, ya bu ásighili nde ŋa kara li ba bápki mu ogye ku yulu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukaana wu li mu osuo bu ógweghe Yiisu, wu áagyene ku yulu, Mufulu kundaa binduono bi nde mpaala bye binama litumu li nde lili masini (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">1.8</ref></char>). Mu obo, bantumu básuo bumpughulu mu osighili o Yiisu mu lipfu ku Yerusaleme. Kimini li ómwehẽ mfwunu a bakwuru ba ba-Dzwife nde lísi kuulu Nsia yi Mbwe yitsaŋama mu Yude lwohono, mu Samari, ya bvulu-bvulu ku Noore tee ku Antyose. Mu mandagha mamo, Piere, Dzake, Dzã, Dzake mbwee a Yiisu ya Poole báasi esala kii elagha. Lo mu bo bwohono, Poole ábvulusala. Esala e nde émoŋono mu libwunu li ábala nde ku etsulu e nsie kii Adzi li lisala, ku nsie a ba-Ngereke ya emvulu-ngughu ku nto yi a Wesete, mu matala ma ákabuludzye nde mu okabulutsala Nsia yi Mbwe. Mukaana wu ásini mu saba li Poole wu áali mu boloko ku Rome ya li mu osuo ti mandagha ma Nzaami ya Mufulu ka bakughu odzahaba bye o.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">Mukaana wu bakughu okaba nde bu:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Obaana mu etsughu ki ógyene Yiisu ku yulu tee mu etsughu kii Pantekote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1-2">1–2</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Bumpughulu bu bantumu ya kimini li bámono bo ku Yerusaleme (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 3-7">3–7</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Nsia yi Mbwe yitsaŋama mu Samari (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 8">8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Poole gyiŋi mayele (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9">9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Baara baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, basomo mu libwunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 10-11">10–11</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Badzwi Dzake ya bapaha Piere mu boloko (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 12">12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">7) Midzye mi Poole mimi nsomo mu oyitsala Nsia yi Mbwe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13-14">13–14</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">8) Emvuŋunu ki bantumu ku Yerusaleme (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15">15</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">9) Midzye mi Poole mimi myele mu oyitsala Nsia yi Mbwe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16-18">16–18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">10) Midzye mi Poole mimi mitere mu oyitsala Nsia yi Mbwe (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 19-21">19–21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">11) Poole mu boloko (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 22-26">22–26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">12) Poole ku Rome (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 27-28">27–28</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mufulu a Ngili wu básiini a bantumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Ndughu a me Tofile, mu mukaana a me wu a nsomo, me aandyele mandagha mwohono ma óbaana Yiisu osa ya oluo, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />tee mu etsughu ki áseŋene nde mu okumu ku yulu, ŋa mbihi a ŋa ámana otswa nde mikele mu Mufulu a Ngili, kundaa bantumu ba ásuolo nde. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Ŋa mbihi a mpara yi ámono nde, nde ákamoŋono kundaa bo ya mu bilyimi bilagha, nde ákasuo kundaa bo ti nde li mweẽ. Mu bitsughu makwumu-mana (40), nde ákabulumoŋono kundaa bo ya ákabulubili mu mi mitala Empu e Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Etsughu nga-emõ, nde bu ákadza emõ ya bo, nde átswi bo mukele wu: «Ka limara mu Yerusaleme o, lo likebe mi oosiini a be Taara, mimye mi liigyughu be kundaa me <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />ti: Dzã aaboghoro mu madza, lo be, mu mana bitsughu sa baboghoro be mu Mufulu a Ngili.»<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bágyene a Yiisu ku yulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Obo me buulu, babo ba bábvuŋunu, báfwulu kundaa nde ti: «Mfumu, ngu mu matala ma we aabvurulu Emfumu e Isarayele?» <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Nde ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Ka yili ndagha a be o mu osoolo matala ya ena bi ókuru Taara mu litumu li ndeme, <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />lo be sa ligyagha lileene ŋa akala oogya Mufulu a Ngili mu be, ya be sa likala bampughulu ba me mu Yerusaleme, [mu] Yude lwohono, mu Samari, tee ku osughu nsie.»<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Bu amana obili obo, nde áseŋene mu okumu ku yulu ŋaala bo bwohono mu okamono nde, ya edzi éfughu nde ŋa mihi mi bo. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Ŋaala bo áli nkini mu okatala ku yulu, ku ákagye nde, babaghala buolo ba bálaha binkuru bi bipeŋeme bágyi ŋa bele a bo, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />ya bályele kundaa bo ti: «Basi Ngalile, mu emakye be liitemene oŋo mu okatala ku yulu? Yiisu wu, wu oogyene a Nzaami ku yulu ŋa mihi mi be, sa ayabvughuru si ti bwunu a bu liimono be nde mu ogye ku yulu.»<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakyihi Matiase ŋa ebini kii Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Mu obo, bantumu bábvughuru ku Yerusaleme, obaana ku Munguo wu a mi-Olibve, wu li ŋa bele a Yerusaleme, mu etiiri ki bágwi muswa mu odzyara etsughu kii Sabate<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">etiiri ki bágwi muswa mu odzyara etsughu kii Sabate </char><char style="ft" closed="false">áli ku bele a kilometere mumõ.</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Bo bu bayabvughuru, básomo mu ngwumu yi a ku yulu, omo mu báli a bo epfu ki okabvuŋunu. Mu bo óli a Piere, Dzã, Dzake ya Andere, Filipe, Toma, Baretelemi, Matye, Dzake mwana a Alefe, Simõ mu-Nzelote ya Yuda mwana a Dzake. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Bo bwohono babo, bási mukama mu mukolo mumõ mu okasamana, emõ ya bakaha, ya Mari ngughu a Yiisu, ya bambwee ba Yiisu ba babaghala.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mu bitsughu bibye, mpwumu a banga-a-kana yi áali ŋa ebini ekye yíli ku bele a nkama ya makwumu-muolo (120) ma baara. Piere átemene ŋa kara li bo ya ályele ti: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />«Baana ba taara a me, áli bubwe ti, mandagha ma áli olyele Mufulu a Ngili mu Mukaana a Nzaami mu muŋma a Dabvide mu nkooro a Yuda makeele, nde wu ákighiri mumbiri a babo ba básyimi Yiisu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Nde aali mumõ ŋa kara li bihi, ya nde aabagha kaba lili esala ki. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Nde bu abagha mufuru wuulu ka li wu a nsumu o, nde swumu nseghe. Nde aabwi kii mapfumunu, bala li nde liibughulu ya biini bi nde biitsaŋama. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Ya baara bwohono baba Yerusaleme basoolo ndagha oyo. Mu obo, bo baakata nseghe oyo mu ndiŋi yi bula bu bo ti: “<char style="qt">Akeledama</char>”, mbaala ti, “nseghe yi makili”. <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Ankoho, básono mu mukaana wu Bikwumu ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Nyaã nzo a nde yikala mukaŋana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">ya mbwuru anyaã okala munsa yo!”»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:20">«Ya báfiri sono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">“Nyaã mbwuru mukimi asala esala e nde”.»<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />«Mu obo, bafaana osuolo mbwuru mukimi ŋa kara li baara ba bákabulugye ya bihi, mu matala mwohono maala Mfumu Yiisu ákabulugye ŋa kara li bihi, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />obaana ŋa óboghoro nde Dzã, tee mu etsughu ekye ki bámaha nde ŋa kara li bihi. Mbwuru munde, emõ ya bihi, faana okala mpughulu mu osighili o Yiisu ŋa kara li ba bákpi.»<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Básuo baara buolo: Dzodzefe wu bákata Barasabase, wu bálughu Yusutuse, ya Matiase. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Ya bo bwohono básamana ya bályele ti: «Mfumu, we wu soolo mikolo mi baara bwohono, suo bihi mu bo bansa buolo ba, nande we áasuolo, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />mpaala agwolo ebini mu esala ki buntumu ki, ki oosihi Yuda mu ogye ku ebini kii ndaa nde.» <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Ŋa nseele, bo báti empa kiili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 27.35; Mar 15.24; Luk 23.34; Dzã 19.24.</char></note> nga-a-bwehe me wu aagwolo, ya eti ébwi ŋa ndaa Matiase, ya básohobo nde mu kaba li bantumu kwumu ya mumõ (11).<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ogya ku Mufulu a Ngili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Etsughu kii Pantekote bu eto, bo bwohono bábvuŋunu ŋa ebini emõ. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ya ensihibi, nkele yífi ku yulu ti anga nkele a efulu kii mpini, yíluhu nzo yohono mu bábwi bo nsini. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Bo bámono manzalisogho mu efaana ki mile mi mbaa, mi míkakaghaba ya míkabwa ŋa yulu a nswe mbwuru mu bo. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Bo bwohono bálwulu mu Mufulu a Ngili ya bábwi obili mu mandiŋi makimi, bwunu a bu ókatumu bo Mufulu obili.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Ankoho ku Yerusaleme óli a ba-Dzwife ba bali a enzaama kii ngaŋma, baara ba báfi mu bitsulu bi mansie byehene. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Bu bagyughu nkele oyo, bo bábvuŋunu mu mpwumu, ya bo bwohono bákiŋimi ku olagha, mu kuulu nswe mbwuru ákagyughu bo mu okabili mu ndiŋi a ndeme. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Bo bákiŋimi ku olagha, bágwuu ya bákalyele ti: «Bunu, baara bwohono ba bali mu okabili ba, bo ka bali baara ba etsulu e nsie kii Ngalile o? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Lo bunu-a-bo mbwuru-mbwuru mu bihi ali mu okagyughu bo mu okabili mu ndiŋi yi bula bu nde? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Ŋa kara li bihi oli a baara ba nsie yi a ba-Parete, nsie yi a Mede, nsie yi a Elame ya ba baakakala ku Medzopotami, ku Yude, ku Kapadose, ku Põ ya ku Adzi, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />ku Firingi, ku Pamfili, ku Edzipite ya ba bali mu bitsulu bi nsie bibi ku Libi lili Sirene ya ba bali ku bvulu lili Rome, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />ba-Dzwife ya baara ba básomo Nzaami a bo, basi Kerete ya basi Arabi, bihi lili mu okagyughu bo mu okabili mu mandiŋi ma bihi, bigyighili bi Nzaami bi binene!» <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Bo bwohono bágwuu ya mayele máfi bo, bákalyele bo-a-bo ti: «Bu yi ma?» <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Lo babake bákasa bo munsensehẽ ya bákalyele ti: «Buta mala baakolo!»<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandagha ma ólyele Piere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Mu obo, Piere átemene ya bantumu kwumu ya mumõ (11), ábili mu likyi lili mpini kundaa mpwumu ya ályele kundaa bo ti: «Basi Yude, ya be bwohono ba lili ŋa Yerusaleme, ligyughu mandagha ma aandyele me, libaghala ti, <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />baara ba ka mala baakolo o ti bu lili mu okatsimi be, mu kuulu, li nkini tala lili wa mu epala. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Lo bu me bu oli mu okeele ndagha yi ólyele mubighili Dzowele.» Nde ályele ti:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />«Mu bitsughu bibi masini, bu ólyele Nzaami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">me sa nsurulu Mufulu a me ŋa yulu a mbwuru-mbwuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">ya baana ba be ba babaghala</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">ya baba batughu sa babighili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Nzaami sa asa kuulu ti bampala ba be bamono mandagha ma manyaghara</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">ya biŋmini bi be sa biluoro manzolo.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Eẽ, mu bitsighu bibye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">me sa nsurulu Mufulu a me ŋa yulu a basala ba me baba babaghala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">ya baba bakaha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">Ya bo sa bakala mibighili,<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />ku yulu me sa ngyighili mandagha mama okiŋimi mu yulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">ya ku nsie bilyimi bibi mpaana ŋa yulu nsie: Makili, mbaa ya bidzi bibi lwuu.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Tala sa likighiri mpyibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">ya ngoono sa abie ti makili.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">Myehene mimye sa mimoŋono</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">nsomo ya ogya ku etsughu e Mfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">etsughu ki enene ya kii nsia.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Oŋo nswe munde wu akala aataŋana nkwumu a Mfumu sa abvwughu.»<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />«Basi Isarayele, ligyughu mandagha ma: Yiisu wu a ku Nadzarete, mbwuru munde wu oosuo Nzaami kundaa be mu bimaã, mandagha mama okiŋimi ya mu bilyimi bi ási nde ŋa kara li be, ti bwunu a bu lisoolo be beme yo, <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />mbwuru munde, wu bátyeghe ti bwunu a bu oli bitsimi bi otswama ogyahaba Nzaami, be liigwi nde ŋa myaã mi baara ba bagwene osoolo Nzaami, ba baadzwi nde bu baakomo nde ŋa kuruwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Lo Nzaami aasiili nde, bu aakwulu nde mu mpara a lipfu, buulu ka okughu okala o ti lipfu lidzarala nde. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Mu kuulu, mu nde Dabvide ályele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">Mu nswe matala, me áakamono Mfumu ŋa nkulu a me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">nde li ŋa kwogho e me kii babaghala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">mpaala me nyaã otighiri mu nzalamweẽ.»<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />«Me mu obo mukolo a me ali kunsa esee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">muŋma a me aalwulu mu munyuŋu ya nyuru a me yili kunsa emiini,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />mu kuulu we ka nyaghala muwumunu a me ku nsie a ba bákpi o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">we ka nyaã wu a we Wu a Ngili abolo o.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />We aasuo me mankwulu mama laama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">we buli ŋa nkulu a me, we sa luhu me mu esee.»<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />«Baana ba taara a me, linyaã me bu ndi a muswa, me ndyele be mu kana lwohono mi mitala nkagha-kwuru Dabvide ti: nde ákpi, bádzyighi nde, ya mpyeme a nde yili tee lolo ŋa kara li bihi-a-be . <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Lo nde áli mubighili ya nde ásoolo ti mu mukihi, Nzaami ágwi misiini kundaa nde ti mumõ mu bateghele ba nde sa akiri ŋa likubu li nde. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Mu limono, Dabvide bu átswama otaala mi mitala osighili o Kriste ŋa kara li ba bákpi, nde ályele ti: “Ka baanyaghala nde ku nsie a ba bákpi o, ya ka baanyaã nyuru a nde yibolo o.” <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Me Yiisu munde Nzaami aasiili ŋa kara li ba bákpi, ya bihi bwohono lili bampughulu mu ndagha oyo. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Nzaami bu aakuhubu Yiisu ku kwogho e nde kii babaghala, Yiisu aagyagha kundaa Taara Mufulu a Ngili wu áli bagwi misiini, ya nde aasurulu nde ŋa yulu a bihi. Mimye me mi lili mu okamono ya lili mu okagyughu be lolo li. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Mu kuulu, Dabvide ndeme ka ákumu ku mayulu o, lo nde ályele ti: “Mfumu aalyele kundaa Mfumu a me ti: Yabwa-nsini ku kwogho e me kii babaghala, <verse eid="ACT 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />tee mu matala ma akala aansa me mitaara mi we mikala edzyara e myili mi we.” <verse eid="ACT 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Nyaã ti basi Isarayele bwohono bagyighili osoolo mu ngaŋma ti: Nzaami aasi ti Yiisu wu liikomo be ŋa kuruwa akala Mfumu ya akala Kriste!”»<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />«Bu bamana ogyughu mandagha mamo, mikolo mi bo mídzwala, ya bályele kundaa Piere ya kundaa bantumu ti: “Baana ba taara, emakye bihi lifaana osa?”» <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Piere ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Ligyiŋi mayele ya baboghoro nswe mbwuru mu be mu nkwumu a Yiisu-Kriste. Mpaala Nzaami asa masumu ma nde kolokolo ya be sa ligyagha kaba li Mufulu a Ngili. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Mu kuulu misiini mi, Nzaami ási mye kundaa be, kundaa baana ba be ya kundaa babo ba bali ku la, bo bwohono ba akala oota Mfumu Nzaami a bihi mbili.»<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Mu mandagha makimi ma malagha, Piere ákapeene a bo ya ákagwa bo mpama, ŋa ákalyele nde kundaa bo ti: «Ligyagha obvwughu ya be sa lipala mu eseene ki ebi ki!» <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Ya babo ba bákihi mandagha ma nde, báboghoro bo, ya mu etsughu ekye, ba báyasomo mu kaba li ba bákasa kana, báli ku bele a mapfwunu-matere (3 000) ma baara.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bumweẽ bu libwunu lili nsomo ku Yerusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Bo bwohono bási mukama mu maluo ma ókaluo bantumu, mu okala ti baana baba taara mumõ, mu okakaba limpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mu okakaba limpa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ndibili a mweẽ yi a odza o Mfumu Yiisu ya bantumu ba nde kuu masini, nsomo nde akpa. Me mu matala mamo nde áseme limpa ya bviini.</char></note> ya mu okasamana Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Nswe mbwuru áli a nzalamweẽ, mu nkooro a mandagha mama okiŋimi ya bilyimi bi bilagha bi ókasa bantumu. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Babo bwohono ba bási kana báli bumõ, ya byehene bi báli a bye, bíli bibi ebvughu. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Bo bákatyeghe mansie ma bo ya byehene bi báli a bye, ya bákakaba nzi kundaa baara bwohono, bwunu a bu óli nzala a nswe mbwuru. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Nswe etsughu mu mukama, bo bákagwihini mu okagye ku nzo a nzaami, mu okakaba limpa munsa manzo, ya bákadza bilogho bi bo mu esee ya mu mukolo wu okughulu. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Bo bákasyighi Nzaami ya baara bwohono bákasuo bubwe kundaa bo. Ya nswe etsughu, Mfumu ákabwehe mu kaba li bo, ba bákabvwughu.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Piere ya Dzã badzuhu ekara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Etsughu nga-emõ, Piere ya Dzã bákakumu ku nzo a nzaami mu oyisamana, mu tala lili matere ŋa mbihi a embehe. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Oko, nswe etsughu, baara bákagya a baghala mumõ wu báburu ekara, ya bákatwulu nde ŋa muŋma a nzo a nzaami, wu bákata ti Muŋma a Nzo Wu Mubwe, mu kuulu nde akaluomo nzi kundaa babo ba bákasomo mu nzo a nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Nde bu amono Piere ya Dzã ba bákagye mu osomo munsa nzo a nzaami, nde áluomo bo nzi. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Piere ya Dzã batuunu nde mihi, ya Piere ályele kundaa nde ti: «Tala bihi!» <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Mbwuru munde ágyighili otala bo, ya ákakebe mu ogyagha elogho ki eefa kundaa bo. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Piere ályele kundaa nde ti: «Me ka ndi a nzi ya oore o, lo ki ndi a me, me ngwi we kye: Mu nkwumu a Yiisu-Kriste musi Nadzarete, temene ya dzyara!» <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Bu akwara nde mu kwogho kii babaghala, átehebe nde. Ŋaana oŋo bitaama bi nde ya maseẽ ma myili ma nde bíbagha mpini. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Bu adzuŋumu mankagha, nde átemene ya ábwi odzyara. Nde ásomo ya bo munsa nzo a nzaami, ákadzyara, ákadzuŋumu ya ákasyighi Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Baara bwohono bámono nde mu okadzyara ya mu okasyighi Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Ya baara básoolo ti me nde wu áakabwa-nsini ŋa Muŋma a nzo a nzaami wu baakata ti Muŋma wu Mubwe mu okaluomo nzi. Bo bámono nzalamweẽ yi alagha, ya bákiŋimi mu mi míbwi mu nde.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obili o Piere munsa nzo a nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Buulu mbwuru munde ka ákanyaã Piere ya Dzã o, baara bwohono bákiŋimi ya bágyi mu ntyini kundaa bo, ŋa eluru kii nzo a nzaami ki baakata ti Eluru kii Salomõ. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Piere bu ámono obo, nde áfwulu kundaa baara ti: «Basi Isarayele, mu emakye be lili mu okakiŋimi mu ndagha yi? Mu emakye be lili mu okatala bihi ti anga áli mu lileene li bihi bameme, bwunu-we mu enzaami e bihi, bihi liisi kuulu ti baghala wu adzyara? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Nzaami a Abarahame, a Idzake, a Dzakobe, Nzaami a bankagha ba bihi, aagwi musala a nde Yiisu nsia, nde wu liityeghe be ya wu liibihi be ŋa nkulu a Pilate, wu áamono ti áli bubwe mu onyaã nde. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Be liibihi Wu a Ngili ya Wu bunsumu, ya be liiswolo banyaã be wu aakadzwa baara. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Be liidzwi Mfumu a bumweẽ. Lo Nzaami aasiili nde ŋa kara li ba bákpi. Bihi, bihi lili bampughulu mu ndagha oyo. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Me mu lileene li nkwumu a Yiisu, mu nkooro a kana mu nde, baghala wu lisoolo ya wu lili mu okamono be wu, aabagha mpini. Me kana mu Yiisu liisi ti nde asaadzughu, bwunu a bu likughu omono be bwohono nde.»<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />«Mu obo, baana ba taara a me, me nsoolo ti kunsa odzimini be ya bamfumu ba be liigyighili mandagha mamo. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Mandagha ma ótswama olyele Nzaami mu miŋma mi mibighili myehene maatswighi. Mandagha mamo me ma: “Kriste a nde sa akala amono mpara”. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Mu obo, ligyiŋi mayele, libvughuru kundaa Nzaami, mu kuulu nde amaha masumu ma be, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />ya mu kuulu matala ma ogwumu ma oogwi Mfumu magya, ŋa akala aagweghe nde Yiisu, Kriste munde wu átswama osuolo nde mu be. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Lo mu matala ma, nde faana okala ku yulu, tee mu matala ma akala oobvurulu Nzaami bilogho byehene, ti bu ályele nde mu miŋma mi mibighili mimi ngili mimi nsi-nkulu. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Mu kuulu Moyidze ályele ti: “Mfumu Nzaami a be sa apaha mu nkooro a be, ya ŋa kara li ekaana e be mubighili ti anga me. Be lifaana ogyughu mandagha mwohono ma akala aalyele nde be. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Nswe mbwuru wu akala aagwene ogyughu mubighili munde, sa akala bamaha nde mu ekaana, nde sa akpa.” <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Ya Mibighili myehene, obaana Samwele ya myehene mi mígyi ŋa mbihi a nde, míbili mu mi mitala bitsughu bi. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Be, be lili baana ba mibighili ya baana ba ogwihini ku ósi Nzaami ya bataara ba be ŋa ályele nde kundaa Abarahame ti: “Me sa nseme bikaana byehene bibi ŋa yulu a nsie mu nzili a musyi a dzumu li we”. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Nsomo, mu be Nzaami átehebe musala a nde, wu átswama ogweghe nde mu oseme be, mu kuulu mbwuru-mbwuru mu be asihi bigyighili bi nde bi bibi.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Piere ya Dzã ŋa nkulu a mfwunu a ekwuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Piere ya Dzã báli nkini mu okabili kundaa baara, ŋa ógyi bangaa ba nzaami, mfumu a bankyele ba nzo a nzaami ya ba-Saduseyẽ. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Bo báli a nkehe mu kuulu Piere ya Dzã bákaluo baara ya bákalyele ti bwunu a bu ósighili Yiisu ŋa kara li ba bákpi, obo si baara ba bákpi akala baasighili mu lipfu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Bo básyimi Piere ya Dzã ya bálo bo mu boloko tee mbala, buulu áli ayi nkonkolo. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Lo mu ba bákagyughu ndagha, balagha áli baasi kana. Ya mutala a bo áli ku bele a mapfwunu-mataana (5 000). <verse eid="ACT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Mbala, bamfumu ba ba-Dzwife, bakwuru ya baluo-mikyene bábvuŋunu ku Yerusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Mu bo óli a Ane mukwuru a bangaa ba nzaami, Kayife, Dzã, Alesandere ya baara bwohono baba musyi a dzumu li bamfumu ba bangaa ba nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Bo bágyi a Piere ya Dzã ŋa nkulu a bo ya báfwulu bo ti: «Mu lileene li nande bwunu we mu nkwumu a nande be liigyighili ndagha yi?»<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Me mu obo, Piere wu áalwulu mu Mufulu a Ngili, ályele kundaa bo ti: <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />«Bamfumu ba ekaana ya bakwuru, lolo li bali mu ofwulu bihi mu nkooro a bubwe bu liisi bihi kundaa mbwuru nga a epfwumu, ya bunu-a-bo nde aabvwughu. <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Be bwohono ya ekaana kyehene kii Isarayele, ligyighili osoolo yo ti, me mu nkwumu a Yiisu-Kriste wu a ku Nadzarete, wu liikomo be ŋa kuruwa ya wu oosiili Nzaami ŋa kara li ba bákpi, me mu nde wu aatemene ŋa nkulu a be wu ali nsiili.» <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Me Yiisu li:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">«Limeẽ liili be bantwu manzo, liitsaala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">Lo, lo ayi limeẽ lili ngughu ŋa mutswunu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />«Obvwughu ka oli mu mbwuru mukimi o, mu kuulu ka oli a nkwumu nkimi o ŋa yulu a nsie yi bágwi kundaa baara, yiili mu yo bihi libvwughu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Bo bu bamono kana li Piere ya Dzã, bákiŋimi, mu kuulu bo bábaghala ti baara ba ka báli a mupfunu o, bo ka bágyighi o. Bo básoolo ti bo ba bákakala emõ ya Yiisu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Lo bo bu bamono baghala wu adzughu átemene ŋa bele a bo, bákuono a yi baalyele kundaa Piere ya Dzã. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Oŋo bo bágwi litumu bapaha bo ŋa kara li ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife, ya bo-a-bo básyili mu okuru mfwunu, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />bákalyele ti: «Emakye liisa mu baara ba? Buulu baara bwohono baba mu Yerusaleme basoolo mu ngaŋma elyimi ki baagyighili bo, ya bihi ka likughu obihi kye o. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Lo mu osa kuulu ndagha yi yinyaã otsaŋama ku olagha ŋa kara li baara, litswe litswa bo mukele mu ebaghala, banyaã ofiribili mu nkwumu oyo kundaa mbwuru si mumõ.»<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Bu bati bo mbili, bátswi bo mukele mu ebaghala mu onyaã ofiribili ya ofiriluo mu nkwumu a Yiisu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Piere ya Dzã bábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Lilamana beme: Nsa ndagha yili bunsumu ŋa mihi mi Nzaami, osa litumu li be, bwunu we osa litumu li Nzaami? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Bihi, ka lileene okuru miŋma mu mandagha ma liimono ya ma liigyughu o.» <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Bo báfiriŋaana bo ya bányaã bo. Bo ka bábagha nzili yi baasyeme bo o, mu nkooro a baara. Mu kuulu baara bwohono bákasyighi Nzaami mu ndagha yi áabwi. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Baghala munde wu áadzughu mu elyimi kii okiŋimi ekye, áli aluru bamvulu makwumu-mana (40).<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osamana ku banga-a-kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Bu banyaã bo, Piere ya Dzã bágyene kundaa baba ndaa bo ya bátwoho bo mandagha mwohono ma ólyele bo bamfumu ba bangaa ba nzaami ya ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Boho si, bu bamana ogyughu, bágwihini mu bitsimi bimõ, bábuono Nzaami mu likyi lili mpini ya bályele ti: «Mfumu, we wu áagyighili yulu, nsie ya mubu, ya bilogho byehene bi bili omo, <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />me we áalyele mu Mufulu a Ngili mu muŋma a taara a bihi Dabvide, musala a we.» Nde ályele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">«Mu emakye mansie mali kunsa yaŋã-yaŋã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">ya bikaana bili mu osa mamfwunu ma magwene a mupfunu?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Mikogho mi nsie mili yeelee mu odzwana mvulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">ya bamfumu baatemene mu emõ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">mu odzwana a Mfumu ya mu odzwana a Kriste a nde.»<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />«Mu engaŋma, Erode ya Ponse Pilate baabvuŋunu mu bvulu li. Ya emõ ya baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, ya ekaana kii Isarayele, bo baabvuŋunu mu odzwana a musala a we wu a ngili Yiisu, wu ámaana we. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Bo baasi ti myehene mi ótswama otsyiri kwogho ya bitsimi bi we mikeele. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Ya mu matala ma Mfumu, mono miŋaana mu bihi, ya gwa basala ba we kana lwohono mu otsala nsia a ndagha a we. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Labala kwogho e we mpaala baara badzughu ya bilyimi ya mandagha maa okiŋimi bimoŋono mu nkwumu a Yiisu, musala a we wu a ngili.»<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Bu bamana osamana Nzaami, ebini ki bábvuŋunu bo ényiŋĩ. Nzaami áluhu bo bwohono mu Mufulu a Ngili ya bo bábwi otsala nsia a ndagha a Nzaami ya kana.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Banga-a-kana babvughu emõ bi bali a bye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Mpwumu a ba bási kana yíli mukolo mumõ ya muwumunu mumõ. Ka óli a mbwuru wu áakalyele ti bilogho bi nde bibi ndaa ndeme o, byehene bi báli a bo bíli bibi ebvughu. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Mu lileene li linene, bantumu bákasa esala kii bumpughulu mu osighili o Mfumu Yiisu mu lipfu, ya bwehe bu bunene búli ŋa yulu a bo bwohono. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Ŋa kara li bo, ka óli a mbwuru wu áakagwene a elogho o. Mu kuulu, bo bwohono ba báli a manseghe bwunu-we manzo, bákatyeghe mo, bákagya a nzi yi a bi bákatyeghe, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />ya bákatwulu yo ŋa nkulu a bantumu. Ya bákakaba kunda nswe mbwuru-mbwuru bwunu a bu oli nzala a nde.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Dzidzefe mu-Lebvite wu a bvulu lili Syipere, wu ókata bantumu «Baranabase», mbaala ti, «wu aakagwa bukyini», <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />átyeghe nseghe yi áli a yo ya áyagwa nzi yi ábagha kundaa bantumu.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ananyase ya Safira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Lo baghala mumõ, wu a nkwumu Ananyase, emõ ya Safira mukala a nde, bátyeghe ndaama a nsie a bo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Nde ágwihini ya mukala a nde mu osweghe ndaama a nzi mu yi bábagha bo, ábiri ndaama yi ásyili ya ágwi yo kundaa bantumu. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Piere ályele kundaa nde ti: «Ananyase, mu emakye we aanyaã Satana asomo mu mukolo a we, mpaala we pfiri Mufulu a Ngili ya we sweghe ndaama a nzi yi a aatyeghe we ndaama a nsie? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Nsomo we tyeghe ndaama a nsie yo yiili yi a ndaa we. Ŋa aatyeghe we yo, we aali a bumpoholo mu osalala nzi a we bu dzyi. Bu bunu-a-bo we aabagha bitsimi bi bibi bi? We ka aapfiri baara o, lo Nzaami we aapfiri.» <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananyase bu agyughu ndagha oyo, ábwi ya ákpi. Bo bwohono ba bágyughu ndagha oyo bábagha nzalamweẽ yi alagha . <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Bampala bu batemene, bádzyi ebyimi, bábiri kye mu oyidzyighi.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Ŋa mbihi-a-bele a matala matere, mukala a Ananyase áyasomo omo, gwene osoolo ndagha yi áabwi. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Piere áfwulu nde ti: «Lyele me, yi me nzi yi liityeghe be ndaama a nsie?» Nde ábvuhulu ti: «Eẽ, me yo!» <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Piere ályele kundaa nde ti: «Bunu-abo be likughu ogwihini mu otsihi Mufulu a Mfumu? Gyughu, ba baafi ku odzyighi mulumu a we ayi ŋa muŋma a nzo, ya bo bali mu obiri wehe si!» <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Ŋaana oŋo, nde ábwi ŋa myili mi Piere ya ákpi. Bampala bu basomo, bámono nde ákpi, bábiri nde mu oyidzyighi nde ŋa bele a mulumu a nde. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Libwunu li Nzaami lwohono ya bo bwohono ba bágyughu mandagha mamo bábagha nzalamweẽ yi alagha.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bantumu basi mandagha malagha maa okiŋimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Bantumu bákasa bilyimi ya mandagha maa okiŋimi malagha ŋa kara li baara. Banga-a-kana bwohono bu bagwihini, bo bákabvuŋunu ŋa eluru e nzo a nzaami ki baakata ti kii Salomõ. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Mu baara baala nkini ali ka bási kana o, ka óli a mbwuru si mumõ wu áabagha bukyini mu osomo mu kaba li banga-a-kana o, ngu okala ti baara bákabili bubwe mu bo. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Lo ŋa yulu oŋo, mampwumu ma babaghala ya mama bakaha ba bákasa kana mu Mfumu mákapfini. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Baara bákapaha babyele mu minsagha, ya bákalaha bo ŋa yulu a bikala ya ŋa yulu a malaba, mpaala ŋa ooluru Piere, edzyimi-a-dzyimi e nde ebuluberene a si mumõ mu bo. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Mampwumu ma baara mákafa mu mabvulu ma mábehene ya Yerusaleme, mákayabiri babyele ya ba báli a mifulu mi mibi. Ya bo bwohono bákadzughu.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamwehẽ bantumu kimini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Mfumu a bangaa ba nzaami ya ba báli emõ ya nde, kaba li ba-Saduseyẽ bátemene mu ogyighili ndagha. Bo áli balwulu mu musogho. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Bo básyimi bantumu ya bálo bo mu boloko lili baara bwohono. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Lo mu mpyibi, ngye-yulu a Mfumu ádzubulu bidzughubu bi boloko, ápaha bo ku mbala ya ályele kundaa bo ti: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />«Ligye, ya bu litemene munsa nzo a nzaami, liluo baara mandagha mwohono mama bumweẽ bu bunyaghara ba.» <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Bo bu bagyughu obo, epala-epala básomo mu nzo a nzaami ya bábwi oluo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Mu obo, mfumu a bangaa ba nzaami ya babo ba báli ya nde, báti ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife mbili ya mfwunu a baana ba Isarayele, ya bágweghe baara ku boloko mu oyigwolo bantumu. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Lo basala bu bayito ku boloko, bo ka bámono bo omo o, ya bu bayabvughuru, bátwoho nsia, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />ya bályele ti: «Bihi liiyibagha boloko li bágyighili okuru, ya bankyele ba baatemene ŋa bidzughubu bi lo. Lo bu lidzubulu lo, bihi ka liimono si mbwuru mu kara o.» <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Mfumu a bankyele ba nzo a nzaami ya bamfumu ba bangaa ba nzaami, bu bagyughu ndagha oyo, bákiŋimi ku olagha ya bábwi obili ti yi nsa ndagha? <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Mbwuru mumõ áyalyele kundaa bo ti: «Ligyughu! Baara ba liilo be mu boloko bali munsa nzo a nzaami ya bali mu okaluo baara.»<verse eid="ACT 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Mu obo, mfumu a bankyele ba nzo a nzaami ágyene, emõ ya bambumbulu ba nde, mu oyigwolo bantumu. Báyabiri bo, lo ka mu mpini o, buulu bo báli a nzalamweẽ a baara, mfangolo bakaha bo mameẽ. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Bu bayabiri bo, bálamana bo ŋa nkulu a ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife. Mfumu a bangaa ba nzaami ábwi ogwa bo bifwulu, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Bihi ka liitswi be mikele mu onyaã ofiriluo mu nkwumu yi o? Ya limono, be liiluhu Yerusaleme mu maluo ma be ya be lidzyi otwulu lipfu li mbwuru munde ŋa yulu a mitswi mi bihi!» <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Piere ya bantumu babake bábvuhulu ti: «Bihi lifaana osa litumu li Nzaami, lo ka lili baara o. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Nzaami a bataara ba bihi aasiili Yiisu wu liidzwi be, bu liikomo nde ŋa yulu a muti. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Nzaami aaseene nde mu lileene li nde, mpaala akala Mfumu ya Mubvwuhu, mu kuulu baara ba Isarayele bagyiŋi mayele, ya babagha kolokolo a masumu ma bo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Ya bihi lili bampughulu mu mandagha mamo, bihi ya Mufulu a Ngili wu oogwi Nzaami kundaa babo ba baakasa litumu li nde.»<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife bu egyughu mandagha mamo, kye élwulu mu nkehe ya ésagha odzwa bantumu. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Lo mumõ mu ba-Faridzyẽ, nkwumu a nde Ngamalyele, muluo mikyene wu ookagwa baara bwohono budziri, bu atemene ŋa kara li ekwuru, áluomo ti bapaha bantumu ku mbala mu mana matala, <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />ya nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Baara ba Isarayele, lisa mayele mu ma lidzyi be ogyighili kundaa baara ba! <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Buulu, ka oli edzighi o, mbwuru wu a nkwumu Tewudase aayapala. Nde aakamoŋono ti nde mbwuru wu bvulu mupfunu, ya mutala a baara ba baakanama nde ali ku bele a nkama-na (400). Lo mu matala ma baadzwi nde, baara bwohono ba baakanama nde baatsaŋama ya emvuŋunu ekye eekpi. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Ŋa mbihi a nde, Yuda musi Ngalile, aayamoŋono mu bitsughu bibi osono mankwumu mu osoolo mutala a baara. Baara balagha baakanama nde. Lo ndehe si aakpi, ya baara bwohono ba baakanama nde baatsaŋama. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Mu matala ma, me ndyele kundaa be ti: Ka linama mandagha ma baara ba o, ya linyaã bo bagye. Mu kuulu, kala ti ndagha yi ya esala ki kundaa baara biifi, lo sa bidzimini. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Lo kala ti bye kundaa Nzaami biifi, be ka likughu odzihibi bye o. Ka lisagha odzwana ya Nzaami o!» Emvuŋunu ki ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife égyughu Ngamalyele. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Bu bati bantumu mbili, bákubu bo nswanswa ya bálighi bo mu ofiribili mu nkwumu a Yiisu, ya bányaã bo.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Bantumu bámara ŋa nkulu a ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife, bágyene mu esee, buulu Nzaami ámono ti bo áli bakughu mu omono mpara mu nkooro nkwumu a Yiisu, <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />ya nswe etsughu mu nzo a nzaami ya munsa manzo, bo bákaluo Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Yiisu-Kriste, ku ogwene okolo.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Baswolo babaghala nsaama mu obaha bantumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mu bitsughu bibye, mutala a binduono ápfini ku olagha. Ba-Dzwife ba bákabili ndiŋi yi a ba-Ngereke bábwi oŋuŋunu mu ba-Dzwife baba mu Isarayele ba bákameŋene bapfiili ba bo ba bakaha mu matala ma bákakaba bi-odza bibi nswe etsughu. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Bantumu kwumu ya buolo (12) bábvughu mpwumu a binduono yohono, ya bályele kundaa bo ndiri: «Ka oli bubwe o ti bihi linyaã okaluo ndagha a Nzaami mu osala esala kii okakaba bi-odza. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Mu obo baana ba taara, liswolo ŋa kara li be babaghala nsaama ba bali a bumpughulu bu bubwe, ba bálwulu mu Mufulu ya bunsughu, bihi sa ligwa bo esala ekye. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Lo bihi sa lisa mukama mu okabuono ya mu okasala esala kii oluo mandagha ma Nzaami.» <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Mpwumu a baara yohono yíkihi etsimi ekye. Básuolo Etiene, baghala wu áli a kana ya álwulu mu Mufulu a Ngili, Filipe, Porokore, Nikanore, Timõ, Paremenase ya Nikola munde wu a ku Antyose, wu áasomo Nzaami a ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Bágyi a bo ŋa nkulu a bantumu. Bantumu básamana mu bo ya bánaŋa bo myaã.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ndagha a Nzaami yíkabvulu otsaŋama, ya mutala a binduono ákapfini ku olagha ku Yerusaleme, ya mpwumu a bangaa ba nzaami yi nene yíkasa kana mu Yiisu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basyimi Etiene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Etiene áli alwulu mu bwehe ya mu lileene. Nde ákasa mandagha maa okiŋimi ya bilyimi bii okiŋimi ŋa kara li baara. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Ndaama a baara baba nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife yi baakata ti Nzo a bankana ba bali bunya-nyaã, baba ku Sirene, baba ku Aledzandiri ya baba ku Silisi lili Adzi, bábwi osa munsoho ya Etiene. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Lo bo ka bákakughu otemene o ŋa nkulu a mandagha mama bunsughu ma ókagwa nde Mufulu mu obili. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Mu obo, bo bágwi baara nzi mpaala balyele ti: «Bihi liigyughu nde mu okatswagha Moyidze ya Nzaami.» <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Bo bátyihi baara, bakwuru ba babaghala ya baluo-mikyene. Bo bu bayato, básyimi Etiene ya babiri nde ŋa nkulu a Mfwunu a ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Bo bátehebe bampughulu baba mpya ba bályele ti: «Baghala wu ka li mu okakolo o mu okalyele bubi mu ebini kii ngili [ki] ya mu mikyene mi Moyidze. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Bihi liigyughu nde mu okalyele ti Yiisu wu, wu a ku Nadzarete sa atsala ebini ki ya sa osobo ekulu ki ósihi bihi Moyidze.» <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Bo bwohono ba bábwi-nsini mu Mfwunu a ekwuru, bu batuunu nde mihi, bámono edzili ki Etiene éli ti anga kii ngye-yulu.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Etiene bili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Mfumu a bangaa ba nzaami áfwulu Etiene ti: «Mandagha mamo mali mama ngaŋma?» <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Etiene ábvuhulu ti: «Baana ba taara a me ya bataara ba me, ligyughu! Nzaami wu a nsia ámoŋono kundaa Abarahame taara a bihi, ŋa áli ku Medzopotami, nsomo nde ayikala ku Arane. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Ya nde ályele kundaa Abarahame ti: “Pala mu nsie a we, sihi dzumu li we, ya gye ku nsie oyo yi akala aansuo me we”. <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Mu obo, nde ápala mu nsie yi a Bakaledeẽ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekaana ki ebvulu a baara mu nsie yi a Babilone.</char></note>, átwu ku Arane. Ŋa mbihi a lipfu li taara a nde, Nzaami ábiri nde ku nsie oyo, mu lili mu okakala be mu matala ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Nzaami ka ágwi nde pfa si limõ mu nsie yi o, si ebini kii otwulu bitaama o, lo ásiini a nde mu ogwa nde nsie yi, ya musyi a dzumu li nde mpaala yikala pfa li bo. Mu matala mamo, Abarahame nkini ka áli a mwana o. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Nzaami ályele kundaa nde ndiri: “Musyi a dzumu li we sa ayikala mu nsie yi bunzyi, oko sa bakirili bo bankana ya sa bamwehẽ bo kimini mu nkama-na (400) yi mibvu”. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Nzaami áfirilyele ti: “Me, me sa ndamana ekaana ekye ki eekirili bo bankana. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, bo sa bapala, ya sa bakabuono me ŋa ebini ki”. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Nzaami áti endughu ya nde mu elyimi ki ásohobo nde nzo a mbaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ásohobo nde nzo a mbaa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">baatsyiri nde musuru.</char></note>, ya mu matala ma áburu nde Idzake, nde ásohobo nde nzo a mbaa mu etsughu kii mpuomo, ya Idzake ási bumõ kundaa Dzakobe, ya Dzakobe kundaa bankagha-kwuru kwumu ya buolo (12).»<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />«Bankagha-kwuru bámono Dzidzefe mukolo mubi, ya bátyeghe nde kundaa baara, ya baara babo bábiri nde ku Edzipite. Lo Nzaami áli ya nde. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />Nzaami ákwulu Dzidzefe mu mpara a nde yohono, ya ágwi nde bwehe ya bunsughu ŋa nkulu a Faraõ, mukogho a Edzipite, wu áatwulu nde mfumu wu munene mu Edzipite, ya mu nzo a nde yohono. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Munzyala ásomo mu Edzipite yohono ya mu Kaana. Mpara yíli yilagha, ya bataara ba bihi ka báfirikabagha bi-odza o. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Dzakobe bu agyughu ti ku Edzipite óli a bele, nde ágweghe bataara ba bihi mu mukubu wu a nsomo. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Mu mukubu wu a myele, Dzidzefe ásuo nyuru kundaa banaana ba nde, ya Faraõ ásoolo dzumu li nde. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Dzidzefe ágweghe bayigwolo taara a nde Dzakobe ya dzumu li nde lwohono. Bo báli baara makwumu-nsaama ya bataana (75). <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Dzakobe ákumunu ku Edzipite, ákpi oko, bumõ si ya bataara ba bihi. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Bábiri miwehe mi bo ku bula bubu Sisyeme ya bádzyighi mye mu mpyeme yi óswumu Abarahame mu nzi kundaa baana ba Emore ku Sisyeme.»<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />«Buulu matala ma ookeele misiini mi ósi Nzaami kundaa Abarahame máyabehene, ekaana e bihi épfini ya éburunu mu Edzipite, <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />tee mu matala ma óbyala mukogho mukimi [mu Edzipite] wuulu ka ásoolo Dzidzefe o. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Mukogho munde ápfiri ekaana e bihi, ámwehẽ bataara ba bihi kimini. Nde átumu bo mu mpini bakatsili baana babo ba babwihi, mu kuulu banyaã obaŋa. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Me mu ena ekye báburu Moyidze, nde áli mubwe ŋa mihi mi Nzaami. Bátsyaha nde mu bangoono batere mu nzo a taara a nde. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Ya bu batsili nde, mwana a Faraõ wu mukaha átolo nde, ya ákwuhu nde ti anga mwana wu áburu ndeme. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Moyidze ágyighi maluo mama bunsughu bwohono mama basi Edzipite. Ya áli a lileene mu mbiili ya mu bigyighili bi nde. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Ŋa ákuhu nde bamvulu makwumu-mana (40), nde ábagha bitsimi mu oyimono baana ba taara a nde, baana ba Isarayele. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Nde ámono musi Edzipite wu áakamwehẽ mumõ mu basi Isarayele mpara. Nde ábaha ya ákala musi Isarayele ya ádzwi musi Edzipite. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Nde ákatsimi ti baana ba taara a nde sa babaghala ti mu nde Nzaami aabvwuhu bo. Lo bo ka bábaghala o. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Ŋa mbihi a etsughu ekye, Moyidze áyimono baara buolo ba bákadzwana. Nde ásagha obvurulu egyeẽ ya edzuunu ŋa kara li bo ya ályele kundaa bo ti: “Mu emakye be lili mu okasa bubi be a be? Buta be lili baana ba taara mumõ!” <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Munde wu ákamwehẽ nganda mpara ábihi ogyughu Moyidze ya ályele kundaa nde ti: “Nande aatwulu we mfumu ya nsughu-a-lamana mu bihi? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />We me dzyi odzwa ti bu aadzwi we musi Edzipite matsighi?” <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Moyidze bu agyughu ndagha oyo, ábara ya áyikala ku nsie yi a Madyane, oko nde áburu baana buolo ba babaghala.»<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />«Mibvu makwumu-mana (40) bu mikughu, ngye-yulu ámoŋono kundaa nde munsa mule a mbaa wu eti-ti, ku syehe lili munguo wu a Sinayi. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Moyidze ákiŋimi mu mandagha ma ámono nde, ya bu ayabehene mpaala agyighili otala, nde ágyughu likyi li Mfumu li lílyele kundaa nde ti: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />“Me ndi Nzaami a bataara ba we, Nzaami a Abarahame, Idzake ya Dzakobe”. Kunsa enkwughu, Moyidze ka áleene otala o. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Ya Mfumu ályele kundaa nde ti: “Maha mapaapa mu myili mi we, mu kuulu ebini ki aatemene we, eli ebini kii ngili. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Me aamono kimini li ekaana e me ku Edzipite, me aangyughu misyama mi bo. Ya me aankumunu mu okwulu bo. Mu matala ma, gye, me ngweghe we ku Edzipite”».<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />«Wu me Moyidze wu bábihi bo ŋa áli bályele ti: “Nande aatwulu we mfumu ya nsughu-a-lamana?” Lo me nde Nzaami ágweghe ti mfumu ya mukwulu. Nzaami átumu nde mu nzili a ngye-yulu wu ámoŋono kundaa nde mu eti-ti. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Me nde áapaha bo mu nsie yi a Edzipite mu mandagha mama okiŋimi ya bilyimi, ŋa Mubu wu a Bie ya ku syehe, mu mibvu makwumu-mana (40). <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Me nde, Moyidze áalyele kundaa baana ba Isarayele ti: “Nzaami sa apaha mu nkooro a be, ŋa kara li baana ba taara a be, mubighili mumõ ti anga me”. <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Mu matala ma óli emvuŋunu ku syehe, me nde áli aatemene mu okagyughu ya bataara ba bihi mi ókalyele ngye-yulu ku yulu a munguo wu a Sinayi. Nde ágyagha mandagha mama bumweẽ mu ogwa mo kundaa bihi. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Lo bataara ba bihi ka bákihi osa litumu li nde o, bo bábihi nde ya mikolo mi bo míbvughuru ku Edzipite. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Bo bályele kundaa Aarõ ti: “Gyighili bihi banzaami ba baadzyara ŋa nkulu a bihi mu kuulu bihi ka lisoolo o bu oobwana Moyidze wu, nde wu aapaha bihi mu nsie yi a Edzipite”. <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Mu bitsughu bibye bo bátsulu etyeghe mu efaana kii pulu li ngoomo. Ya bádzwi nyama mu ogwa mukaba kundaa kye ya bási kyiri mu nkooro a etyeghe ekye ki ótsulu myaã mi bo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Nzaami átyeghe bo mbihi ya ányaã bo bakasamana mikaã mimi mayulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mikaã mimi mayulu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">me baŋomaŋomo, ngoono ya tala.</char></note>, bwunu a bu básono mu mukaana a mibighili ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“Nzo a Isarayele, mu mibvu makwumu-mana (40), kundaa me be líigwi banyama ya mikaba ku syehe?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Be líibiri ebvulu e Moloke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">ya ŋomaŋomo a Rayifã, nzaami a be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">bityeghe bibye bi lígyighili be mu okasamana bye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Mu obo, me sa mbiri be ku bunkana ku mbihi a Babilone”».<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />«Ku syehe, bataara ba bihi báli a ebvulu kii bumpughulu baa ogwihini, bwunu a bu ótumu munde wu áabili kundaa Moyidze, ti agyighili ebvulu mu efaana ki ásuo kundaa nde. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Bataara ba bihi bu bakihi kye, básohobo kye mu litumu li Dzodzuwe mu nsie yi ógwi bo Nzaami, ŋa mbihi a ŋa ábyi nde bikaana bibye ŋa mihi mi bo, tee mu matala ma Dabvide. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Nde ábagha bwehe ŋa busu bu Nzaami ya áluomo muswa wu obagha nzo yi a nzaami a Dzakobe. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Lo me Salomõ áatwu nzo a nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Lo Wu Ensoõ-yulu ka aakakala mu manzo ma ótwu myaã mi baara o.» Obo me bu ólyele mubighili ti:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />«Yulu lili likubu li me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">ya nsie yili nkara a myili mi me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Nki nzo be liitwu me, bu olyele Mfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">ya ŋa nki ebini me akala aangwumu?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Bunu, ka oli myaã mi me míigyighili bilogho byehene bibye o?»<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />«Be lili baara banga a mutswi-mpini, banga a mikolo ngyi ya matswi-nkyihi. Mu matala mwohono, be liikabihi Mufulu a Ngili, be lili ti anga bataara ba be! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Nki mubighili bataara ba be bágwene omwehẽ kimini? Bo bádzwi ba bátswama oyatwoho nsia a ogya o Wu-a-Nsumu, munde wu liityeghe ya liidzwi be mu matala ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Be ba lígyagha Mikyene mu nzili a bangye-yulu, lo be ka liikasalala mye o.»<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lipfu li Etiene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Baara ba mfwunu a ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife bu bagyughu mandagha mamo, bo bábagha nkehe yi alagha ya bákadza myini mu nkooro a nde. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Lo Etiene bu áli wu aalwulu mu Mufulu a Ngili, átala ku yulu ya ámono bunkiri bu Nzaami ya Yiisu mu mukiri ŋa ngo-kwogho e Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Nde ályele ti: «Ligyughu! Me ndi mu okamono mayulu bwaha, ya Mwana a mbwuru átemene ŋa ngo-kwogho e Nzaami.» <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Bo bákehe bingubu bi binene, bákyi matswi ma bo, ya mu emvughu bo bwohono bágyighiri mu nyuru a Etiene. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Bo bápaha nde mu bvulu ya bádzwi nde mu mameẽ. Ya bampughulu básuhu binkuru bi bo ŋa myili mi mumpala mumõ, nkwumu a nde Sawule. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Mu matala ma bákakaha nde mameẽ, Etiene ákabuono bu: «Mfumu Yiisu, gyagha mufulu a me!» <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Ya bu akunu mabuo ŋa nsie, nde ákehe engubu ti: «Mfumu, Mfumu, sa bo kolokolo mu lisumu li!» Bu alyele obo, ewumu ésughu ya nde ákpi.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Sawule mwehẽ Libwunu kimini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Sawule áli mumõ mu babo ba bámono ti lipfu li Etiene ndagha yi mbwe. Mu etsughu kyini ekye, bámwehẽ Libwunu li Nzaami lili Yerusaleme kimini li lilagha. Ya bo bwohono ba báli mu Libwunu li Nzaami bátsaŋama, bágyene ku Yude ya ku Samari. Yini a bantumu baasyili mu Yerusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Lo baara banga-a-enzaami kii engaŋma bádzyighi Etiene ya bálili nde ku olagha. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Ya Sawule ákabulutsala Libwunu li nzaami, nde ákabulusomo mu manzo, ákabulusyimi babaghala ya bakaha, ya ákayilo bo mu boloko.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipe tsala Nsia yi Mbwe mu etsulu e nsie kii Samari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Babo ba bátsaŋama bákabulutsala Nsia yi Mbwe yi a ndagha a Nzaami omo mwohono mu bákabulubara bo. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Obo me buulu, Filipe ákumunu mu bvulu limõ lili mu Samari, nde ábwi otsala nsia a Kriste. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Emõ, mampwumu ma baara mákatyeghe matswi mu mandagha ma ókaluo Filipe, ŋa bákagyughu ya bákamono bo bilyimi bii okiŋimi bi ákasa nde. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Mu engaŋma, mifulu mi mibi milagha mi míli mu baara, míkapala mu okabulukehe mingili. Balagha ba ókpi binama ya banga-a-bipfwumu mu myili bákadzughu. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Mu obo, baara baba mu bvulu lilo, báli kunsa esee ki elagha.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Ankoho, áli oli a baghala mumõ mu bvulu lili Samari, nkwumu a nde Simõ. Nde átswama okakala munsa bvulu lilo. Nde áli ngaa-a-mpaana, ya baara baba mu Samari bákakiŋimi mu mi ákagyighili nde. Ya ndeme ákatsimi ti nde mbwuru wu munene. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Ya baara bwohono, obaana bakwuru tee bike-bike, bákasa kana mu nde, ya bákalyele ti: «Baghala wu me lileene li Nzaami, li baakalyele ti “Lileene li Linene”.» <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Ya bo bákasa kana mu nde, mu kuulu mana edzighi, nde ákabulugyighili mandagha maa okiŋimi mu mpaana a nde. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Lo bu basi kana mu Filipe wu ákaluo Nsia yi Mbwe yi a empu e Nzaami ya nkwumu a Yiisu-Kriste, babaghala ya bakaha bákakihi oboghoro. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simõ ndeme si ási kana ya báboghoro nde. Nde ákanama Filipe ya ákiŋimi, bu ákabulumono bilyimi ya bimaã bii okiŋimi bi ókabulusa Filipe.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piere ya Dzã mu etsulu e nsie kii Samari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Bantumu ba básyili ku Yerusaleme bu bagyughu ti basi Samari baakihi ndagha a Nzaami, bágweghe Piere ya Dzã kundaa bo. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Bu bato oko, básamana mu basi Samari mpaala bagyagha Mufulu a Ngili. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Mu engaŋma, Mufulu a Ngili nkini ali ka ámaabwa mu mbwuru si mumõ mu bo o, yini a oboghoro báboghoro bo mu nkwumu a Mfumu Yiisu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Oŋo, Piere ya Dzã bánaã bo myaã ŋa yulu a mitswi, ya bo bágyagha Mufulu a Ngili. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simõ bu amono ti bantumu bákagwa Mufulu mu onaã myaã ŋa yulu a mutswi, nde ágwi bo nzi, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />ya ályele ti: «Ligwa mehe si lileene lilo, mpaala nswe munde wu aanãa me myaã ŋa yulu a mutswi, nde agyagha Mufulu a Ngili.» <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Lo Piere ályele kundaa nde ti: «Nyaã we ya nzi a we lipfighili! Mu kuulu we aatsimi ti we kughu oswumu mu nzi ekaba ki ookagwa Nzaami ku o bwunu. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Mu ogyighili otala, we ka li wu a kaba li bihi o, ya we ka li a pfa mu esala ki o. Mu kuulu mukolo a we ka li nsumu ŋa nkulu a Nzaami o. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Mu obo, gyiŋi mayele mu bubi bu we, ya samana Mfumu, nkini-a-nki bakughu osa we kolokolo mu bitsimi bi biigyi we ŋa mukolo. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Mu engaŋma, me ndi mu omono ti we li a bubi bubu nkala mu mukolo, ya we li nkana a masumu.» <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simõ ábvuhulu ti: «Be beme lisamana Mfumu mu nkooro a me, mpaala mandagha ma liilyele be manyaã obwa mu me.» <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Piere ya Dzã, bu bamana osuo bumpughulu bu Mfumu ya otsala nsia a ndagha a Nde, bábvughuru ku Yerusaleme. Mu nzili, bo bákabulutsala Nsia yi Mbwe mu mala malagha mu Samari.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipe ya musala wu a ku Etyopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Ngye-yulu a Mfumu ályele kundaa Filipe ti: «Temene, ya gye ku nkolo yi a ku Sude, mu nzili yi aakamara ku Yerusaleme ya yiikakumunu ku Ngadza. Baara ka baafirikaluru mu nzili oyo o.» <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Bu atemene, nde ágyene. Ankoho, baghala mumõ wu bágwogholo, wu a ku Etyopi, musala wu munene wu a Kandase, mfumu a busini bwohono bu ngasa a basi Etyopi, áli agyi ku Yerusaleme mu oyabuono Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Nde áli ayi mu okabvughuru. Nde ábwi-nsini munsa syare<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">syare </char></note> li nde, mu okabulutaã mukaana a mubighili Edzayi. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Mufulu a Ngili ályele kundaa Filipe ti: «Gye yibagha syare lilo.» <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Bu abara ntyini tee oŋo, Filipe ágyughu nde mu okataã mukaana a mubighili Edzayi, ya nde áfwulu nde ti: «Bunu, we li mu okabaghala mi li mu okataã we?» <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Nde ábvuhulu ti: «Bunu-abo me aambaghala kala ti mbwuru ka gwi me mbaala a mo o?» Ya nde ályele Filipe akumu ya abwa-nsini ŋa bele a nde. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Etsulu e ndagha a Nzaami ki ákabulutaã nde me ki:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">«Nde áli ti endoomo ki bali mu okabiri ku ebini ki baakadzwa bibuolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">ya ti anga mwana a endoomo wu gwene a likyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">ŋa nkulu a wu li mu okakye nde mfu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">nde ka aadzubulu muŋma o!<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Kunsa okughulu o nde, baasi nde muyala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">nde ka aabagha bwuu o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">nande akala aabili mu eseene e nde?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Mu kuulu baamaha laama li nde ŋa nsie.»<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Musala wu munene wu a Etyopi munde, áfwulu Filipe ti: «Kolokolo a we, lyele me, mubighili mu na ali mu okabili obo? Mu ndeme bwunu we mu mbwuru mukimi?» <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Mu obo, Filipe ábaana mu mi básono mu Mukaana wu a Ngili, áluo nde Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Yiisu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Bu bákagye mu nzili, báto ŋa mbughu yi áali a madza, ya Musala wu munene wu a Etyopi ályele ti: «Mono madza moŋo! Emakye eekahaba me mu obagha liboghoro?» [<verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipe ályele kundaa nde ti: «Kala ti we si kana mu mukolo a we ndehene, we kughu obagha liboghoro». Musala wu munene ábvuhulu ti: «Me ndi a kana ti Yiisu-Kriste li mwana a Nzaami.»] <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Nde átehebe syare, bo bansa buolo básughuru mu madza, ya Filipe áboghoro nde. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Bu bapala mu madza, Mufulu a Mfumu ábulubiri Filipe ya musala wu munene wu a Etyopi ka áfirimono nde o. Lo nde ánama bula bu nzili a nde mu esee. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipe áyipala ku Adzote mu okabulutsala Nsia yi Mbwe mu mabvulu mwohono ma áluru nde, tee bu áyito nde ku Sedzare.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Sawule gyiŋi mayele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Mu matala mamo, Sawule wu áakaŋaana odzwa binduono bi Mfumu, áyiluomo kundaa mfumu a bangaa ba nzaami, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />mikaana mimi manzo mama lisamana ma ba-Dzwife mama mu bvulu lili Damase. Oko, kala ti nde mono baara ba baakanama nzili a Mfumu, babaghala bwunu we bakaha, nde akuru bo minkana, ya ayabiri bo ku Yerusaleme.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Bu ákagye mu nzili, nde ábehene ya bvulu lili Damase. Ensihibi, otsyeme ku ófi ku yulu óbwi mu nde ya odzyi nde. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Nde ábwi ŋa nsie, ágyughu likyi li líkalyele nde ti: «Sawule, Sawule, mu emakye we li mu okamwehẽ me kimini?» <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Nde áfwulu ti: «Mfumu, we nande?» Likyi líbvuhulu ti: «Me ndi Yiisu, ngu me we li mu okamwehẽ kimini. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Lo temene, somo munsa bvulu, ya sa balyele we mandagha mafaana we ogyighili.» <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Baara ba bákadzye ya nde, bátemene ya bákwono otsughu ndagha mu nzalamweẽ. Bo bákagyughu likyi, lo ka bákamono wu áakabili o. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sawule átemene ya ádzubulu mihi, lo nde ka áfirikamono elogho si emõ o. Baara ba bákagye ya nde, bákwara nde mu kwogho ya básohobo nde mu bvulu lili Damase. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Oko nde ási bitsughu bitere biili nde omono we, odza we ya oŋma we.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Ku Damase óli a enduono etsyini, nkwumu a nde Ananyase. Mu limono Nzaami áti nde mbili: «Ananyase!» Nde ábvuhulu ti: «Mfumu, me ndindi!» <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mfumu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Gye mu munsagha wu baakata ti Wu a Nsumu, ya fwulu munsa nzo a Yuda, baghala wu a nkwumu Sawule musi Tarese. Nde li omo mu okasamana, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />ya mu bantaala, nde aamono baghala mutsyini, nkwumu a nde Ananyase wu áasomo mu nzo ya wu áanaã nde myaã ŋa yulu mutswi mpaala nde afirimono.» <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananyase ábvuhulu ti: «Mfumu, me áakangyughu baara balagha mu okabili mu baghala munde ya mu bubi bwohono bu aakasa nde kundaa baba ngili ba we mu Yerusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Ya bamfumu ba bangaa ba nzaami bágwi nde litumu lili osyimi baara bwohono ba baakasamana we.» <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Lo Mfumu ályele ti: «Gye kundaa mbwuru munde, mu kuulu nde li elwee ki aansuolo mu oyitsala Nsia a Nkwumu a me kundaa bikaana bibi gwene osoolo me, kundaa mikogho ya kundaa basi Isarayele. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Me, meme sa nsuo nde mpara yi afaana omono nde mu nkooro a nkwumu a me.»<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Ananyase ágyene, ásomo munsa nzo. Ya bu anaã nde myaã ŋa yulu a mutswi, ályele kundaa nde ti: «Sawule, mwana a taara a me, Mfumu gweghe me, Yiisu munde wu aamoŋono kundaa we mu nzili yi aakagya we, mu kuulu we firimono ya we lwulu mu Mufulu a Ngili.» <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ŋaana oŋo, bilogho bi bifaana ti anga makala ma nswi bíkogholo mu mihi mi nde ya nde ábaana ofirimono. Nde átemene ya báboghoro nde. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Ya bu amana odza, Sawule ábagha mpini mu nyuru.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Sawule tsala Nsia yi Mbwe ku Damase</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sawule áluhu mana bitsughu ya binduono bi Mfumu ku Damase. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Ŋaana oŋo, nde ábwi okabululuo mu manzo mama lisamana ma ba-Dzwife ti: Yiisu li Mwana a Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Baara bwohono ba bákagyughu nde bákakiŋimi ya bákalyele ti: «Ka oli nde wu áakamwehẽ ba baakasamana mu nkwumu a Yiisu kimini ku Yerusaleme o? Ya nde ka aagyi kunu mu osyimi bo ya obiri bo mu binkana kundaa bamfumu ba bangaa ba nzaami o?» <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Lo Sawule ákagwama ku oluru, ba-Dzwife baba ku Damase ka bákabagha yi baabili ŋa nkulu a nde o, ya nde ákasuo ti Yiisu me Kriste.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Bitsughu bilagha bu biluru, ba-Dzwife bákuru mfwunu yi odzwa nde. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Mpyibi ya mwiĩ, bo bákakebe mu miŋma mi ekagha kii bvulu kuulu badzwa nde. Lo Sawule ágyahaba mfwunu a bo. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Mu obo, mu mpyibi, binduono bi Sawule, bílo nde mu nkuru ya bísurulu nde ku ngulu a ekagha kii bvulu.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawule ku Yerusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Bu ato ku Yerusaleme, Sawule ásagha osomo mu kaba lili binduono, lo bo bwohono báli a nzalamweẽ a nde, ya ka bákasa kana o ti nde áli ayi enduono. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Baranabase ábiri nde kundaa bantumu ya ályele bo bu óbwana a Sawule Mfumu mu nzili a Damase, ya bu ábili nde kundaa Sawule. Ya bunu-a-bo, obaana ku Damase, nde ákabili ya kana lwohono mu nkwumu a Yiisu. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Obaana matala mamo, Sawule ákabulugye mu bibini byehene ya bo mu Yerusaleme, ya ákabulubili mu nkwumu a Mfumu ya kana. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Nde ákabili ya ákatsoho ya ba-Dzwife ba baakabili Engereke. Lo bo bákasagha odzwa nde. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Bandughu mu kana bu basoolo ndagha oyo, bábiri nde ku Sedzare, ya oko bo bágweghe nde ku Tarese.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Libwunu líli kunsa edzuunu mu bitsulu bi nsie byehene bibi Yude, Ngalile ya Samari. Mu libaha li Mufulu a Ngili, lo líkakulu mu mufulu, líkadzyara kunsa budziri bu Mfumu ya líkakulu mu mutala a baara.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piere dzuhu Ene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Obo me buulu Piere, wu áakabuludzie mu bitsulu byehene, ákumunu si kundaa baba ngili ba báli mu bula bubu Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Nde ámono baghala mutsyini wu óneŋene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">óneŋene </char><char style="ft" closed="false">obobo bwunu we okpa.</char></note> binama. Baghala munde ágyoŋomo ŋa yulu a laba mu mibvu mpuomo. Nkwumu a nde Ene. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Piere ályele kundaa nde ti: «Ene, Yiisu-Kriste aadzuhu we. Temene, ya fughuru ekala e we weme!» Mu likpa lyini lilo, nde ásaatemene. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Baara bwohono baba mu Lida ya baba ku elehe kii Syarone bu bamono obo, bo bási kana mu Mfumu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osighili o Dorokase mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Mu bvulu lili Yope, óli a enduono kii mukaha. Nkwumu a nde Tabita, mu Engereke «<char style="qt">Dorokase</char>», mbaala ti, «nsa». Nde ákagyighili mi mibwe ya ákabaha bawele. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Mu bitsughu bibye, nde ábyele ya ákpi. Bu baswagha ebyimi e nde, báyitwulu kye mu ngwumu a nzo yi a ku yulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Buulu Lida áli libehene ya Yope, binduono bigyughu ti Piere áli oŋo, bígweghe babaghala buolo mu oyibiŋini nde ya bíbuono nde ti: «Sa maswa, gya kundaa bihi!» <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Mu maswa Piere ágyene ya bo. Bu ato oko, bo bákuhubu nde ku ngwumu a nzo yi a ku yulu. Bapfiili bwohono ba bakaha bátemene ŋa nkulu a nde ya bábuulu elili, bákasuo nde binkuru bi bila ya binkuru bi baakalaha ŋa yulu bi ókatwu bo Dorokase ŋa aali nde mweẽ. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Piere ápaha baara bwohono ku mbala, ya bu akunu mabuo mu nsie, nde ábwi osamana. Ŋa mbihi, nde ákaghala ku óli ebyimi ya ályele ti: «Tabita, temene!» Tabita ádzubulu mihi, ya bu amono Piere, nde ásighili ábwi-nsini. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Piere ákwara nde mu kwogho ya átehebe nde. Ŋa nseele, nde áti baba ngili ya bapfiili mbili ya nde ásuo bo Dorokase wu a mweẽ. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Yope lwohono lígyughu ndagha oyo ya baara balagha bási kana mu Mfumu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Piere áluhu bitsughu bilagha ku Yope, mu nzo a Simõ, wu áakasa esala ki okagyighili bibaana bi banyama.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Koroneye tumu Piere agya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Ku bvulu lili Sedzare óli a baghala mutsyini, nkwumu a nde Koroneye, mfumu a mpwumu a bambumbulu nkama (100), yi baakata ti «mpwumu yi a Itali». <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Nde áli mbwuru wu bunsumu ŋa nkulu a Nzaami ya ákagwa nde budziri, emõ ya baara ba nzo a nde bwohono. Nde ákabaha bawele ba ba-Dzwife ku olagha ya ákasamana Nzaami matala mwohono. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Etsughu nga-emõ, mu tala lili matere ŋa mbihi a embehe, nde ágyighili omono mu limono ngye-yulu a Nzaami wu áyasomo mu nzo a nde ya wu áati nde mbili ti: «Koroneye!» <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Koroneye bu atala nde ku edzili, ábagha nzalamweẽ ya ábvuhulu nde ndiri: «Mfumu! Nki ndagha?» Ngye-yulu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Nsamana a we ya bikaba bi aakagwa we kundaa bawele, biito kundaa Nzaami, ya nde aalibili mweẽ mu we. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Mu matala ma, gweghe bambiŋini ku Yope, buulu bayabiri we Simõ wuulu nkwumu yi obili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nkwumu yi obili </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkwumu yi bumpala</char></note> Piere. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Nde li mu nzo a Simõ mukimi, munde wu áakasa esala ki okagyighili bibaana bi banyama ya aakakala ku mukogho a mubu.» <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Mu matala ma ógyene ngye-yulu wu ákabili ya nde, Koroneye áti basala ba nzo a nde buolo mbili ya mbumbulu mumõ wu áali a enzaami kii ngaŋma, wuulu edzighi ákasala kunsa litumu li nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Ya bu alyele bo mandagha mwohono ma ábwana a nde, nde ágweghe bo ku Yope.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Ŋa mbihi a etsughu ekye, ŋaala bo nkini ali mu okanama bula bu nzili a bo, bo bábehene ya bvulu, ya ku bele a matala mama embehe, Piere ákumu ku yulu a see li nzo lili eyala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">see li nzo lili eyala </char><char style="ft" closed="false">see li nzo li batwu mu ebagha kii eyala. Ku yulu a see lilo baara bákabwa nsini mu okamoŋo, mu okasamana ya mu okagwolo mpie mu nkonkolo.</char></note> mu oyisamana. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Lo nzala bu yifuru nde, nde ásagha bi-odza. Mu matala ma bákanaã nde bi-odza, nde ábagha limono. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Nde ámono yulu bwaha: Elogho etsyini ékayakumunu. Kye éli ti anga mupa a eko wu munene wu bákwara mu manto mansa mana wu áyabwa ŋa nsie. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Ŋa yulu a nde óli a banyama baba mawa-mawa: Banyama baba myili mina, ba baakagye mu etulu ya baŋmini. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Ya likyi lílyele kundaa nde ti: «Piere, temene, dzwa ya dza!» <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Piere ábvuhulu ti: «Mfumu! Si kala ka bunu! Mu bumweẽ bu me, me nkini ámaandza elogho kii nyara ya ki bási ngili o.» <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Likyi líbili kundaa nde mu sa lili ywolo ti: «Bi ootsehebe Nzaami, we, we ka kughu olyele ti bye bili bibi nyara o!» <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Ndagha oyo yímoŋono kundaa nde mansa matere, ya ŋa nseele, elogho ekye ésaabvughuru ku yulu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Piere ndeme ákasagha obaghala ndagha oyo yi ámono nde, lo nde ka ákakughu o. Mu matala maana mamo, baara ba ógweghe Koroneye, ba bákabulufwulu ku oli nzo a Simõ, báyato ŋa muŋma a nzo a nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Bo báti nde mbili ya báfwulu kala ti Simõ wu baakata ti Piere áli munsa nzo oyo. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Piere áli nkini mu okatsimi ndagha yi aamono nde, ya Mufulu a Ngili ályele kundaa nde ti: «Oli a babaghala batere ku ba bali mu okasagha we. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Mu obo, kumunu lili, bvughu nzili ya bo ku ogwene a okeŋe, mu kuulu, me aangweghe bo.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Piere ákumunu, ábvuŋunu ya baara babo. Nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Me ndindi. Mbwuru wu lili mu okasagha be ngu me. Mu nki ndagha be liiyatala me?» <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Bo bábvuhulu ti: «Koroneye, mfumu a mpwumu a bambumbulu nkama (100), mbwuru wu a bunsumu, wu aakagwa Nzaami budziri ya wuulu ba-Dzwife bwohono bali a bumpughulu bu bubwe mu nde, aagweghe bihi. Ngye-yulu wu a ngili aasuo kundaa nde ti nde ali faana ota we mbili ku nzo a nde mpaala agyughu mandagha ma aalyele we.» <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Oŋo Piere ágwi bo ebini kii ogyoŋomo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Ŋa mbihi a etsughu ekye, nde ágyene ya bo nzili mo. Ndaama a baara ba bákanama nde mu Yope bágyene ya nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Etsughu etsyini kii byele, bo báyito ku Sedzare. Koroneye wu áakakebe bo, áli ayi áti baara ba dzumu li nde ya bandughu ba nde mbili. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Mu matala ma óyito Piere, Koroneye áyibwana a nde ya ákunu mabuo ŋa nsie a myili mi nde mu ogwa nde mboro yi a budziri. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Lo Piere átehebe nde ya ályele ti: «Temene! Buta mehe si yini a mbwuru ndi.» <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Nde ásomo munsa nzo mu okabulubili ya nde. Omo, nde ámono baara balagha ba bábvuŋunu, <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />ya nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Be ligyighili osoolo ti mu mikyene mi ba-Dzwife, mu-Dzwife ka li a muswa wu osa endughu ya munzyi bwunu we ogyagha nde mu nzo a nde o. Lo kundaa me, Nzaami aayasuo me ti ka lifaana omono ti mbwuru wu li a nyara bwunu we nde aatsumunu ngili. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Me mu obo, we bu aatumu me ngya, me aangyi kwono ku makeŋe osa. Lo mu bu, me ndzyi osoolo mu nki ndagha be liitumu me ngya.» <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koroneye ágwi nde mvuru yi: «Bitsughu yini a bitere bimaaluru, mu tala lili matere ŋa mbihi a embehe, me aakansamana Nzaami munsa nzo a me. Ensihibi, mbwuru mutsyini wu áalaha binkuru bi bíkasehene, áyamoŋono ŋa nkulu a me, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />ya ályele kundaa me ti: “Koroneye! Nzaami aagyughu osamana o we ya nde ka aadzimini bikaba bi aakagwa we kundaa bawele nsimi o. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Me mu obo, gweghe bambiŋini ku Yope mpaala bayabiri we Simõ wuulu nkwumu yi obili Piere. Nde li mu okakala mu nzo a Simõ wu aakasala esala ki okagyighili bibaana bi banyama ya aakakala ku mukogho a mubu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Mu maswa, me aangweghe bambiŋini bayagwolo we, ya we aasi bubwe mu ogya kundaa bihi. Mu matala ma, bihi bwohono lili ŋa nkulu a Nzaami mu ogyughu mandagha ma oolyele we Mfumu mu oyatwoho kundaa bihi.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piere tsala Nsia yi Mbwe munsa nzo a Koroneye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Mu obo, Piere átsughu ndagha ya ályele ti: «Mu engaŋma, me aambaghala ti Nzaami ka li a munkabala o, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />ya ti mu bikaana byehene, nde aakakihi nswe munde wu aakagwa nde budziri ya aakasalala bunsumu bu nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Nde ágweghe Ndagha a nde kundaa basi Isarayele, Nsia yi Mbwe yi a edzuunu mu Yiisu-Kriste, wu li Mfumu a baara bwohono. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Be lisoolo ndagha yi aabwi, nsomo ku Ngalile, ŋa nseele mu Yude lwohono, ŋa mbihi a liboghoro li ókaluo Dzã. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Be lisoolo bunu-a-bo Nzaami ásughu lileene li Mufulu a Ngili mu Yiisu wu a ku Nadzarete. Nde aakabulusa bubwe omo mwohono mu ákaluru nde, nde ákadzuhu bwohono ba ósi dyabulu kunsa bunkana, mu kuulu Nzaami áli ya nde. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Ya bihi ba lili bampughulu mu esala e nde kyehene mu etsulu e nsie ki ba-Dzwife ya ku Yerusaleme. Munde wu baadzwi bo mu obaŋana ŋa yulu a kuruwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Lo Nzaami aasiili nde ŋa kara li ba bákpi mu etsughu kii bitere, ya aagwi nde muswa mu omoŋono <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />kundaa bampughulu ba ótswama osuolo Nzaami, kundaa bihi ba liikadza ya liikaŋma ya nde, ŋa mbihi a osighili o nde ŋa kara li ba bápki. Lo ka kundaa baara bwohono o. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Nde aagwi bihi litumu mu otsala nsia kundaa baara ya mu okala bampughulu ba ndagha yi: Me nde Nzaami aasuolo mu okala nsughu-a-lamana a baara baba mweẽ ya ba bákpi. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Me mu nde mibighili myehene míkabili ti: Nswe munde wu aasa kana mu nde, mu nkwumu a nde, sa abagha kolokolo a masumu ma nde.»<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mufulu a Ngili sughuru mu bikaana bibike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Piere áli nkini mu okabili, Mufulu a Ngili ábwi ŋa yulu a bo bwohono ba bákagyughu ndagha a Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Ba-Dzwife ba bákasa kana ba bánama Piere, bákiŋimi mu omono ti ekaba ki Mufulu a Ngili ki oogwi Nzaami, eetsaŋama tee kundaa bikaana bibi banzyi. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Mu kuulu, bo bákagyughu baara ba mu okabili mu mandiŋi ma bagwene osoolo bo ya okasyighi bunene bu Nzaami. Piere áfirilyele ti: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />«Baara ba baagyagha Mufulu a Ngili ti anga bihi-a-be, mbwuru kughu okahaba ti ka baboghoro bo mu madza o?» <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Nde ágwi litumu ti baboghoro bo mu nkwumu a Yiisu-Kriste. Ya bo báluomo kundaa nde afiriluhu mana bitsughu ya bo.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Piere ŋa nkulu a Libwunu lili ku Yerusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Bantumu ya bandughu mu kana ba báli ku Yude bágyughu ti baara baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, baakihi si Ndagha a Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Piere bu akumu ku Yerusaleme, ba-Dzwife ba bási kana mu Yiisu báyakumunu nde <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />ya bályele kundaa nde ti: «We aasomo mu nzo a ba bágwene osomo nzo a mbaa, ya we aali ya bo!» <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Obo me buulu Piere ásuo bo mandagha mwohono, bwunu a bu máluru: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />«Ŋa aandi me mu bvulu lili Yope, mu matala ma aakansamana me, me ámbagha limono, me áamono elogho éfi ku yulu ya ékayakumunu tee kundaa me. Kye éli ti anga mupa a eko wu munene wu bákwara mu manto mansa mana. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Me bu aangyili okehene kye, me aamono banyama ba nsie baba myili mina, banyama baba musuru, ba baakagye mu etulu ya ba baakapuŋumu mu yulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Ya me áangyughu likyi li lílyele kundaa me ti: “Piere temene, dzwa ya dza!” <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Me áambvuhulu ti: “Pele Mfumu! Si kala ka bunu. Mu kuulu mu bumweẽ bu me, elogho kii nyara ya ki bási ngili nkini ka émaasomo mu muŋma a me o.” <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Mu mukubu wu a buolo, likyi lífiribili ku yulu ti: “Elogho ki oosi Nzaami kii tse-tse, we ka lyele o ti kye eli kii nyara!” <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Ndagha oyo yímoŋono kundaa me mu mansa matere. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, elogho ekye ébvughuru ku yulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Mu matala maana mamo, babaghala batere ba báfi ku Sedzare mu oyagwolo me, báyato ŋa nzo yi líli bihi. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Mufulu a Ngili ályele me bu: “Gye ya bo, ka keŋe o.” Bandughu mu kana basemene ba baagyi ya me ŋa áli bagyene ya me. Ya bihi bwohono líisomo mu nzo a Koroneye. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Nde ályele me bu ámono nde ngye-yulu wu áyamoŋono munsa nzo a nde ya ályele nde ti: “Gweghe bambiŋini ku Yope mpaala bayabiri Simõ wu baakata ti Piere. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Nde sa alyele we mandagha ma maabvwuhu we ya nzo a we yohono.” <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Me bu mbaana obili, Mufulu a Ngili ásughuru ŋa yulu a bo ti bu ásughuru nde ŋa yulu a bihi mu ebaana. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Oŋo, me ándibili-mweẽ mu ndagha yi ali olyele Mfumu ti: “Dzã áboghoro mu madza, lo be, be sa baboghoro be mu Mufulu a Ngili.” <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Kala ti Nzaami aagwi baara ba ekaba emõ kyini-ekye ki ágwi kundaa bihi, ŋa lísi bihi kana mu Mfumu Yiisu-Kriste, lo me na, buulu me ali nkahaba dzyi li Nzaami?» <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Bu bagyughu mandagha mamo, mikolo mi bo myehene mídzuunu ya bo básyighi Nzaami ti: «Mu engaŋma Nzaami aagwi si kundaa bikaana biili ka bili ba-Dzwife o bwehe buu ogyiŋi mayele ya obagha bumweẽ.»<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Libwunu lili ku Antyose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Ŋa mbihi a lipfu li Etiene, bábwi omwehẽ banga-a-kana mu Kriste kimini. Mu obo, bo bátsaŋama manto ya manto. Bo bágyene tee ku Fenisi, ku Syipere ya ku Antyose. Lo bo bákabululuo Ndagha a Nzaami yini a kundaa ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ankoho, baara babake ŋa kara li bo, basi Syipere ya basi Sirene, bu bato ku Antyose, bábwi okatsala si Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Mfumu Yiisu kundaa baara ba baakabili ndiŋi yi a Engereke. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Kwogho e Mfumu éli ya bo, ya mutala a baara ba bákasa kana mu Mfumu ya ba bákagyiŋi mayele ákapfini ku olagha.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Nsia oyo yíto kundaa Libwunu li Nzaami lili ku Yerusaleme, ya bo bágweghe Baranabase ku Antyose. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Nde bu ato ya bu amono bwehe bu Nzaami, ámono esee ki elagha, ya nde ágwi bo bwohono bukyini ya ályele bo banama Mfumu mu mukolo mumõ. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Baranabase áli mbwuru wu mubwe, wu áalwulu mu Mufulu a Ngili ya mu kana. Me mu obo baara balagha bási kana mu Mfumu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Ŋa mbihi, Baranabase ágyene ku Tarese mu oyisagha Sawule. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Bu amono nde, áyabiri nde ku Antyose. Bo bansa buolo báluhu mubvu mumõ ya Libwunu li Nzaami mu okaluo mpwumu a baara yi alagha. Me ku Antyose mu sa lili nsomo báti binduono mu nkwumu yi a bakriste. <verse eid="ACT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Mu bitsughu bibye, mibighili mífi ku Yerusaleme ya míkumunu ku Antyose. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Mu lileene li Mufulu a Ngili, mumõ mu bo wu a nkwumu Angabuse, átemene ya ályele ti munzyala sa agya mu nsie nsyini. Ya munzyala munde ágyi mu matala ma óli Kolode Mukogho. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Mu obo, binduono bígwolo munkaana wu ogweghe libaha kundaa bandughu mu kana ba báli ku Yude, bwunu a bu óli bupfulu bu nswe mbwuru. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Bo bási obo, bágweghe bikaba bibye kundaa bakwuru. Bo bágwi bye ŋa myaã mi Baranabase ya Sawule.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Piere pala mu boloko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Mu matala mamo, mukogho Erode ábaana omwehẽ ndaama mu baara ba Libwunu li Nzaami kimini. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Mu litumu li nde, bádzwi Dzake, naana a Dzã mu lipee. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Nde bu amono ti ndagha oyo yíkagwa ba-Dzwife esee, nde áfirigwa litumu basyimi Piere mu bitsughu bibi kyiri kii mampa ma magwene a pfini. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Bu basyimi ya balo nde mu boloko, Erode ási bikuru bina bibi bambumbulu bana-bana mu okakebe Piere. Dzyi li Erode áli ti nde asa Piere muyala ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono ŋa mbihi a kyiri kii Paake. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Piere áli mu boloko, lo Libwunu li Nzaami líkasamana matala mwohono mu nkooro a nde.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Mu mpyibi yi oto mu etsughu ki ókaasa Erode Piere muyala, Piere ágyoŋomo ensama ŋa kara li bambumbulu buolo. Bákuru nde misyi mimi bisyeẽ, ya bankyele ba boloko bátemene ŋa muŋma a nzo. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Lo ngye-yulu a Mfumu áyapala ya otsyeme kuu mpini ómoŋono munsa boloko. Nde ákaha Piere mu mbambaha a mbee, ásiili nde ya ályele ti: «Saana, temene!» Misyi mimi bisyeŋe mi bákuru nde míbwi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Ngye-yulu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Kuru muswele a we mu bala ya kuru misyi mi mapaapa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mapaapa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bikoghoro </char></note> ma we!» Ngye-yulu áfiribwehe ti: «Laha enkuru e we ki ela kii kobo ya nama me.» <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Piere ápala ŋa mbihi a nde. Nde ka ákasoolo o ti mandagha ma ókasa ngye-yulu áli mama ngaŋma. Nde bu ákatsimi ti lilo áli limono. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Bo báluru bankyele baba nsomo, ŋa mbihi baba buolo, ya báto ŋa muŋma a nzo wu a esyeŋe wu aakapaha kunsa bvulu. Muŋma a nzo ádzubulu ndeme ŋa nkulu a bo. Bu bato ku mbala, bo bágyene ku nto a nkwulu, ya ensihibi, ngye-yulu ásihi Piere. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Oŋo embwuru bu eyabvughuru Piere, nde ályele ti: «Mu matala ma me nsoolo mu engaŋma ti me Mfumu aagweghe ngye-yulu a nde mu kuulu akwulu me ŋa myaã mi Erode ya mu mandagha mwohono ma ookeene ekaana ki ba-Dzwife osa mu me.» <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Bu abaghala ndagha oyo, nde ágyene ku nzo a Mari, ngughu a Dzã, wu baakata ti Mareke. Baara balagha áli babvuŋunu omo mu okasamana. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Piere bu akoboro ŋa muŋma a nzo, musala mutsyini wu mutughu, nkwumu a nde Rode, ágyi mu oyagyuulu. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Nde bu agyughu likyi li Piere, mu esee, nde ka ádzubulu edzughubu e nzo o, lo nde ábara ya áyilyele kundaa bana ndiri, Piere li ŋa muŋma nzo. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Bo bályele kundaa nde ti: «We lala byele!» Lo nde ágyighili onyeme ti ngaŋma, nde áli ŋa muŋma a nzo. Ya bo bábvuhulu ti: «Lo munde ngye-yulu a nde.» <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Piere ási enziini mu okakoboro. Bo bákarayadzubulu, ya bákiŋimi ku olagha mu omono nde. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Nde ákahaba bo banyaã osa nkele, ályele kundaa bo bu oopaha nde Mfumu mu boloko ya áfiribwehe bu: «Liyitwoho nsia kundaa Dzake ya kundaa bandughu mu kana babake.» Ya nde ámara oŋo, ágyene nto nkimi. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Bwihi bu buki, mpaatsala yíbwi ŋa kara li bambumbulu, bo bákabili bo-a-bo ti: «Bu Piere bunu aabwana?» <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Erode ásagha ti bayabiri nde Piere, lo ka bámono nde o. Báfwulu bankyele ya bágwi litumu ti badzwa bo. Ŋa nseele, Erode ákumunu ku Yude, ágyene ku Sedzare ya áluhu mana bitsughu oko.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lipfu li mukogho Erode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Erode áli a nkehe yi alagha ya baara baba mabvulu mama Tire ya Sidõ. Baara babo bágwihini mu oyimoŋono ŋa nkulu a nde. Bo bápeene a Balasito, musala a mukogho mu mi miikatala ngwumu a nde, bo baluomo edzuunu kundaa Erode, mu kuulu mansie ma bo mákabagha bi-odza ku nsie a nde. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Etsughu ki bási lagha bu eto, Erode wu álaha enkuru e nde kii bukogho, ábwi-nsini ŋa ebini kii muyala ya ábwi obili mu likyi lili mpini kundaa bo ŋa nkulu a baara bwohono. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Baara bábwi ofulu miluolo ti: «Likyi li, likyi li nzaami, lo ka lili lili mbwuru o!» <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Ŋaana oŋo, ngye-yulu a Mfumu ákaha Erode, mu kuulu nde ka ágwi nsia kundaa Nzaami o. Ya misere míli Erode, nde ákpi.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Nsia a Ndagha a Nzaami yíkatsaŋama ya ba bákasa kana bákapfini. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Lo Baranabase ya Sawule bu bamana esala e bo osa mu nkooro a baara baba Yerusaleme, bábvughuru. Bo bábiri Dzã wuulu nkwumu yi obili Mareke.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Bagweghe Baranabase ya Sawule mu oyitsala Nsia yi Mbwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mu Libwunu li Nzaami li líli ku Antyose, óli a mibighili ya miluo: Baranabase, Simeõ wu baakata ti Ndoomo, Lusiyuse musi Sirene, Manahene wu bákwuhu emõ ya Erode, mfumu a etsulu e nsie, ya Sawule. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Etsughu nga-emõ, bo bu bákasamana Mfumu ya bákuru nswele mu bala, Mufulu a Ngili ályele kundaa bo ti: «Litwulu, mu nkooro a me, mu libee Baranabase ya Sawule mu esala ki ánti me bo mbili.» <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Oŋo, bu bamana osamana ya okuru nswele mu bala, bo bánaã bo myaã ŋa yulu a mutswi ya bányaã bo bagye.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baranabase ya Sawule ku elyi kii Syipere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Mufulu a Ngili bu agweghe bo, bo bákumunu ku bvulu lili Selesi ku bágwolo bo bwara bu bunene mu ogye ku elyi kii Syipere. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Bu bato ŋa bvulu lili Salamine, bo bátsala nsia a ndagha a Nzaami munsa manzo mama lisamana ma ba-Dzwife. Dzã-Mareke áli ya bo mu okabulubaha bo.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Bu bamana osaghaba elyi kyehene tee ku bvulu lili Pafose, bo bábwana a mu-Dzwife mumõ nga-a-mpaana, mubighili wu a mpya, nkwumu a nde Bare-Yiisu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Nde áli emõ ya ba bali mpiŋi ya Serengyo Poole, mfumu a elyi, mbwuru nga-a-mayele. Nde áti Baranabase ya Sawule mbili, mu kuulu nde áli a nzala a ogyughu ndagha a Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Lo Elimase, nga-a-mpaana, mu kuulu oyo me mbaala a nkwumu a nde, ákasagha okahaba bo mu kuulu nde ka ákadzyi o ti mfumu Serengyo Poole asa kana mu ndagha a Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Mu obo Sawule, wu bákata si ti Poole, wu áalwulu mu Mufulu a Ngili, átuunu Elimase mihi <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «We aalwulu mu mpya ya mu mayele mama pfyibi, mwana a dyabulu, mutaara a bunsumu. We ka nyaã okagwini manzili ma Mfumu ma mali nsumu o? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Mu matala ma, gyughu: Mfumu we àasyeme. We sa kala enkpa-mihi mu mana matala, we ka afirimono tala o.» Ŋaana oŋo libwi ya mpyibi yi a laŋa-laŋa bíbwi mu nde, ya nde ábwi okadzeŋene mu osagha mbwuru wu akwara nde mu kwogho ya osuo nde nzili. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Mu matala ma ómono mfumu Serengyo mandagha ma mábwi, nde ási kana ya ákiŋimi ku olagha mu maluo ma Mfumu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole ya Baranabase ku Antyose lili mu etsulu e nsie kii Pisidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Poole ya bandughu ba nde básomo bwara ŋa Pafose, bo bágyene ku bvulu lili Perenge mu etsulu e nsie kii Pamfili. Oko, Dzã-Mareke ákaghaba ya bo ya ábvughuru ku Yerusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Lo Poole ya Baranabase, bu bamara Perenge, bánama nzili a bo ya báto ku bvulu lili Antyose lili mu etsulu e nsie kii Pisidi. Mu etsughu kii sabate, bo básomo mu nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife ya bábwi nsini. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Bu bamana otaã mikaana mi Mikyene mi Moyidze ya mimi Mibighili, bamfumu ba nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife bályele kundaa bo ti: «Bandughu mu kana, kala ti be lili a ndagha yi ogwa baara bukyini, lo libili mu matala ma!»<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Poole bu atemene, áseene kwogho, ya ályele ti: «Basi Isarayele, ya be babake ba liikagwa Nzaami budziri, ligyughu me! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Nzaami a ekaana kii Isarayele ásuolo bataara ba bihi. Nde ási ti ekaana epfini mu matala ma éli kye ku nsie a Edzipite. Ya nde ápaha kye omo mu lileene li kwogho e nde. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Mu mibvu ku bele a makwumu-mana (40), nde ábuŋunu bo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nde ábuŋunu bo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mu mikaana mi mike básono ti nde áli a mukolo mu okala ya bo</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Ŋa mbihi, nde bu amana odzwa baara baba mansie nsaama ba báli ku Kaana, nde ágwi bo mansie mamo ti pfa. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Mandagha mwohono mamo mágyili ku bele a bamvulu nkama na ya makwumu-mataana (450).»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">«Ŋa mbihi, Nzaami ágwi bataara ba bihi bansughu-a-lamana ba ekaana tee mu matala ma mubighili Samwele. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Ŋa nseele, bo báluomo mukogho, ya Nzaami ágwi bo Sawule, mwana a Kise, mu dzumu li Benzamẽ. Nde átumu mu bamvulu makwumu-mana (40). <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Ya Nzaami bu amaha nde, ábyaha Dabvide mu okala mukogho a bataara ba bihi. Me kundaa nde Nzaami ásuo bumpughulu ba: “Me aansuolo Dabvide, mwana a Yese, mbwuru wu li mu okadzyara bu ookadzyi mukolo a me. Nde sa agyighili mandagha mwohono ma aangwaa me”. <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Me mu musyi a dzumu li nde, Nzaami ápaha Yiisu, Mubvwuhu a Isarayele, ti bwunu a bu óli misiini mi nde. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Nsomo Yiisu agya, Dzã ákata mukwughu kundaa basi Isarayele bwohono mu obagha liboghoro lili ogyiŋi mayele. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Ya mu matala ma ákagye nde ku omana esala, nde ályele ti: “Mu bitsimi bi be, me nande ndi? Pele, me ka ndi munde wu lili mu okakebe be o! Lo ligyughu, nde li mu ogya ku mbihi a me, me ka nkughu onyana misyi mi bikoghoro bi nde o”».<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />«Bandughu ba me mu kana, baana ba musyi a dzumu li Abarahame, ya be ba lili ŋa kara li bihi ba baakagwa Nzaami budziri, me kundaa bihi-a-be bágweghe ndagha yi obvwughu yi. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Mu engaŋma, baara ba Yerusaleme ya bamfumu ba bo ka baabaghala ti Yiisu nande ali o, bu baasi nde muyala, obo me bu baakuhu mandagha ma mibighili ma baakataã mu etsughu kii sabate. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Si buulu bo ka bábagha ebili kii odzwa nde o, lo bo báluomo kundaa Pilate ti badzwa nde. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Bo bámana okuhu mandagha mwohono ma básono mu nde, básurulu nde ŋa kuruwa ya bátwulu nde munsa mpyeme. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Lo Nzaami ásiili nde ŋa kara li ba bápki».<verse eid="ACT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />«Mu bitsughu bilagha, nde ákamoŋono kundaa babo ba bákumu ya nde obaana ku Ngalile tee ku Yerusaleme. Mu bu, bo bali bampughulu ba nde ŋa nkulu a baara. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Ya bihi, bihi lili mu oluo Nsia yi Mbwe oyo: Misiini mi bágwi kundaa bataara ba bihi, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Nzaami aagyighili okuhu mye kundaa bihi, baana ba bo, mu matala ma aasiili nde Yiisu ŋa kara li ba bákpi, ti bwunu a bu básono mu Ekwumu kii byele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">“We li Mwana a me wu baghala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">Me me aamburu we, etsughu kii lolo”».<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />«Nzaami ásiili nde ŋa kara li ba bákpi, mu kuulu anyaã obolo, obo me bu ályele nde ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">“Me sa ngwa be bibi ngili</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">bi bafaana osa kana mu bye, bi ánsiini a me Dabvide”».<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />«Me mu obo, nde áfirilyele ŋa ebini ekimi ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">“We ka nyaã Wu a ngili a we abolo o”».<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />«Ankoho, mu eseene e nde, Dabvide ákasalala mandagha ma ókadzyi Nzaami. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ákpi, bádzyighi nde ŋa bele a bataara ba nde ya nde ábolo. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Lo munde wu oosiili Nzaami mu lipfu, ka aabolo o.»<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />«Bandughu mu kana, lisoolo ti, me mu nde baagwi be nsia a kolokolo a masumu ya mandagha mwohono maala Mikyene mi Moyidze ka mísi be baba bunsumu o. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Lo nswe munde wu aasa kana mu nde sa akala wu bunsumu. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Mu obo, lisa mayele, mu kuulu mandagha ma ósono mibighili manyaã obwa mu be.» Mandagha mamo me ma:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />«Litala, be ba lili a ligwagha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">likiŋimi ya lidzimini!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Mu kuulu me sa ngyighili ndagha mu bitsughu bi bumweẽ bu be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">ndagha yiili be ka likughu osa kana mu yo o, kala ti mbwuru lyele be yo!»<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Ŋa ópala ba Poole ya Baranabase mu nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife, bábuono bo mu ofiriyabili mu mandagha maana mamo mu etsughu kii sabate kii yulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Ŋa mbihi a ŋa bábvuŋunu bo, ba-Dzwife balagha ya ba baakasamana Nzaami a bo bánama Poole ya Baranabase. Bo bákamoŋo ya bo, ya bákagwa bo bukyini mu onabara bwehe bu Nzaami.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Etsughu kii sabate bu eto, baara ba bvulu lwohono bábvuŋunu mu ogyughu Ndagha a Mfumu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Ba-Dzwife bu bamono mpwumu a baara oyo, bálwulu mu musogho ya bábwi okaala mandagha ma ókaluo Poole embihi ya bákatughu nde. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Poole ya Baranabase mu kana, bályele kundaa bo ti: «Kundaa be bákaatswama otuoho Ndagha a Nzaami! Mu kuulu be lili mu okabihi yo, ya lili mu okalamana beme ti, be ka likughu obagha laama lili mibvu ya mibvu o. Mu matala ma bihi sa ligye kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Mu kuulu, Mfumu aagwi bihi litumu ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“Me aansuolo we mu okala otsyeme o mansie mwohono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">mpaala we biri obvwughu tee ku osughu nsie.”»<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o bu bagyughu mandagha mamo, bálwulu mu esee ya bábwi osyighi ndagha a Mfumu. Ya babo ba básuolo mu obagha laama lili mibvu ya mibvu bási kana. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Ndagha a Mfumu yítsaŋama mu etsulu e nsie kyehene. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Lo ba-Dzwife bákatsiini bakaha baba budziri ba baakabuono Nzaami, ya baara baba mupfunu mu bvulu lilo, basa ngirini. Bo bási obo mu kuulu bamwehẽ Poole ya Baranabase kimini, ya babyi bo mu nsie a bo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Bo bu bakubulu lifufunu li myili mi bo, bágyene ku bvulu lili Ikonyome. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Lo binduono bibi mu Antyose bílwulu mu esee ya mu Mufulu a Ngili.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Poole ya Baranabase ku Ikonyome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Ku Ikonyome, Poole ya Baranabase bágyene ku nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife. Oko, bo báluo Ndagha a Nzaami mu eteese kiili mpwumu a ba-Dzwife ya ba-Ngereke yi alagha yísi kana. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Lo ba-Dzwife ba bábihi osa kana, bátsiini ba bagwene osoolo Nzaami mu osa bandughu mu kana bubi. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Lo, Poole ya Baranabase báluhu matala malagha oko. Bo bákabili ya kana mu mi mitala Mfumu. Mfumu ákagwa bo lileene lili ógyighili mandagha maa okiŋimi ya bilyimi. Obo me bu ákasuo nde ti, mandagha ma bákalyele bo mu mi mitala bwehe bu nde máli ngaŋma. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Mpwumu a baara ba bvulu yíkaghaba mu mawa muolo: Ba bamo ku ngulu yi a ba-Dzwife, babake ku ngulu yi a bantumu. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Baara baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o ya ba-Dzwife, emõ ya bamfumu ba bo, bábagha bitsimi bii omwehẽ Poole ya Baranabase kimini ya odzwa bo mu mameẽ. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Bo bu basoolo bitsimi bibye, bábara ku mabvulu mama Lisitere ya Derebe mu etsulu e nsie kii Likawoni, ya mu mala ma máli bitaataa bibye. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Oko si, bo bákatsala Nsia yi Mbwe.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole ya Baranabase mu bvulu lili Lisitere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Ku Lisitere óli a baghala mumõ wu ókpi myili, wu áabwi nsini. Epfwumu e nde ekye éli emburu-ngughu ya nde áli nkini ka ámaadzyara o. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Etsughu nga-emõ, nde ákagyughu Poole mu okabili. Poole bu atuunu nde mihi, ya bu amono ti nde áli a kana mu obvwughu, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />nde ályele mu likyi lili mpini ti: «Temene nsumu mu myili mi we!» Nde ádzuŋumu, ya ábwi odzyara. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Mampwumu ma baara bu mamono ndagha yi ógyighili Poole, mályele mu mpini mu ndiĩ yi a Likawoni ti: «Banzaami baakighiri baara ya baayasughuru kundaa bihi.» <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Bo bákata Baranabase mu nkwumu yi a Dzeese ya Poole mu nkwumu yi a Eremese, mu kuulu me Poole áakabili mu nkwumu a bo bansa buolo. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Nzo a lisamana yi a ngaa a nzaami a Dzeese yíli ku baakayasomo bvulu. Nde ágwolo balumu ba bangoomo ya álaha bo bibara bibi bifulu. Emõ ya mpwumu a baara, bo bákadzyi odzwa bo mu ogwa mukaba kundaa Poole ya Baranabase. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Lo bantumu Poole ya Baranabase bu bagyughu ndagha oyo, bákaghala binkuru bi bo, básomo mu ntyini ŋa kara li mpwumu mu okaŋaã <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />ya bákalyele ti: «Bandughu, be yi nsa ndagha lili mu okagyighili? Bihi si lili baara ti anga be! Nsia yi Mbwe yi lili mu okatsala bihi kundaa be, yili mu oluomo be lisihi mandagha ma magwene a mupfunu ma, mu okaghala kundaa Nzaami wu a mweẽ wu aagyighili yulu, nsie, mubu, ya byehene bi bili omo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Me nde wuulu mu biseene bi bíluru, ágwi muswa kundaa bikaana byehene bikagyighili bu bidzyi bye. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Lo, nde aakagyighili ma mabwe kundaa be, mu kuulu mu yulu, nde aakanohõ bamvulu ya aakagwa mando ma maakaburu be bimburu bi bilagha, mpaala be libagha bi-odza ya mikolo mi be milwulu mu esee.» <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Lo, si mu mbiili a bo oyo, mu mpara Poole ya Baranabase báleene okahaba mpwumu a baara mu ogwa bo mukaba.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Ba-Dzwife ba báfi ku Antyose ya ku Ikonyome bu bágyi, bápeene a mpwumu a baara mu bitsimi bi bo. Bo bákaha Poole mameẽ, bákwolo ya bápaha nde ku mbala a bvulu, mu kuulu, bo bátsimi ti nde ákpi. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Lo binduono bu bibvuŋunu, bídzyi Poole, nde átemene ya ábvughuru munsa bvulu. Ŋa mbihi a etsughu ekye, nde ya Baranabase bágyene ku bvulu lili Derebe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole ya Baranabase babvughuru ku Antyose lili Siri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Bu bamana otsala Nsia yi Mbwe munsa bvulu lili Derebe, ya bu babagha binduono bilagha omo, bo bábvughuru ku Lisitere, Ikonyome ya Antyose. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Poole ya Baranabase bákagwa binduono mpama ya bákaluomo bo bakala a mukama mu osa kana, ya bákalyele ti: «Bihi lifaana omono mpara yi alagha mu osomo mu Emfumu e Nzaami.» <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Mu nswe Libwunu, Poole ya Baranabase básuolo bakwuru. Bu bakuru nswele mu bala, básamana Nzaami ya bágwi bo ŋa myaã mi Mfumu munde wu bási bo kana.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ŋa nseele, bo báluru mu etsulu e nsie kii Pisidi ya báto ku etsulu e nsie kii Pamfili, <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />bátsala nsia a Ndagha a Nzaami ku Perenge, ya bákumunu ku bvulu lili Atali. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Bu bamara oko, bo básomo bwara mu ogye ku Antyose, oko ku báluomo mu bo bwehe bu Nzaami, mu esala ki bákuhu bo ki. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Bu bayato ku Antyose, bo bábvughu Libwunu ya bályele mandagha mwohono ma ógyighili Nzaami mu bo, ya bu ádzubulu nde nzili a kana kundaa babo baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Bo báluhu matala ma malagha ya binduono.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Mumbaŋana mu nkooro a osohobo nzo a mbaa ku Antyose ya emvuŋunu ki Libwunu ku Yerusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Ndaama a baara baba ku Yude, bákumunu ku bvulu lili Antyose, bákaluo Libwunu, ya bákalyele ti: «Kala ti ka basohobo be nzo a mbaa o, ti bwunu a bu ookatumu Mikyene mi Moyidze, be ka likughu obvwughu o.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tala Lbv 12.3.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Poole ya Baranabase bábihi ogyughu baara babo ba bágyi, ya mumbaŋana wu a mpini ábwi ŋa kara li bo. Bo bákuru etsimi ti Poole, Baranabase ya mana a babaghala babake ba bágyi, bákumu ku Yerusaleme kundaa bantumu ya bakwuru ba Libwunu, mu mi mitala ndagha a mumbaŋana munde. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Libwunu lígwi bo bilogho bi baabiri. Bu baluru mu nsie yi a Fenisi ya yi a Samari, bo bákabululyele bunu-a-bo baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o bákagyiŋi mayele. Ya bandughu mu kana bwohono báli kunsa esee ki elagha. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Bo bu bato ku Yerusaleme, bandughu mukana bwohono, bantumu ya bakwuru bábwana a bo. Ya bo bágwi bo nsia a mandagha mwohono ma ókabulugyighili Nzaami mu bo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Lo ndaama a baara ba báli mu emvuŋunu ki ba-Faridzyẽ nsomo basa kana, bátemene ya bályele ti: «Bafaana osohobo baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o nzo a mbaa ya otumu bo bakakebe Mikyene mi Moyidze». <verse eid="ACT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Bantumu ya bakwuru bábvuŋunu mu otala ndagha oyo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Buulu mumbaŋana áli ayi wu a mpini, Piere átemene ya ályele kundaa bo ti: «Bandughu ba me mu kana, be lisoolo ti edzighi Nzaami ásuolo me ŋa kara li be, mu kuulu me ntsala Nsia yi Mbwe kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, mpaala bo basa kana. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Ya Nzaami wu gyahaba mikolo mi baara, li mpughulu a bo, bu aagwi Mufulu a Ngili kundaa bo ti bwunu a bu ágwi nde bihi, <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />ku ogwene osa lisoghobo ŋa kara li bo ya bihi-a-be. Nde aatsehebe mikolo mi bo mu kuulu bo baasi kana. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Mu matala ma, mu emakye be lidzyi otsihi Nzaami bu liikwighi binduono leme, liili ngu okala bataara ba bihi, ngu okala bihi bameme, ka liibagha mpini yi obiri lo o? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Lo bihi lili a kana ti bihi sa libvwughu mu bwehe bu Mfumu Yiisu, bumõ si kundaa bo!» <verse eid="ACT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Baara bwohono bákala pii ya bákagyughu Baranabase ya Poole ba bákabili mu bilyimi ya mandagha mama okiŋimi bi ógyighili Nzaami mu esala e bo ŋa kara li babo baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Bo bu bamana obili, Dzake ályele ti: «Bandughu ba me mu kana, ligyughu me! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simeõ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Simeõ bwunu we Simõ yili nkwumu a Piere yi a nsomo.</char></note> aalyele bihi-a-be bunu obaana mu ebaana, Nzaami ási ŋa kara li bikaana biili ka bíli ba-Dzwife o mu osuolo bye bikala baara ba bandaa nde. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Ya mandagha ma, mali mu ogye mu mana ya mandagha ma mibighili.» Mu kuulu básono ti:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />«Ŋa mbihi a mamo, me sa yambvughuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">me sa firintwu ebvulu e Dabvide ki eebwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">me sa firingyili bibwa bi kye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">ya sa me firimbvurulu kye mu mutele.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Mu obo, baara babake ba basyili basagha Mfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">ya bumõ si kundaa bikaana byehene bi aanti me mbili mu okala bibi ndaa me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Obo me bu olyele Mfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">wu aakagyighili mandagha mwohono.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Ma basoolo, obaana edzighi.»<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />«Me mu obo me ntsimi ti bubwe mu onyaã omwehẽ mpara baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o ba baasi kana mu Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Lo lisono bo mukaana ti banyaã osuŋumu mu odza tuo li banyama ba baagwi mikaba kundaa banzaami baba bityeghe, banyaã okasa enkwunu, ya banyaã odza tuo lili banyama ba baakpi mbiili o. Bo ka bafaana odza si makili o. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Mu kuulu, obaana mu biseene bi bikulu, mu nswe bvulu oli a ba baakaluo Mikyene mi Moyidze. Bo baakatala mye mu nswe etsughu kii sabate mu manzo ma lisamana ma ba-Dzwife.»<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukaana wu mikele kundaa Libwunu lili ku Antyose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Oŋo, bantumu ya bakwuru, ya Libwunu lwohono, bágwihini mu osuolo baara ŋa kara li bo, ba baagweghe ku Antyose emõ ya Poole ya Baranabase. Bo básuolo Yuda, wu baakata ti Baranabase ya Silase, baara baba budziri ŋa kara li bandughu mu kana. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Bágwi bo mukaana wu básono ti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">«Bantumu, bakwuru ya bandughu mu kana bagwi mboro kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, ba bali ku Antyose, ku Siri ya ku Silisi. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Bihi liigyughu ti baara bana ŋa kara li bihi, baala bihi ka liigwi bo litumu o, baayasa be mikolo maŋa-maŋa ya baagwi be nzalamweẽ mu mbiili a bo. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Me mu obo bihi bwohono liikuru mfwunu ya liimono ti ali bubwe bihi lisuolo baara ba liigweghe bihi kundaa be, nzili mõ ya bandughu ba bihi baba mukolo Baranabase ya Poole, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />babo ba bágwi laama li bo mu osalala nkwumu a Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Mu obo, bihi liigweghe be Yuda ya Silase mu kuulu bo bayalyele be mandagha ma liisono bihi mu mukaana. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Mufulu a Ngili ya bihi bameme si, liimono ti ali bubwe mu onyaã okwighi be maleme makimi, ŋa yulu a yini a mandagha maala ka makughu ogweene o. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Mandagha mamo me ma: Ka likadza banyama ba baagwi mikaba kundaa banzaami baba bityeghe o. Ka likadza makili o, ka likadza banyama ba baakpi mbiili o, ya ka likasa enkwunu o. Kala ti be liikakebe manyuru ma be, lo be liikasa bubwe. Likala bubwe!»<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Bányaã babo ba básuolo mu okumunu ku Antyose bagye, ya bo bágyene. Oko, bo bábvughu libwunu ya bágwi bo mukaana. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Bu bataã mukaana, bo bámono esee mu nkooro a mpama yi ákagwa nde bo. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yuda ya Silase, ba báli bomo mibighili, bábili ku olagha ya bágwi bo mpama ya mpini. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Ya bu baluhu mana matala oko, bandughu mu kana bábvurulu bo mu edzuunu kundaa ba bágweghe bo. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />[Lo, Silase ámono ti ali bubwe nde asyili oko.] <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Poole ya Baranabase básyili ku Antyose. Emõ ya baara balagha babake, bo bákaluo ya bákatsala nsia yi mbwe yi a ndagha a Mfumu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole ya Baranabase bakaghaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Ŋa mbihi a mana bitsighu, Poole ályele kundaa Baranabase ti: «Tswe libvughuru liyitala bandughu mu kana mu mabvulu mwohono, mu líitsala bihi a we nsia a Ndagha a Mfumu, mu kuulu limono bu bali mu okadzyara bo.» <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Baranabase ákadzyi obiri ya bo Dzã wu baakata Mareke. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Lo Poole ámono ti ali bubwe mu ogwene ogwolo nde emõ ya bo, mu kuulu nde áli akaghaba ya bo ku Pamfili ya ka ágyene nzili mo ya bo o mu oyisa esala. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Mumbaŋana wu a mpini ábwi ŋa kara li bo ya bo bákaghaba. Baranabase ágwolo Mareke, básomo mu bwara bu bunene ya bágyene ku Syipere. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Poole ásuolo Silase ya bo bágyene. Lo nsomo bagye, bandughu mu kana báluomo ti bwehe bu Mfumu bukala ya bo. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Ya nde áluru mu mansie mama Siri ya Silisi, mu okabulugwa mabwunu mpini.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Poole ya Silase babiri Timote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Poole áyito ku Derebe, ŋa nseele nde ágyene ku Lisitere. Oŋo óli a enduono emõ kii nkwumu Timote, mwana a mukaha wu mu-Dzwife, wu áasi kana mu Mfumu. Lo taara a nde áli mu-Ngereke. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Bandughu mu kana baba mu mabvulu mama Lisitere ya Ikonyome bákasuo bumpughulu bu bubwe mu nde. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Poole ákadzyi obiri nde. Ya bu agwolo nde, ásohobo nde nzo a mbaa, mu nkooro a ba-Dzwife ba báli mu bitsulu bi nsie bibye, mu kuulu bo bwohono áli basoolo ti taara a nde áli mu-Ngereke. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Ya mu mabvulu ma bákaluru bo, Poole ya Silase bákatuoho kundaa bandughu mu kana mandagha ma ókuru bantumu ya bakwuru ba libwunu lili ku Yerusaleme. Ya bo bákaluomo kundaa banga-a-kana mu onama mo. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Mabwunu mákagwama mu kana, ya nswe etsughu, mo mákapfini mu mutala a baara.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole kihi mbili mu ogye ku Masedwane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Buulu Mufulu a Ngili, ákahaba bo banyaã otsala nsia a Ndagha a Nzaami mu etsulu e nsie kii Adzi, Poole ya Silase bábululuru mu bitsulu bi nsie bibi Firingi, ya bibi Ngalate. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Bo bu babehene ku etsulu e nsie kii Misi, bo básagha ogye ku etsulu e nsie kii Bitini, lo Mufulu a Yiisu ka ágwi bo muswa o. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Mu obo, bo bábululuru mu etsulu e nsie kii Misi, ya bákumunu ku mbwuu yi a mu bvulu lili Torowase. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Etsughu nga-emõ mu mpyibi, Poole ámono mu limono, musi Masedwane átemene ya ákabuono nde ti: «Bululuru mu etsulu e nsie kii Masedwane, ya baha bihi!» <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Ŋa mbihi a limono li Poole lilo, bihi líisagha obaagye ku Masedwane, mu kuulu bihi líili a kana ti Nzaami áakata bihi mbili mu oyitsala Nsia yi Mbwe oko.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baboghoro Lidi ku bvulu lili Filipe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Bu lisomo mu bwara ŋa Torowase, bihi líigyene nsumu ku elyi kii Samotarase. Ya etsughu ki énama ŋa mbihi, bihi líigyene ku bvulu lili Neyapolise. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Ya bu limara oŋo, bihi líigyene ku Filipe, bvulu li libvulu mupfunu mu etsulu e nsie kii Masedwane, ki éli kunsa litumu li ba-Romẽ. Bihi líiluhu mana bitsughu munsa bvulu lilo. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Mu etsughu kii sabate, bihi líipala mu bvulu. Ya bu liluono mukogho a mwele, bihi líiyito ŋa ebini emõ ki líkatsimi bihi ti ebini kii lisamana. Bu libwi-nsini, bihi líibili ya bakaha ba bábvuŋunu oŋo. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Ŋa kara li bo óli a mukaha mumõ wu a nkwumu a Lidi. Nde áli musi bvulu lili Tyatire. Nde ákatyeghe biko bibi mungala ya ákabuono Nzaami. Nde ákagyughu bihi ya Mfumu ádzubulu mukolo a nde mu kuulu agyighili okanama mandagha ma ókalyele Poole. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Ya ŋa mbihi a ŋa báboghoro nde, emõ ya baara ba nzo a nde, nde ábuono bihi ti: «Kala be liimono ti me aakansa kana mu Mfumu, lo liyakala mu nzo a me.» Nde ási enkwili buulu bihi likihi.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole ya Silase mu boloko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Etsughu etsyini, mu matala ma líkagye bihi ku ebini kii lisamana, musala mutsyini wu mukaha áyabwana a bihi. Nde áli a mufulu wu mubi, wu áakasa ti nde akataala mandagha ma maagya ku nkulu, ya mu buntaala bu nde, bamfumu ba nde bákabagha nzi yi alagha. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Nde ákayanama Poole ya bihi. Nde ákabiili bingubu ti: «Baara ba bali basala ba Nzaami wu Ensoõ-Yulu! Kundaa be, bo bali mu okatsala nsia a nzili yi obvwughu». <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Nde ákasa obo bitsughu bilagha. Etsughu etsyini Poole ákolo nkehe, ya bu akaghala, ályele kundaa mufulu munde ti: «Mu nkwumu a Yiisu-Kriste, me ntumu we, pala mu mukaha wu!» Ya ŋaana oŋo, mufulu ápala. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Bamfumu ba nde, bu bamono ti bo ka bakughu ofirisalala nde mu obagha nzi o, básyimi Poole ya Silase, bákwolo a bo tee ŋa ebini ki ókabvuŋunu baara ba bvulu lwohono, ŋa nkulu a bamfumu. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Bábiri bo ŋa nkulu a bansughu-a-lamana ba báli ba-Romẽ ya bályele bo ndiri: «Baara ba bali ba-Dzwife. Bo bali mu okasa ligyuu munsa bvulu li bihi. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Ya bo bali mu okaluo baara bipfu bi binyaghara, biili bihi ba-Romẽ ka lili a muswa mu okihi o, bwunu we mu onama.» <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Mpwumu a baara yíkaghala bo mfulu, bansughu-a-lamana bágwi litumu badzwulu bo binkuru ya bakaha bo nswanswa. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Ya bu bamana okaha bo nswanswa, bálo bo mu boloko ya bádzuru nkyele a boloko matswi mu ogyighili okebe bo. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Nkyele a boloko bu agyughu litumu lilo, nde álo bo kunsa ngwumu yi a mu kara, ya álo bo myili mu bidzu.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Mu kara-a-kara li mpyibi, Poole ya Silase bákasamana ya bákagyimi bikwumu mu osyighi Nzaami. Baara ba boloko babake bákagyughu bo. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Ensihibi, nsie yínyiŋi mu mpini mu eteese kii onyihi bitsini bi bibagha bi boloko. Bidzughubu bi boloko byehene bísaanyaã ya misyi mimi bisyeẽ myehene mi bákuru baara ba boloko mísughuru. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Nkyele a boloko ábulusighili kunsa ensama, ya bu amono bidzughubu bi boloko bwaha, nde ápaha lipee mu kuulu adzwa nyuru. Nde ákatsimi ti baara ba báli mu boloko báfi obara. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Lo Poole ágyamana nde ti: «Ka sa nyuru a we mfini o! Bihi bwohono lili ŋa». <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Oŋo nkyele a boloko áluomo mwindi, ya mu embwa-mbwa nde ásomo mu báli bo, mu enkwughu kyehene áyibwa ŋa nkulu a Poole ya Silase. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Nde ápaha bo ya áfwulu bo ti: «Bataara! Emakye me aansa kuulu me mbvwughu?» <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Bo bábvuhulu nde ti: «Sa kana mu Mfumu Yiisu, ya we sa bvwughu, we ya baara ba nzo a we.» <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Bo báluo nde ndagha a Mfumu, nde ya baara ba nzo a nde bwohono. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Mu matala maana mamo, nkyele a boloko ábiri Poole ya Silase ku nzo a nde, áswagha bo mambaala, ya bo básaaboghoro nde ya baara ba nzo a nde bwohono. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Nde ásohobo bo munsa nzo a nde ya ágwi bo bi-odza. Nde ya baara ba nzo a nde bwohono, bákughu mu esee, mu kuulu, bo bási kana mu Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Bwihi bu buki, bansunghu-a-lamana bágweghe babaakasala ya bo bayilyele kundaa nkyele a boloko ti: «Nyaã baara babo bagye!» <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Nkyele a boloko átwoho nsia oyo kundaa Poole ti: «Bansunghu-a-lamana baagweghe mukyene ti me nyaã be. Mu obo, lipala ya ligye mu edzuunu!» <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Lo Poole ábvuhulu bo ti: «Bo baatumu bakaha bihi nswanswa ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono, gwene a otswama osa bihi muyala, bihi ba lili ba-Romẽ! Ŋa nseele bo baalo bihi mu boloko. Ya mu matala ma bo badzyi opaha bihi mu ensweghe? Pele, ka okughu okala obo o! Nyaã bomo bayapaha bihi!» <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Babaakasala ya bansughu-a-lamana báyitwoho mvuru oyo kundaa bansunghu-a-lamana. Bo bu bagyughu ti Poole ya Silase báli ba-Romẽ, bo bábagha nzalamweẽ, <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />ya báyaluomo bo kolokolo. Bo bápaha bo mu boloko ya báluomo bo bamara mu bvulu. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Poole ya Silase bu bapala mu boloko, bágyene kundaa Lidi. Bo bámoŋono ya bandughu mu kana, bágwi bo mpama, ya bo bágyene.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Poole ya Silase ku bvulu lili Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Bu baluru mu mabvulu mama Amfipoli ya Apoloni, Poole ya Silase báyato ŋa Tesalonike. Oŋo, óli a nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Ti bwunu a bu óli epfu e nde, Poole ásomo mu nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife. Nde ákabili ya bo mu mi mitala Mandagha ma Nzaami, mu bitsughu bi sabate bitere. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Nde ákabaala ya ákasuo bo ti Kriste áfaana omono mpara ya osighili ŋa kara li ba bákpi, ya ákalyele bu: «Kriste, me Yiisu wu ndi mu okagwa me be nsia.» <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Bo bápeene a ndaama a ba-Dzwife ba báyabvuŋunu ya bo. Ba-Ngereke balagha ba baakasyighi Nzaami ya bakaha balagha ba banene boho si, bási bumõ. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Lo ba-Dzwife bana bámono mukolo mubi ya báti baara ba babi ba baakabwa nsini mu manzili mbili. Bu babvughu bo, bátumu bo mu osa ngirini munsa bvulu. Bo báyibvuŋunu ŋa nzo a Yasone, bákasagha Poole ya Silase mu kuulu babiri bo ŋa nkulu a baara bwohono. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Bu bakwono omono bo, bo bábiri Yasone ya ndaama a bandughu mu kana babake ŋa nkulu a bamfumu ba bvulu, ya bákabuluta mukwu ti: «Baara ba báanyihi nsie nsyini, bamaato kunu mu matala ma. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Yasone aagyagha bo ku nzo a nde. Bo ka bali mu okanama litumu li Mukogho Sedzare o, ya bali mu okabululyele si ti oli a mukogho mukimi, nkwumu a nde Yiisu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Ndagha oyo yímwehẽ bakwuru ba bvulu ya mpwumu a baara mpara. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Bo bákehe Yasone ya babake ekolo ki ofuru ŋa nseele bányaã bo bagye.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole ya Silase ku bvulu lili Bere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Mpyibi bu yibwi, bandughu mu kana bágweghe Poole ya Silase ku Bere. Bo bu bato oko, básomo mu nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Ba-Dzwife baba ku Bere báli a mikolo mi mibwe ku obvulu baba ku Tesalonike. Bo bágyagha Ndagha a Nzaami mu esee ki elagha mu okagyighili okeene yo nswe etsughu, mu kuulu basoolo kala ti mandagha ma ókaluo bo Poole máli mama ngaŋma. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Baara balagha mu bo bási kana, bumõ si ya bakaha baba ba-Ngereke ba banene mu bvulu ya babaghala balagha. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Lo ba-Dzwife baba ku Tesalonike bu basoolo ti Poole ákabulutsala si nsia a Ndagha a Nzaami ku Bere, bo bágyene oko si mu kuulu basa ngirini ya mu otihi mampwumu ma baara. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Mu maswa, bandughu mu kana bási ti Poole abara ku mukogho a mubu. Lo Silase ya Timote básyili ku Bere. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Ba bákagye ya Poole, bábiri nde tee ku bvulu lili Atene. Mu matala ma bákabvughuru bo, Poole átumu bo bályele kundaa Silase ya Timote bagye mu maswa ku áli nde.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole mu bvulu lili Atene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Mu matala ma okakebe Poole Silase ya timote ku Atene, nde ákanyoõ ku olagha bu ákamono ti bvulu lilo áli lilwulu mu banzaami baba bityeghe ba ókasyighi baara. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Mu obo, mu nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife, nde ákamoŋo ya ba-Dzwife ya babo baala ka báli ba-Dzwife o ba baakasamana Nzaami. Ya nswe etsughu, nde ákamoŋo ya baara bwohono ba ákabwana a nde ŋa ebini ki ookabvuŋunu baara bwohono. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Óli si ya banga-a-mayele ba baakata ba-Epikuryẽ ya ba-Sitoyisyẽ ba bákamoŋo ya nde. Bana bákalyele ti: «Nsa ndagha Nga-a-nkele wu adzyi olyele?» Babake bákalyele ti: «Ti anga nde li mu okabili mu banzaami baba bunzyi.» Bo bákalyele obo mu kuulu Poole ákaluo Nsia yi Mbwe yitala Yiisu ya osighili o ba bápki mu lipfu. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Mu obo, bo bágwolo Poole ya bábiri nde ŋa nkulu a mfwunu a bamfumu ba bvulu yi baakata Ayeropadze. Bo báfwulu nde ti: «We kughu olyele bihi nsa maluo ma manyaghara we li mu okabulugwa baara? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Mu kuulu we li mu okalo mu matswi ma bihi mandagha ma manyaghara ya bihi lidzyi ogyahaba mambaala ma mo.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Mu engaŋma, baara ba bvulu lili Atene ya banzyi ba báli munsa bvulu lilo, bákaluhu matala ma bo yini a mu okabili bwunu we mu okagyughu bitsimi bi binyaghara. <verse eid="ACT 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Mu obo, Poole bu atemene ŋa nkulu a baara ba bábvuŋunu mu mfwunu a Ayeropadze, átsughu ndagha ti: «Baara ba bvulu lili Atene, me ndi mu omono ti mu mandagha mwohono, be lili baara banga a enzaami nkara kii elagha. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Mu kuulu, mu matala ma áakabulundzye me munsa bvulu li be, me aamono bityeghe bi liikasamana be, ya me aamono ebini emõ ki baakagwa bikaba. Ŋa yulu a kye básono ti: “Kundaa nzaami wu bagwene ogyahaba”. Me aayangwa be nsia a Nzaami munde wu liikasamana be, gwene a osoolo nde. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Me Nzaami munde áagyighili nsie yohono ya bilogho byehene bi bili mu yo, nde li Mfumu a yulu ya nsie. Nde ka aakakala mu bibini bibi lisamana bi ógyili myaã mi baara o. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Ŋa yulu oŋo, nde ka li a nzala a kuulu ti myaã mi baara misalala nde o ti anga nde li a nzala a elogho. Mu kuulu nde aakagwa bumweẽ, ewumu, ya bilogho byehene kundaa baara bwohono. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Mu mbwuru mutsyini, nde ágyighili bikaana bi baara byehene mu kuulu bye bikala ŋa yulu a nsie yohono. Nde ákuru mando ya ási milili mu mansie ma baakala bo. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Nzaami ási obo mu kuulu baara bakasagha nde, si kala ti bo baakamono mpara mu okasagha nde, bo sa bamono nde. Mu engaŋma, nde ka li la ya nswe mbwuru mu bihi o. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Mu kuulu me mu nde bihi lili mweẽ, liikabuludzyara, ya bihi lili, ti bu ólyele banga-a-liteere li obili ba be babake ti: “Bihi si lili baana ba nde.” <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Mu obo, buulu bihi lili baana ba Nzaami, bihi ka lifaana otsimi o ti Nzaami li mu efafaana ki etyeghe ki bátsulu mu oore, mu ngele, bwunu we ki bágwala mu limeẽ, ki bágwala ya bunkere mu mayele ya bitsimi bi mbwuru. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ankoho Nzaami ka aafirikatala matala maala baara báli kunsa nzi-nzimini o. Lo mu matala ma, nde li mu okalyele kundaa baara bwohono mu mansie mwohono ti bagyiŋi mayele. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Mu kuulu nde ákuru etsughu ki akala aalamana nde nsie nsyini mu bunsumu mu mbwuru wu ásuolo nde. Nde áasuo kundaa baara bwohono elyimi, ki bakughu osa kana, bu áasiili mbwuru munde ŋa kara li ba bákpi.» <verse eid="ACT 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Bo bu bagyughu ndagha yi osighili o baara ŋa kara li ba bákpi, baara bana bábwi osebe nde, babake bákalyele ti: «Mu ndagha oyo, bihi sa ligyughu we mu matala makimi!» <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Mu obo, Poole ábulusihi bo. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Lo ndaama a baara mu bo yínama nde ya yísi kana. Mu bo óli Denise, mumõ mu mfwunu a Ayeropadze, ya mukaha mutsyini wu a nkwumu Damarise ya baara bakimi.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Poole ku bvulu lili Korẽte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Poole ámara ku Atene ya ágyene ku Korẽte. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Oko, nde ábwana mu-Dzwife wu a nkwumu Akila, wu áfi ku etsulu e nsie kii Põ. Ka oli edzighi o, nde áfi ku Itali ya mukala a nde Pirisika, mu kuulu Mukogho Kolode ágwi litumu ti ba-Dzwife bwohono bafaana opala mu bvulu lili Rome. Poole ágyene kundaa Akila ya Pirisile. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Ya buulu nde esala emõ ákasa ya bo, bo báli bantwu bibvulu, Poole ákala emõ ya bo, ya bákasala ya bo. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Mu nswe etsughu kii sabate, Poole ákabili mu nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife ya ákasagha opeene a ba-Dzwife ya ba-Ngereke basa kana. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Mu matala ma ófi Silase ya Timote ku Masedwane ya báyato ku Korẽte, Poole ábaana okaluhu matala ma nde mwohono mu okaluo Ndagha a Nzaami. Nde ákalyele kundaa ba-Dzwife ti ngaŋma Yiisu li Kriste. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Lo ba-Dzwife bátemene a Poole nsumu ya bákatughu nde. Mu obo, nde ákubulu lifufunu li binkuru bi nde ya ályele bo ti: «Nyaã makili ma be mabwa ŋa yulu a mitswi mi beme! Me ka ndi a ebili mu mo o. Obaana lolo, me kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o aangye.» <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Poole bu amara ŋa ebini ekye, ágyene kundaa baghala mumõ wu áakasamana Nzaami. Nkwumu a nde Tituse Yusutuse, ya nzo a nde yíli ŋa bele a nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kirisipuse, mfumu a nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife, ási kana mu Mfumu, nde ya baara ba nzo a nde bwohono. Ya baara baba ku Korẽte, ba bákagyughu Poole, bási kana ya báboghoro bo.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Etsughu nga-emõ mu mpyibi, Mfumu áyamoŋono kundaa Poole mu limono ya ályele nde ti: «Ka kala a nzalamweẽ o, sa mukama mu okabili, ka kuru muŋma o! <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Buulu me ndi ya we, ka oli a mbwuru wu kughu osyimi we mu omwehẽ we kimini o. Munsa bvulu li, me ndi a baara balagha.» <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Poole ási mvulu mumõ ya bangoono basemene ku Korẽte mu okaluo Ndagha a Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Mu matala ma óli Ngalyõ mfumu a Rome, mu etsulu e nsie kii Akayi, ba-Dzwife bágwihini mu okala a etaara mu Poole, ya bábiri nde ŋa mbala a muyala. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Bo bályele ti: «Mbwuru wu li mu okatumu baara bakasamana Nzaami mu okakaala mikyene embihi.» <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Mu matala ma ókaabili Poole, Ngalyõ ágwi mvuru yi kundaa ba-Dzwife: «Kala ti ali ndagha yi baadzwi mbwuru bwunu we bigyighili bi bibi, me kaankihi oluhu matala ma me mu ogyughu be ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Lo buulu mumbaŋana a be li mu nkooro a mbiili, mankwumu ya mikyene mi be, ndagha oyo yitala be beme! Me ka nkughu okala nsughu-a-lamana a be o.» <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ya nde ápaha bo ku mbala a nzo a muyala. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Mu obo, bo bwohono básyimi Sosetene, mfumu a nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife, bádzwi nde nkubu ŋa mbala a nzo a muyala. Lo Ngalyõ ka átsughu si ndagha o.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole bvughuru ku bvulu lili Antyose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Poole áfiriluhu bitsughu bilagha ŋa Korẽte. Ŋa mbihi, nde ábulusihi bandughu mu kana ya ásomo mu bwara mu ogye ku Siiri, nzili mõ ya Pirisile ya Akila. Lo nsomo, bási nde nkulu ŋa Senkere mu kuulu nde ágwi misiini kundaa Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Bu bato ŋa Efedze, nde ásihi Pirisile ya Akila oŋo. Nde ágyene ku nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife ya ákamoŋo ya ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Bo báluomo nde mu oluhu bitsughu bilagha oko, lo nde ábihi, <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />nde ábulusihi bo ya ályele ti: «Kala Nzaami dzyi, me sa firiyambvughuru kundaa be mu sa likimi.» Ŋa nseele nde ásomo mu bwara ya ásihi bvulu lili Efedze. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Bu ato ŋa bvulu lili Sedzare, Poole átswama okumu ku Yerusaleme mu ogwa libwunu li Nzaami mboro. Ŋa mbihi, nde ákumunu ku Antyose. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Nde áluhu mana bitsughu, ya ásihi bvulu lilo. Nde ábululuru mu mabvulu mama Ngalate ya Firingi, mu okabulugwa binduono byehene mpama mu kana.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apolose mu mabvulu mama Efedze ya Korẽte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Mu-Dzwife mumõ, wu a nkwumu Apolose, wu áafi ku bvulu lili Aledzandiri, áyato ŋa Efedze. Nde áli a liteere li obili ya áli asoolo Bisono bi Nzaami bubwe. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Nde ágyighi nsia a nzili a Mfumu, ya nde bu áli a mukolo mbaa, ákaluo ya ákagyihi mu bunsumu Nsia yi mbwe yitala Yiisu. Lo nde ákagyahaba yini a liboghoro li Dzã. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Mu obo, nde ákaluo ya bukyini bwohono munsa nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife. Lo bu bamana ogyughu nde, Pirisile ya Akila bágwolo nde mu okala emõ ya bo, mu ofirigyighili osuo nde nzili a Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Buulu Apolose áli a etsimi kii ogye ku Akayi, bandughu mu kana bákihi etsimi ekye ya básono mukaana kundaa binduono mu kuulu babwana a nde bubwe. Nde bu áyato, mu bwehe bu Nzaami, nde áli a mupfunu kundaa babo ba bási kana. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Mu engaŋma, mu mbiili a nde, nde ákabwihi mu ebaghala kyehene bitsimi bi ba-Dzwife ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono, bu akasuo mu libaha li Bisono bi Nzaami ti Yiisu ngu Kriste.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Poole ku bvulu lili Efedze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Mu matala ma óli Apolose ku Korẽte, Poole wu áabululuru mu etsulu e nsie kii minguo mimi Adzi áto ku Efedze. Oko, nde áyibagha ndaama a binduono. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Ya nde áfwulu bo ti: «Mu matala ma lísi be kana mu Mfumu, be líigyagha Mufulu a Ngili?» Bo bábvuhulu nde ti: «Bihi nkini lígyughu ti oli a Mufulu a Ngili o!» <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Mu obo, Poole áfwulu bo ti: «Bu nsa liboghoro be líbagha?» Bo bábvuhulu ti: «Liboghoro lili Dzã.» <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Poole áfirilyele bo ti: «Dzã ákaboghoro baara ba bákagyiŋi mayele ya nde ákaluomo kundaa bo mu osa kana mu munde wu akala aagya ŋa mbihi a nde. Mbwuru munde, me Yiisu.» <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Bu bamana ogyughu nde, báboghoro bo mu nkwumu a Mfumu Yiisu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Poole ánaã bo myaã ŋa yulu a mitswi ya Mufulu a Ngili ábwi mu bo. Bo bábwi obili mu mandiĩ mama bunzyi ya okabighili. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Mutala a bo bwohono áli ku bele a baara kwumu ya buolo (12).<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Nswe matala, Poole ákagye ku nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife, ya mu bangoono batere, nde ákabili ya kana lwohono, ya ákaluo mu mi mitala Empu e Nzaami. Nde ákasa mukama mu opeene a baara ba bákagyughu nde mu kuulu bo basobo bitsimi. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Lo baara babake ŋa kara li bo, bákuru mikolo, bábihi osa kana ya bákatswagha maluo ma matala nzili a Mfumu ŋa nkulu a libwunu lwohono. Mu obo, Poole ábulusihi bo. Nde ágwolo binduono ya ágyene a bye, ya nswe etsughu, nde ákaluo bye munsa nzo a Tiranose yi a maluo. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Nde ási mukama mu okaluo bo tee mu bamvulu buolo. Me obo baara bwohono baba mu etsulu e nsie kii Adzi, ba-Dzwife ya ba-Ngereke bágyughu Ndagha a Mfumu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baana ba Seva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Nzaami ákasa bimaã bii okiŋimi mu Poole. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Mu obo, bákayinahaba biko bwunu we mipa mi biko mi míberene a nyuru a nde kundaa babyele. Babyele bákadzughu, ya mifulu mi mibi míkapala mu bo. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Ndaama a ba-Dzwife ba baakabulugye nto ya nto mu okabulubyi mifulu mi mibi, bákataŋana si nkwumu a Mfumu Yiisu ya bákalyele kundaa mifulu mi mibi ti: «Mu nkwumu a Yiisu wu oli mu okabululuo Poole, me ntumu be, lipala!» <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Obo me bu ókasa baana nsaama ba mukwuru a bangaa ba nzaami a ba-Dzwife wu a nkwumu Seva. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Lo etsughu nga-emõ, mufulu wu mubi ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Yiisu, me ngyahaba nde, ya me nsoolo nande Poole ali. Lo be, be bana lili?» <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Ya mbwuru wu áali a mufulu wu mubi ábwi ŋa yulu a bo, ábvulu bo mu mpini ya ámwehẽ bo bwohono mpara mu nzuŋu yi alagha. Bo bábulupala mu nzo oyo mu ntyini, mpene ya mambaala mu manyuru. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Baara bwohono mu bvulu lili Efedze, ba-Dzwife ya ba-Ngereke bágyughu ndagha oyo. Bo bwohono bámono nzalamweẽ ya bákasyighi bunene bu nkwumu a Mfumu Yiisu.<verse eid="ACT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Ŋa kara li baara ba bási kana, balagha báakakihi bigyighili bi bo bi bibi ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Baara balagha báyabiri mikaana mi bo mimi mpaana, ya bátsughu mye mbaa ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono. Bu batala ntala a mikaana mimye, bábagha mafwunu kwumu (50 000) ma mipara mimi bisyeẽ. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Me mu obo, mu lileene li Mfumu, Ndagha a Nzaami yíkatsaŋama ya yíkakulu mu manto mwohono.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngirini mu bvulu lili Efedze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Ŋa mbihi a mandagha mamo, mu Mufulu, Poole ábagha bitsimi bii ogye ku Yerusaleme, mu obululuru mu bitsulu bi mansie bibi Masedwane ya Akayi. Nde ákalyele ti: «Ŋa aamara me oko, me mfaana ogye si ku Rome.» <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Mu obo, nde ágweghe baara buolo mu mimbaha mi nde ku Masedwane, Timote ya Erasite. Lo nde-ndeme áfiriluhu mana bitsughu mu etsulu e nsie kii Adzi.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Me mu matala mamo baara bási ngirini yi nene mu nkooro a nzili a Mfumu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Demeteryuse, muntsulu bisyeẽ, ákagyighili binzo-nzo bibi lisamana mu ngele mu efaana e nzo a nzaami a Aretemise, nzaami wu mukaha. Nde ya ba bákasa esala emõ ya nde bákabagha ndaana yi alagha. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Nde ábvughu bo ya baara ba baakasala bisala bikimi bibi myaã bi bifaana ya kii bo, ya ályele kundaa bo ndiri: «Bandughu ba me, be lisoolo ti me mu esala ki bihi-a-be liikabagha busini. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Lo be lili mu omono ya lili mu ogyughu ti Poole li mu okalyele ti banzaami ba lili mu okagyighili mu myaã mi bihi-a-be ka bali banzaami baba ngaŋma o. Nde aaleene opeene a mampwumu ma baara mu osobo bo bitsimi. Ka oli yini a mu Efedze bali mu okalyele obo o, lo mu etsulu e nsie kyehene kii Adzi. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Ka oli yini a esala e bihi-a-be bali mu okatswagha o, lo bali mu okatsaala si nzo a nzaami a Aretemise, nzaami wu munene wu mukaha. Ya edzi-dzighi nde sa apfihili nsia a nde yi nene, nde wu li nzaami wu baakasamana mu etsulu e nsie kii Adzi ya mu nsie nsyini.» <verse eid="ACT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Bo bu bagyughu obo, bákolo nkehe ya bábwi ofulu bingubu ti: «Aretemise wu a Efedze li nzaami wu mukaha wu munene!» <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Ngirini yíbwi mu bvulu lwohono. Bo bwohono mu mpwumu bágyene ku nzo a bimpa, bábulusyimi ya bábiri Ngayuse ya Arisitarake, basi Masedwane ba bákabulugye ya Poole . <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Poole ákadzyi oyimoŋono ŋa nkulu a mpwumu a baara, lo binduono bíkahaba nde. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Bandughu ba nde babake ba báli bamfumu mu etsulu e nsie kii Adzi bágweghe nde si baara mu obuono nde mu kuulu anyaã ogye ku nzo a bimpa. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Bana bákakehe bingubu mu ndagha yi, babake bákakehe bingubu mu ndagha nkimi. Mpaatsala yíbwi ŋa nsa emvuŋunu. Ya baara balagha ŋa kara li bo ka bákasoolo o mu emakye bo bábvuŋunu. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Munsa mpwumu, ndaama a baara yígwi nsia kundaa Alesandere wu ótwulu ba-Dzwife ŋa nkulu. Nde áseene ekee mu obili mu kuulu akala nyuru a nde ŋa nkulu a mpwumu a baara. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Lo bu babaghala ti nde li mu-Dzwife, baara bwohono bákakehe bingubu mu likyi limõ, mu matala muolo ti: «Aretemise wu a Efedze li nzaami wu mukaha wu munene!» <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Munsono mikaana wu a bvulu áleene ogwuhubu mpwumu a baara ya ályele ti: «Baara ba Efedze, nande dzimini ti bvulu li Efedze lili nkyele a nzo a nzaami a Aretemise wu munene ya wu a etyeghe e nde ki éfi ku yulu? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Buulu ka oli a mbwuru wu kughu osa mikeme mu ndagha oyo o, be lifaana odzuunu ya ka lisa buwulu o. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Be liiyabiri babaghala ba ŋa. Lo bo ka baaturu bilogho bi nzo a nzaami o ya bo ka baatswagha nzaami a bihi wu mukaha o. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Kala ti Demeteryuse ya basala ba nde bali a ndagha ya mbwuru, bitsughu bibi miyala bili, bansunghu-a-lamana si bali. Lo nyaã bo bayifwunu! <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Ya kala ti be lili a mandagha makimi ma liifwunu, emvuŋunu ki eekanama mikyene sa egyighili mo. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Mu engaŋma, bakughu ofwunu bihi-a-be ti bihi liitemene nsumu ya emfumu e bvulu mu mi miiluru lolo. Mu kuulu ka oli a bwuu li likughu ogwa kundaa bamfumu ba bvulu mu emvuŋunu ki o.» Nde bu amana obili obo, ábvurulu baara.<verse eid="ACT 19:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Poole ku nsie yi a Masedwane ya yi a ba-Ngereke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Ngirini oyo bu yifi, Poole áti binduono bi nde mbili ya ágwi bo bukyini. Bu agwi bo mboro yi munkaghaba, nde ágyene ku Masedwane. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Nde abululuru mu etsulu e nsie ekye ya ákabulugwa ba bási kana bukyini bulagha. Ŋa nseele, nde áyito ku nsie a ba-Ngereke. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Nde áluhu bangoono batere oko. Mu matala ma ákasomo nde bwara mu ogye ku Siiri, nde ágyughu ti ba-Dzwife bákuru ewaa mu odzwa nde. Mu obo, nde ágwolo mukakana wu obvughuru mu nzili yi a Masedwane. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Sopatere mwana a Piruse musi Bere, Arisitarake ya Sekunduse basi Tesalonike, Ngayuse musi Derebe, Timote, Tisike ya Torofime baara baba etsulu e nsie kii Adzi, bágyene ya nde. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Bo bátswama ku nkulu ya báyikebe bihi ŋa bvulu lili Torowase. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Ya ŋa mbihi a kyiri kii mampa ma magwene a pfunu, bihi líisomo bwara ŋa Filipe. Ŋa mbihi a bitsughu bitaana, bihi líiyibagha bo ŋa bvulu lili Torowase ya líiluhu bitsughu nsaama oŋo.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Midzye mi Poole mimi masini ku Torowase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Mu etsughu kii bisemene mu nkonkolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bisemene mu nkonkolo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kundaa ba-Dzwife, etsughu kii nsomo mu limiŋi okabaana mu etsughu kii bisemene mu nkonkolo ya okayisughu mu limiŋi mu matala ma ookadzyama tala.</char></note>, bihi líibvuŋunu mu okaba limpa. Ya Poole ákamoõ ya bihi. Mu kuulu nde mbala ákagye, nde ádzuru emoõ tee kara-a-kara a mpyibi. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Bihi áli liibvuŋunu mu ngwumu yi a ku yulu. Omo óli a miindi milagha. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Mu matala ma ókabiri Poole emoõ ela-ela, mumpala mumõ wu a nkwumu Etike áli abwi-nsini ŋa etse <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">etse </char><char style="ft" closed="false">fenetere</char></note>e nzo ya ákpi mukaba a ensama. Kunsa ensama, nde alighibi ku yulu a muya a nzo wu mitere ya ábwi ku nsie. Bu basagha otehebe nde, bámono ti nde ákpi. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Poole bu asughuru, ápfuŋumu, ágwolo nde ya ályele ti: «Ka likala maŋa-maŋa o, nde mweẽ ali!» <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Bu abvughuru ku yulu a nzo, Poole átsyiri limpa áli. Nde áfiribiri emoõ ela-ela tee ku oki bwihi, ya ábwi nzili ágyene. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Bábiri mumpala munde wu a mweẽ, ya bo bwohono bábagha bukyini bulagha.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole mara ku bvulu lili Torowase, gyene ku mbwuu yi a bvulu lili Mile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Bihi líitswama nkulu ya líiyisomo bwara bu bunene mu ogye ku Asose. Oko bihi líkaabulugwolo Poole, wu áagyene oko mu myili ti bu oli waa li nde. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Mu matala ma áyabagha nde bihi ŋa mbwuu yi a Asose, nde ásomo mu bwara li líli bihi ya líigyene bihi bwohono ku bvulu lili Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Bu limara oŋo, bihi líigwolo nzili yi a mubu. Ya mu etsughu ki nsomo, bihi líiyito ŋa elyi kii Kiyo. Mbala bihi líipala ku elyi kii Samose. Ya muyiri-mbala bihi líiyito ŋa mbwuu yi a bvulu lili Mile. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Poole ágwaa mu oluru mikiŋi bvulu lili Efedze, mu kuulu bihi linyaã ofiriluhu matala mu etsulu e nsie kii Adzi. Nde ákabiŋini oyito ku Yerusaleme mu etsughu kii Pantekote.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole bili kundaa bakwuru ba libwunu lili Efedze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Poole bu ato ku Mile, ágweghe bambiŋini ku Efedze mu oyita bakwuru ba libwunu li Nzaami mbili. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Bo bu bayato kundaa Poole, nde ályele bo ti: «Be ligyahaba, bu áakankala me ya be matala mwohono, obaana mu etsughu kii nsomo ki áyanto me ku Adzi. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Me aansalala Mfumu kunsa okughulu kwohono, mu mansaã ya mu makimini ma óokasa me ba-Dzwife mamfwunu. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Be lisoolo ti me ka ákansweghe be ndagha si mõ yi kughu okala mupfunu kundaa be o. Lo me áakanduo ya áakangyihi be mye ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono ya mu manzo. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Me áakanduomo kundaa ba-Dzwife ya baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o bagyiŋi mayele, bagya kundaa Nzaami ya basa kana mu Mfumu a bihi Yiisu.»<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />«Mu matala ma, me ndi mu okagye ku Yerusaleme bwunu a bu oli mu okatumu me ya epini Mufulu a Ngili. Me ka nsoolo o, nsa ndagha me aambwana a yo oko. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Lo mu engaŋma, Mufulu a Ngili li mu okalyele kundaa me ti, mu nswe bvulu, mindala ya kimini bili mu okakebe me. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Lo mu me, laama li me ka lili a mupfunu o. Ndagha yi li mupfunu kundaa me, oto ku masini ma esala ya osala esala ki ógwi me Mfumu Yiisu, mu okala mpughulu a Nsia yi Mbwe yi a bwehe bu Nzaami.»<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />«Me áakankala ŋa kara li be mu okaluo be mu mi mitala Emfumu e Nzaami. Lo obaana lolo, me nsoolo ti be ka lifirimono edzili e me o. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Mu obo, etsughu kii lolo me ndyele kundaa be ti: Kala ti be lidzimini, me ka ankala a ebili mu be bwohono o. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Mu engaŋma, me aandyele be bitsimi bi Nzaami byehene, me ka aansweghe be ndagha si mõ o. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Likahala mihi mu beme ya mu mukaã a bindoomo wohono wu oogwi be Mufulu a Ngili mu okebe. Ligyighili okebe libwunu li Nzaami, li aabagha nde mu makili ma mwana a nde.»<verse eid="ACT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />«Me nsoolo ti ŋa mbihi a ŋa aangye me, baara ba bali ti bango sa bapala. Ya bo ka babvwuhu mukaã a bindoomo o. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Ŋa kara li be, sa okala a baara ba baalyele mandagha mama mpya, mu kuulu binduono bigwuŋumu ya binama bo. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Mu obo, likala yeelee, ya liikalibili mweẽ ti mu bamvulu batere, mpyibi ya mwiĩ, ngu okala ti kunsa mansaã, me ka aandzimini ogyehe nswe mbwuru ŋa kara li be o.»<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />«Lo mu matala ma, me ngwaghala be ŋa myaã mi Nzaami ya kunsa ndagha a nde yi a bwehe. Nde wu li a lileene mu osa ti be likulu mu kana ya mu ogwa pfa kundaa baba ngili bwohono. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Me ka áansughu mukolo mu nzi, mu oore, bwunu we mu binkuru bi mbwuru o. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Myaã mi liilomono be mi, be beme lisoolo ti me aankasala mu obagha bibye bi liili a bihi nzala bye, me ya ba baakabulugye ya me. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Mu mandagha mwohono, me áakansuo be ti, me mu okasala obo be lifaana obaha babo ba bagwene a mpini, ya mu okalibili mweẽ mandagha ma ólyele Mfumu Yiisu ndeme ti: “Esee kii wu aakagwa ebvulu kii munde wu aakagyagha.”»<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Bu amana olyele mandagha mamo, nde ya bo bwohono bákunu mabuo ŋa nsie ya nde ábuono Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Baara bwohono bábuulu elili, ya bákabwumu Poole mu ogwa nde mboro yi a masini. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Bo bányoõ ku olagha mu nkooro a bu ályele nde kundaa bo ti, bo akala ka bafirimono nde o. Ya bo báyitwulu nde tee ŋa bwara.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Bu likaghaba ya bo, bihi líisomo mu bwara ya líigyene nsumu ku elyi kii Kose. Mu etsughu ki énama, bihi líigyene ku elyi kii Rode, ya bu limara oko, líigyene ku bvulu lili Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Oko, bihi líimono bwara bu búkagye ku nkolo yi a nsie yi a Fenisi, bihi líisomo omo ya líigyene. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Bu lito ŋa bele a elyi kii Syipere, bihi líisihi kye ku engbambogho, ya líinama nzili yi a madza ku nto yi a nsie yi a Siri. Bihi líipala mu bwara ŋa mbwuu yi a Tire, mu kuulu me oŋo bákasurulu bilogho bi bíli mu bwara. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Oŋo, bihi líimono binduono ya líiluhu bitsughu nsaama emõ ya bo. Mu litumu li Mufulu, bo bályele kundaa Poole anyaã okumu ku Yerusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ŋa mbihi a bitsughu nsaama bibye, bihi líitemene mu ogye. Ya bo bwohono, bakaha ya baana ba bo, báyitwulu bihi tee ku nto a bvulu. Bu lito ŋa mukogho a mubu, bihi bwohono líikunu mabuo ŋa nsie, ya líisamana Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ŋa masini, bu ligwihini a mamboro mama okaghaba, bihi líisomo munsa bwara ya bo bábvughuru ku manzo ma bo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Bihi líimana dzwe mu mubu, bu libaana ku Tire, líyisughu ŋa Petolemayise. Oŋo bihi líigwi bandughu mu libwunu mamboro, ya líiluhu etsughu etsyini ya bo oŋo. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Mu etsughu ki énama, bihi líigyene ya líiyito ku Sedzare. Oko bihi líigyene ku nzo a Filipe, Muluo a Nsia yi Mbwe. Nde áli mumõ mu babaghala nsaama ba básuolo ku Yerusaleme mu obaha bantumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">babaghala nsaama ba básuolo ku Yerusaleme mu obaha bantumu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tala Bisala 6.5 ya 8.5-40</char></note>. Ya bihi líiluhu mana a bitsughu kundaa nde. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Nde áli a batughu bana baba minkyini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">minkyini </char><char style="ft" closed="false">batughu baala nkini baasoolo babaghala o</char></note> ya báli mibighili. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Bihi áli limaaluhu bitsughu bilagha oŋo, mu matala ma óyato mubighili mumõ wu áafi ku Yude, nkwumu a nde Angabuse. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Nde bu agyi kundaa bihi, ágwolo muswele a Poole, ákuru myili ya myaã mi ndeme ya ályele ndiri: «Mufulu a Ngili li mu okalyele bu: Ba-Dzwife baba ku Yerusaleme me bu akala baakuru mbwuru nga-a-muswele wu misyi, ya akala baagwa nde ŋa myaã mi baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o.» <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Bihi ya baara baba bvulu lili Sedzare bu ligyughu mandagha mamo, líibuono Poole anyaã okumu ku Yerusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Lo nde ábvuhulu ti: «Mu emakye be lili mu okalili ya omwehẽ mukolo me mpara? Me aankughu mu ogwa nyuru a me, ka oli yini a mu kuulu bakuru me misyi o, lo ya mu okpa si ku Yerusaleme mu nkooro a nkwumu a Mfumu Yiisu.» <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Buulu bihi ka líkakughu opeene a nde o, bihi líinyaã ya líilyele ti: «Nyaã okala bu oli dzyi li Mfumu!»<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Ŋa mbihi a bitsughu bibye, bihi líikuru matsulu ya líikumu ku Yerusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Binduono bibike bibi ku Sedzare bi bíkagye nzili mõ ya bihi, bíbiri bihi ku nzo a Menasõ, wuulu obaana edzighi áli enduono. Nde áli musi Syipere.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole bwana a bakwuru ku Yerusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Mu matala ma líto bihi ku Yerusaleme, bandughu mu libwunu bábwana bihi mu esee. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Mu etsughu ki énama, Poole ábiri bihi kundaa Dzake, ku ókabvuŋunu bakwuru ba libwunu bwohono. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Poole ágwi bo mboro, ya ábwi olyele kundaa bo myehene mi ógyighili Nzaami ŋa kara li baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, mu musala a nde. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Bo bu bamana ogyughu mandagha mamo, bábwi osyighi Nzaami. Ya bo bályele kundaa Poole ti: «Ndughu a bihi mu kana, mono mafwunu ya mafwunu ma ba-Dzwife ma maasi kana, ya bo bwohono bali mu okanama mikyene ya dzyi li lilagha. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Ankoho bo baagyughu ti we li mu okaluo ba-Dzwife bwohono baba mansie mama banzyi ti basihi Mikyene mi Moyidze, banyaã ofirikasohobo baana ba bo nzo a mbaa ya banyaã ofirikanama ekulu ki ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Lo emakye liisa? Bo sa bagyughu ti we aagyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Mu obo, we faana ogyighili mandagha ma liilyele bihi we. Ŋa kara li bihi oli a babaghala bana ba bágwi Nzaami misiini mu bomo. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Gye ya bo, sa mansagha mama otsehebe nyuru a we emõ ya bo, ya we firi nzi mu kuulu basa bo mankulu. Obo, baara bwohono sa basoolo ti mandagha mwohono ma báakabili bo mu nyuru a we mali mama mpya, ya ti wehe si aakasalala Mikyene mi Moyidze. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Lo kundaa baara baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, ba baasi kana, bihi liisono mukaana mu olyele bo mandagha ma liikuru bihi. Mandagha mamo me ma: Banyaã odza tuo li banyama ba baagwi mukaba kundaa banzaami baba bityeghe. Banyaã oŋma makili ya odza tuo li banyama ba baakpi mbibili ya banyaã osa enkwunu.»<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Mu etsughu ki énama, Poole ágwolo babaghala babo, ási mansagha mama otsehebe manyuru emõ ya bo. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, bo básomo mu nzo a Nzaami mu ogwalagha li baamana bo mansagha mama otsehebe manyuru ya nswe mbwuru mu bo àagwa ekaba.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basyimi Poole munsa nzo a Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ku bele a masini ma bitsughu nsaama bibi mansagha mama otsehebe manyuru, ba-Dzwife ba báfi ku Adzi bámono Poole mu nzo a Nzaami yi nene. Bo bátsiini mpwumu a baara mu osa ngirini ya bo básyimi nde. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Bo bákakehe bingubu ti: «Basi Isarayele, liyabaha bihi! Limono mbwuru me wu li mu okabululuo kundaa baara bwohono ya mu bibini byehene maluo ma mali mu okakabyihi embwuru ki ekaana e bihi-a-be, Mikyene ya ebini ki. Ya mu matala ma, nde aasohobo si baara baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o munsa nzo a Nzaami, ya aatsaala bungili bu ebini kii ngili ki.» <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Buulu bo áli batswama omono nde ya Torofime musi Efedze munsa bvulu, bo bátsimi ti Poole nde aasohobo munsa nzo a Nzaami yi nene.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Mpaatsala yíbwi mu bvulu lwohono ya baara bágyi mu mampwumu. Bo básyimi Poole ya bákwolo nde ku mbala. Ya básaakuru bidzughubu bi nzo a Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Mu matala ma bákasagha bo odzwa Poole, nsia yi yíto kundaa mukwuru a pfwunu li bambumbulu (1 000) lili ba-Romẽ ti mpaatsala yiibwi mu bvulu lili Yerusaleme lwohono. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Mu maswa-maswa, nde ábvughu bamfumu ba bikuru bi bambumbulu nkama ya bambumbulu ba bo, ya bágyene ku óli mpwumu a baara. Baara bu bamono mukwuru a bambumbulu ya bambumbulu ba nde, bo bányaã ofirikaha Poole. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Mu obo, mukwuru a pfwunu (1 000) li bambumbulu bu ayabehene, ágwi litumu básyimi Poole ya bakuru nde misyi myele mimi bisyeẽ. Ŋa nseele, nde ásagha ogyahaba baghala munde nande ali, ya nsa ndagha nde aasi? <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Lo kunsa mpwumu a baara, bana bákakehe bingubu mu ndagha yi, babake bákakehe bingubu mu ndagha nkimi. Buulu oli a nkele yi alagha, mukwuru a pfwunu li bambumbulu (1 000) ka áleene osoolo kumu li ndagha o. Mu obo, nde ágwi litumu babiri Poole kunsa ekagha ku ookakala bambumbulu. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Mu matala ma óli Poole ŋa yulu a ekaala kii osomo kunsa ekagha, bambumbulu báseene nde mu kuulu mpwumu a baara yíli a kabala li lilagha. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Baara bwohono bákanama nde ya bákabiili engubu bu: «Nde wu odzwa!»<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole kala nyuru a nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Mu matala ma bákasohobo Poole kunsa ekagha ku ookakala bambumbulu, nde ályele kundaa mukwuru a pfwunu li bambumbulu (1 000) ti: «Me nkughu olyele we ndagha nga-mõ?» Mfumu a bambumbulu ábvuhulu ti: «We soolo obili engereke? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />We ka li musi Edzipite wu aayasohobo mpaatsala mu bitsughu bi biiluru bi, ya wu aabiri mapfwunu mana (4 000) ma bantwumu ba baakadzwa baara ku syehe o?» <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Poole ábvuhulu ti: «Me, me ndi mu-Dzwife, musi Tarese, bvulu lili nsia, mu etsulu e nsie kii Silisi. Kolokolo a we, gwa me muswa me mbili kundaa baara ba.» <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Mukwuru a bambumbulu bu agwi nde muswa, Poole átemene ŋa yulu a ekaala, áseene ekee mu olyele kundaa mpwumu a baara yikala pii. Baara bwohono bákala pii ya nde ábili kundaa bo mu ndiĩ yi a Eebere ti:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />«Baana ba taara ya bataara ba me, mu matala ma ligyughu mandagha ma aandyele me be mu okala nyuru a me.» <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Bo bu bagyughu Poole mu okabili kundaa bo mu Eebere<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eeb </char><char style="ft" closed="false">E-arameẽ ndiĩ a ba-Dzwife.</char></note>, báfirikala pii ku olagha. <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />Nde ályele bo ti: «Me ndi mu-Dzwife, wu báburu ku Tarese, mu nsie yi a Silisi, lo me mu bvulu li nkulu, mu Yerusaleme ya me áangyighili ogyighi bwunu a bu ofaana Mikyene mi bataara ba bihi ŋa myili mi Ngamalyele. Me áli aakansalala Nzaami mu mukolo wu áalwulu mu dzyi mu Nzaami ti bu lili mu okasalala be lolo bu. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Me áankamwehẽ baara ba bákanama nzili a Mfumu kimini tee ku lipfu. Me áakankuru babaghala ya bakaha minkana, ya me áakando bo mu manzo ma boloko. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mukwuru a bangaa ba Nzaami ya mfwunu a bakwuru bali bampughulu mu mi ndi mu okabili me. Me bo báagwi me mikaana mi óyisyimi bandughu mu kana baba ku Damase mu matala ma ángyene me oko. Bo báagwi me litumu lii oyisyimi ya oyabiri baara ku Yerusaleme buulu basyeme bo.»<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole lyele bu ágyiŋi nde mayele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">9.1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />«Me áli mu nzili mu okagye, ku bele a ntaã a minsene, me áambehene ya bvulu lili Damase. Ya ensihibi, otsyeme kuu mpini ófi ku yulu ya ótsehebe ebini ki ándi me. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Me áambwi ŋa nsie ya áangyughu likyi li líkalyele me ti: “Sawule, Sawule, mu emakye we li mu okamwehẽ me kimini?” <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Me áamfwulu ti: “Mfumu, we na?” Likyi líbvuhulu ti: “Me ndi Yiisu, musi Nadzarete. Me me we li mu okamwehẽ kimini.” <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Baara ba báli ya me bámono otsyeme, lo bo ka bágyughu likyi li líkabili kundaa me o. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Mu obo, me áamfwulu bu: “Mfumu, emakye me mfaana osa?” Ya Mfumu ábvuhulu kundaa me ti: “Temene, gye ku Damase, ya oko sa balyele we mandagha mwohono ma faana we osa.” <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Buulu musehene a otsyeme oko ádzwi me mihi, baara ba báli ya me bákwara me mu kwogho ya bábiri me ku Damase.»<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />«Oko óli a baghala mutsyini wu a nkwumu Ananyase. Nde áli a enzaami ki ebwe ya ákakebe Mikyene. Ba-Dzwife bwohono ba báli mu Damase báli bampughulu mu bigyighili bi nde bi bibwe. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Ananyase áyamono me ya ályele ti: “Sawule, mwana a taara a me, nyaã we firimono!” Ya mu matala maana mamo, me áamfirimono ya áamono nde. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Nde ályele kundaa me ti: “Nzaami a bataara ba bihi áli aatswama osuolo we mu kuulu we soolo dzyi li nde, we mono munde wu a Nsumu, ya we gyughu likyi li nde. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />We faana okala mpughulu a nde ŋa nkulu a baara bwohono, mu olyele bo mandagha ma aamono ya ma aagyughu we. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Lo mu matala ma, emakye we li mu ofirikyele? Temene, bagha liboghoro ya gyagha otsehebe ku masumu ma we mu okasamana mu nkwumu a Mfumu.”»<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole suo bu bágweghe nde kundaa bikaana biili ka bili bibi ba-Dzwife o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />«Bu ámbvughuru ku Yerusaleme ya bu ánkansamana munsa nzo a Nzaami, me áambagha limono. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Me áamono Mfumu ya nde ályele me ti: “Saana sa maswa, pala mu Yerusaleme! Mu kuulu baara ba bvulu lilo ka bakihi bumpughulu bu we mu me o.” <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Me áambvuhulu ti: “Mfumu, bo basoolo ti me me áakabulungye mu manzo ma ba-Dzwife mama lisamana mu okabululo mu maboloko ya okabulukaha nswanswa babo ba baakasa kana mu we. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Ya ŋa bátsala makili ma Etiene, wu áali mpughulu a we, me áandi oŋo. Me áankihi bitsimi bi ba bákadzwa nde ya me áakankebe binkuru bi bo.” <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Lo Mfumu ályele kundaa me ti: “Gye, mu kuulu me sa ngweghe we ku la, kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o.”»<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole ya mukwuru a bambumbulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Ba-Dzwife ba bákagyughu Poole tee ŋa ályele nde mandagha mamo, bábwi okabiili bingubu: «Limaha mbwuru wu a bu ŋa yulu a nsie, nde ka afaana ofirikala mweẽ o!» <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Bo bákagyighili ofiribiili bingubu, bákatsili binkuru bi bo ya bákaseene lifufunu mu yulu. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Mukwuru a bambumbulu ágwi litumu basohobo Poole kunsa ekagha ku ookakala bambumbulu, ya bakakubu nde nswanswa ŋa bàagwa nde bifwulu, mpaala basoolo mu nsa ndagha baara bákakehe bingubu bibye mu nde. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Bu bakuru nde minkana mpaala bakaha nde nswanswa, Poole ályele kundaa Mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu nkama wu áli oŋo ti: «Bunu, be lili a muswa wu okaha mu-Romẽ nswanswa, ŋaala be nde nkini muyala osa we?» <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu nkama bu ágyughu obo, nde áyilyele kundaa mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu pfwunu ti: «Bunu-abo we àasa? Mbwuru wu li musi Rome!» <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu pfwunu ágyene ya áyifwulu Poole ti: «Lyele me, mu ngaŋma we li musi Rome?» Nde ákihi: «Heẽ». <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu pfwunu áfirilyele ti: «Me áangyehe nzi yi alagha mu okighiri musi Rome.» Poole ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Me, me ndi musi Rome wu emburu ngughu.» <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Mu matala maana mamo, babo ba bákasagha ogwa nde bifwulu bányaã nde. Lo mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu pfwunu ábagha nzalamweẽ ŋa ábaghala nde ti mu-Romẽ nde átumu bakuru minkana.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Poole ŋa nkulu a mfwunu a ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Mu etsughu ki ékanama, mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu pfwunu bu áli a nzala ogyighili ogyahaba ndagha yi mubwughu yi ófwunu ba-Dzwife Poole, átumu banyana nde minkana. Ya nde ábvughu bakwuru ba bangaa ba Nzaami ya mfwunu a ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife yohono. Ŋa nseele, nde ápaha Poole, átwulu nde ŋa nkulu a bo, mpaala bo bagyughu nde.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Poole bu atala mfwunu a ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife pii, ályele ti: «Baana ba taara a me, munsa mukolo a me, me bu nsoolo ti, me áakandzyara mu bunsumu ŋa busu bu Nzaami, tee mu etsughu kii lolo.» <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Lo Ananyase, mukwuru a bangaa ba Nzaami átumu ba báli ŋa bele a Poole bakaha nde mu muŋma. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Mu obo Poole ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mu mukubu wu a we, Nzaami sa akaha we, ebagha ki básyili mpeeme! We aabwi-nsini ŋa mu olamana me ti bwunu a bu ookatumu Mikyene. Lo we oŋo Mikyene li mu osalala bu li mu ogwa litumu ti bakaha me?» <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Ba báli oŋo bályele kundaa nde ti: «We aatughu Mukwuru a bangaa ba Nzaami!» <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Poole ábvuhulu ti: «Baana ba taara a me, me ka aakansoolo o ti nde me Mukwuru a bangaa ba Nzaami. Mu engaŋma básono ti: “We ka tughu mfumu a nsie a we o.”»<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Nde bu asoolo ti kunsa mfwunu a ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife babake báli ba-Saduseyẽ ya ba bamo ba-Faridzyẽ, Poole ákehe engubu ŋa kara li bo ti: «Baana ba taara a me, me ndi mu-Faridzyẽ, mwana a mu-Faridzyẽ, mu nkooro a kana li bihi mu osighili o baara mu lipfu bali mu okalamana me.» <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Nde bu amana obili obo, mumbaŋana ábwi ŋa kara li ba-Faridzyẽ ya ba-Saduseyẽ, ya emvuŋunu ékaghaba mu makaba muolo. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Mu kuulu ba-Saduseyẽ baakalyele ti osighili o baara mu lipfu ka oli o, bangye-yulu ka bali o, Mifulu si ka mili o. Lo ba-Faridzyẽ baakasa kana mu mandagha mwohono mamo. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Nkele yífiriluru. Ndaama a baluo-mikyene mimi kaba lili ba-Faridzyẽ bátemene ya bákabili mu mpini ti: «Bihi ka liimono ebili mu mbwuru wu o. Nkini a nki mufulu, bwunu we ngye-yulu aabili kundaa nde!» <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Buulu mumbaŋana ákabvulu mpini, mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu pfwunu, bu amono nzalamweẽ ti bo bakughu okaghala Poole mu bipa, nde átumu bambumbulu basughuru, bapaha nde ŋa kara li bo ya babiri nde kunsa ekagha ku ookakala bambumbulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Mu mpyibi yi áanama, Mfumu ámoŋono kundaa Poole ya ályele nde ti: «Kala a bukyini! Mu kuulu, bwunu a bu aakala we mpughulu a me mu Yerusaleme, bumõ si we faana okala mpughulu a me ku Rome.»<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakuru Poole mfwunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Bwihi bu buki, ba-Dzwife bákuru mfwunu, báli mukakana ya bályele ti bo ka badza o ya ka baŋma o tee mu matala ma baadzwa bo Poole. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Ba-Dzwife ba bákuru mfwunu oyo áli baluru makwumu-mana (40) ma baara. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Bo báyimono bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya bakwuru ba ekaana. Bályele kundaa bo ti: «Bihi liili mukakana ti bihi ka lidza o ya ka liŋma o tee mu matala ma liidzwa bihi Poole. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Mu obo, ligwihini ya mfwunu a bakwuru ba ba-Dzwife, mu oyilyele mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu ti bagya a be Poole mu mpere yiili be ligyighili okeene ndagha a nde embe. Bihi me baala sa liyikehele nde ya lidzwa nde, nsomo nde ayato ŋa.»<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Lo mwana a nkele a Poole wu baghala ásoolo mfwunu oyo, ágyene ku ekagha ku ookakala bambumbulu, ásomo omo ya ályele ndagha oyo kundaa Poole. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Poole áti mumõ mu bakwuru ba bikuru bi bambumbulu nkama mbili, ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Biri mumpala wu kundaa mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu pfwunu, nde li a ndagha yi aalyele nde.» <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu nkama ábiri nde kundaa mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu pfwunu ya ályele ti: «Poole wu liilo mu boloko aati me mbili, ya aatumu me yambiri mumpala wu kundaa we. Nde li a ndagha yi aalyele we.» <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu pfwunu ákwara nde mu kwogho, ágyene a nde mu libee ya áfwulu nde ti: «We nsa ndagha li a yo yi aalyele me?» <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Mumpala ábvuhulu nde ti: «Ba-Dzwife baagwihini mu oluomo kundaa we ti mbala we biri Poole ŋa nkulu a mfwunu a bo. Bo sa balyele we ti bo badzyi ogyighili okeene ndagha a nde embe. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Lo we me wuulu ka akihi bitsimi bi bo o. Mu kuulu oli a makwumu-mana (40) ma baara ŋa kara li bo ba baayikehele nde. Bo baali mukakana ti, bo ka badza o ya ka baŋma o, tee mu matala ma baadzwa bo Poole. Mu matala ma bo bali yeelee, yini a mvuru a we bali mu okakebe.» <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu pfwunu ábvuhulu mumpala ya átswi nde mukele ti: «Ka lyele mbwuru ti we aasuo me mfwunu oyo o.»<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babiri Poole ku bvulu lili Sedzare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu pfwunu áti buolo mu bakwuru ba bikuru bi bambumbulu nkama mbili, ya ályele bo ti: «Likala yeelee mu ogye ku Sedzare, mu tala lili wa mu mpyibi. Ligwolo nkama ywolo yi a bambumbulu (200), makwumu-nsaama (70) mama ba baakabiri basyevale ya nkama ywolo (200) yi a bambumbulu ba bali a magyuo. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Ligyighili si basyevale ba baabiri Poole wu mukughu ya mweẽ kundaa Felikise, mfumu a etsulu e nsie.» <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Nde ásono bu mu mukaana:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />«Kundaa we Felikise, mfumu wu budziri, mboro a we! Me Kolode Lisyase, ndi mu osono. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Mbwuru wu ngweghe me we, ba-Dzwife baasyimi nde ya baadzyi odzwa nde. Me bu aangyughu ti nde li musi Rome, me aangyene ya mpwumu a bambumbulu ba me mu okwulu nde. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Me bu aandzyi osoolo ebili ki baafwunu nde, me aambiri nde ŋa nkulu a mfwunu a bakwuru ba bo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Me aamono ti mandagha ma bali mu okafwunu nde matala mumbaŋana mu mikyene mi bo. Ka oli a ndagha yi bakughu odzwa nde o, bwunu we olo nde mu boloko. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Me bu aangyughu ti bo baakuru mfwunu mu odzwa mbwuru wu, me ngweghe we nde mu maswa-maswa. Ya me aanduomo kundaa ba bali mu okafwunu nde, bayalyele ŋa mihi mi we ebili ki baabagha bo mu nde.»<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Bambumbulu bágyene a Poole ya bábiri nde mu mpyibi ŋa bvulu lili Antipatirise ti bwunu a bu óli litumu li bágwi bo. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Etsughu ki énama, bambumbulu ba bákagye mu myili, bábvughuru ku ekagha ku ookakala bambumbulu, ba bákabiri basyevale bánama nzili ya Poole. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Bu bato ku Sedzare, bambumbulu ba baakabiri basyevale bágwi mukaana kundaa mfumu a etsulu e nsie, ya básuo nde si Poole. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Mfumu a etsulu e nsie átaã mukaana ya áfwulu Poole munsa etsulu e nsie nde áfi. Poole ályele nde ti ku Silisi. <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Nde ályele kundaa Poole ti: «Me sa ngyughu we mu matala ma ookala ba baafwunu we ŋa nkulu a me.» Nde ágwi litumu bakebe Poole mu nzo a emfumu yi ótwu Erode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Ba-Dzwife bafwunu Poole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Ŋa mbihi a bitsighu bitaana, Ananyase, Mukwuru a bangaa ba nzaami ákumunu ku bvulu lili Sedzare nzili mõ ya ndaama a bakwuru ba ba-Dzwife, ya Teretuluse, nsughu a bo. Bo báfwunu Poole kundaa mfumu a etsulu e nsie. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Bu bati Poole mbili, Teretuluse ábaana okwighi nde mandagha bu: «Mfumu wu munene, bihi lili kunsa edzuunu ki enene mu nkooro a we, ya mu mandagha mwohono mama lisobo maasi we mu Ekaana ki. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Felikise wu a nkara budziri! Mu matala mwohono ya mu bibini byehene, bihi liikabvurulu matuono ma malagha mu mandagha ma mabwe mwohono ma aakagyighili we. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Lo mu ogwene oluhu we matala, me mbuono we, ya mu bubwe bu we, magyughu bihi. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Bihi liimono ti mbwuru wu nkara a mubi. Nde aakatsubu ngirini ŋa kara li ba-Dzwife bwohono baba nsie nsyini. Ya nde li mukwuru a emvuŋunu ki basi Nadzarete. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Nde aagyeele otsaala bungili bu nzo a Nzaami, me mu obo bihi liisyimi nde. [Bihi liidzyi olamana nde ti bwunu a bu oli mikyene mi bihi, <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />lo Lisyase, mukwuru a bambumbulu, áyagwohono bihi nde mu mpini. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Ya aagwi litumu kundaa ba baafwunu nde mu ogya ŋa nkulu a we]. We kughu ofwulu baghala wu weme, ya we sa mono ti mandagha ma lili mu okasa bihi nde mumfwunu mali mama ngaŋma.» <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Ba-Dzwife básyighi mandagha ma ólyele Teretuluse, ti mo máli mama ngaŋma.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole bili mu okala nyuru a nde ŋa nkulu a Felikise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Mfumu a etsulu e nsie ágwi nde muswa mu obili, ya Poole ábvuhulu ti: «Me nsoolo ti obaana bamvulu balagha, we aakalamana baara ba ekaana ki mu bunsumu. Me mu obo me ndi a kana mu okala nyuru a me. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Bitsughu kwumu ya byele (12) nkini biiluru o, obaana bu áankumu me ku Yerusaleme mu oyibuono Nzaami. We kughu ofwulu ndagha oyo. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Mbwuru si mumõ ka aamono me mu okatsoho ya mbwuru o, bwunu we mu okatihi mpwumu a baara. Ngu okala mu Nzo a nzaami, ngu okala mu manzo ma lisamana ma ba-Dzwife, ngu okala munsa bvulu. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Baara ba, ka bakughu osuo we o ti ndagha yi bali mu okasa me mumfwunu mu matala ma yili yi a ngaŋma. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Mono ndagha yinsoolo me: Me aakambuono Nzaami a bataara ba bihi mu nzili a Mfumu yi bali mu okata bo ti Emvu-mvuŋunu. Me aakansa kana mu mi básono mu Mikyene ya mu mibighili. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Kana li aakansa me mu Nzaami ti sa okala a osighili o baara baba nsumu ya ba bagwene a bunsumu mu lipfu, me lyini lilo si bo bali a lo. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Me mu obo meme si aakansa mpini mu matala mwohono mu omoŋono mbwuru wu gwene a bitsimi bi okughu osyeme Nzaami ya baara. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Ŋa mbihi a bamvulu balagha baala me ka ándi ya be o, me aayamvughuru ku Yerusaleme mu oyabiri libaha kundaa ekaana e me, ya mu ogwa bikaba kundaa Nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Me mu matala mamo bo baamono me munsa Nzo a nzaami ŋa mbihi a mansagha mama otsehebe nyuru a me. Ka ókakala a mpwumu a baara o, ya ka ókakala a kyaã o. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Lo ba-Dzwife babake baba ku Adzi, ba bákakala oŋo, me bo bakaafwunu me kundaa we, kala ti boho si baamono ndagha yi mbi mu me. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Bwunu we, nyaã baara ba balyele ndagha yi mbi yibaamono bo mu me, ŋa baalamana me ŋa nkulu a mfwunu a ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Bunu, yini a mu nkooro a ndagha yi aankehe me engubu mu mutele ŋa kara li bo ti: “Mu osighili o ba bákpi mu lipfu bali mu okalamana me lolo li ŋa nkulu a be?”»<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Felikise wu áakagyighili osoolo mi mitala nzili a Mfumu, ábvurulu bo ya ályele ndiri: «Me sa ndamana ndagha a be ŋa ooyakumunu Lisyase Mfumu a ekuru ki bambumbulu pfwunu ŋa.» <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Nde ágwi litumu kundaa mfumu a ekuru ki bambumbulu nkama mu okebe Poole mu boloko ya mana bumpoholo, ya anyaã bandughu ba nde bumpoholo mu okabaha nde.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole ŋa nkulu a Felikise ya Durusile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Ŋa mbihi a mana bitsughu, Felikise ya Durusile, mukala a nde wu mu-Dzwife, bágyi. Nde átumu bayibiŋini Poole ya nde ágyughu nde mu okabili mu kana mu Yiisu-Kriste. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Lo mu matala ma óbwi obili Poole mu mi mitala bunsumu, okebe nyuru ya mumfwunu wu akala aagya, Felikise ábagha nzalamweẽ ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mu matala ma, magye! Me sa nta we mbili mu sa likimi.» <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Felikise áli a kana ti Poole sa agwa nde nzi. Mu obo nde ákata nde mbili matala malagha mu okamoõ ya nde. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Ŋa mbihi a bamvulu buolo, Porosiyuse Fesetuse ákiri Felikise ŋa emfumu. Buulu Felikise ákasagha ogwa ba-Dzwife esee, nde ányaghala Poole mu boloko.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Poole luomo balamana nde ŋa nkulu a Sedzare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Fesetuse áto mu etsulu e nsie kii Yude. Ŋa mbihi a bitsughu bitere nde ámara ku Sedzare ya ákumu ku Yerusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya ba-Dzwife baba mupfunu báyimono Fesetuse ya báfwunu Poole kundaa nde. Bo bási enziini, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />mu obuono Fesetuse abvurulu Poole ku Yerusaleme. Mu engaŋma, bo áli bakuru mfwunu yi okehele nde mu nzili mu kuulu badzwa nde. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Lo Fesetuse ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti Poole áli mu boloko lili ku Sedzare, ya edzi-dzighi ndeme ákabvughuru oko. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Nde áfirilyele ti: «Nyaã bamfumu ba be bakumunu nzili mõ ya me ku Sedzare, ya bo bafwunu nde oko, kala ti nde li a ebili.»<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesetuse áluhu bitsighu mpuomo bwunu we kwumu ku Yerusaleme, ŋa mbihi nde ákumunu ku Sedzare. Mu etsughu ki énama, nde bu abwi-nsini ŋa ebini kii muyala, átumu bayabiri nde Poole. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Poole bu ayato, ba-Dzwife ba báfi ku Yerusaleme bádzyi nde ya bábwi okaburulu nde mandagha ma malagha ya mama mpara. Lo bo ka bákakughu osuo engaŋma ki mandagha mamo o. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Poole ákala nyuru a nde ya ályele ti: «Me ka aansi bubi o, ngu okala ŋa nkulu a Mikyene mi ba-Dzwife, ngu okala mu nzo a nzaami, ngu okala mu mi mitala mukogho Sedzare.»<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Fesetuse bu ákadzyi ogwa ba-Dzwife esee áfwulu Poole ti: «We dzyi okumu ku Yerusaleme mu kuulu balamana ndagha a we yi oko ŋa nkulu a me?» <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Lo Poole ábvuhulu ti: «Me ndi ŋa mbala a muyala a mukogho Sedzare, me ŋa ebini ki bafaana olamana me. Ti bwunu a bu gyighili osoolo weme, me ka aansi ndagha yi mbi kundaa ba-Dzwife o. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Kala ti me ka ndi a bwuu o ya kala ti me aansi bubi buulu bafaana odzwa me, lo me ka nkughu obihi lipfu o. Lo kala ti mandagha ma oli mu okaburulu me baara ba mali mama bwunu, lo mbwuru ka li a muswa mu otyeghe me ŋa myaã mi bo o. Me nduomo mukogho Sedzare alamana ndagha a me.» <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Fesetuse bu afi ku mfwunu ya bansughu-a-lamana, ágwi nde mvuru yi: «We aaluomo ti mukogho Sedzare alamana ndagha a we, we sa gye ŋa nkulu a Sedzare!»<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Poole ŋa nkulu a mukogho Angiripa ya Berenise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Mana bitsughu bu biluru, mukogho Angiripa ya Berenise báyato mu bvulu lili Sedzare ya báyigwa Fesetuse mboro. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Buulu bo bákaluhu bitsughu bilagha oko, Fesetuse ágwi nsia yi a ndagha a Poole kundaa mukogho ya ályele ti: «Ŋa oli a mbwuru mumõ wu oosihi Felikise mu boloko. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Mu matala ma aandi me ku Yerusaleme, bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya bakwuru ba ba-Dzwife baafwunu nde, ya baakaluomo ti me ngwa nde ebili. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Me aamvuhulu kundaa bo ti ba-Romẽ ka bali a epfu kii otyeghe mbwuru wu baafwunu ŋa myaã mi baara o, kala ti ka batswama ogyughu mabwuu ma bo o. Nsomo bafaana ogwa wu baafwunu matala mu okala nyuru a nde. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Me mu obo bo bwohono baagyi ŋa, gwene a ogwa me lagha. Bwihi bu buki, me aambwi-nsini mu nzo a muyala, ya aantumu bagya a mbwuru munde. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Bu baagyi, ba baafwunu nde baabili, lo ka oli a ndagha si mõ yi a mpara o, ti bu aakansimi me. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Bo yini a munsohobo baasi mu mi mitala osamana o bo, emvulu ngughu ndagha yitala mbwuru mumõ wu áakpi, nkwumu a nde Yiisu. Poole li mu okabululyele ti nde li mweẽ. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Buulu me ka aakansoolo bu aansa o, me aamfwulu Poole kala ti nde dzyi ogye ku Yerusaleme buulu balamana ndagha a nde oko. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Lo Poole aaluomo ti mukogho wu a Rome alamana ndagha a nde. Me mu obo me aantumu ti bakebe nde mu boloko tee mu matala ma aangweghe me nde kundaa Sedzare.» <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Angiripa ályele kundaa Fesetuse ti: «Mehe si, ndzyi ogyughu mbwuru munde!» Fesetuse ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Mbala we sa gyughu nde.»<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Bwihi bu buki, Angiripa ya Berenise bágyi kunsa nsia. Bo básomo munsa nzo a muyala, nzili mõ ya bakwuru ba bambumbulu, ya baara baba budziri baba mu bvulu. Fesetuse ágwi litumu bayabiri Poole. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fesetuse ályele ti: «Mukogho Angiripa ya be bwohono ba lili ŋa ya bihi, limono mbwuru wu. Mu nkooro a nde, mpwumu a ba-Dzwife yígyi kundaa me ku Yerusaleme ya ŋaha si, ya yili mu okaluomo kunsa bingubu ti nde ka faana ofirikala wu a mweẽ o. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Me ka aamono mu nde ebili ki bakughu otsyiri nde mukakana wu lipfu o. Lo buulu ndeme aaluomo ti ndagha a nde olamana yo mukogho a Rome, me aangwolo munkaana wu ogweghe nde kundaa Sedzare. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Me bu aankwono obagha ngughu a ndagha yi osono kundaa mukogho a Rome mu mi mitala mbwuru wu, me aayambiri nde ŋa nkulu a be, ŋa nkulu a we mukogho Angiripa, mu kuulu ŋa mbihi a bifwulu bi aagwa we nde, me mbagha mi aansono me mu nde. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Mu engaŋma, me aamono ti oli buwulu mu ogweghe mbwuru a boloko kundaa mukogho a Rome, gwene a osuo bubi bu baafwunu nde.»<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Poole bili mu okala nyuru a nde ŋa nkulu a Angiripa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Angiripa ályele kundaa Poole ti: «We li a muswa wu obili mu okala nyuru a we!» Poole álabala kwogho ya ábili bu mu okala nyuru a nde: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />«Mukogho Angiripa! Me ndi a nkara esee mu etsughu kii lolo mu obili mu okala nyuru a me ŋa nkulu a we, mu mandagha mwohono ma oli mu okaburulu me ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Mu kuulu we gyighili osoolo ekulu ki ba-Dzwife kyehene ya mandagha ma baakabulubaŋana bo. Yoboo, me mbuono we, ka kolo o mu ogyughu me!»<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />«Ba-Dzwife bwohono basoolo bumweẽ bu me, obaana matala ma ándi me munkuru-mbala, ŋa kara li ekaana e me ku Yerusaleme. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Bo basoolo me edzighi, kala ti bo badzyi, bo bakughu olyele engaŋma mu me ti me áli mbwuru a emvuŋunu ki ebvulu a mpini mu enzaami e bihi, emvuŋunu kii ba-Faridzyẽ. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Ya kala ti bali mu olamana me lolo, mu nkooro a kana li me mu misiini mi ósi Nzaami kundaa bataara ba bihi, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />ya madzumu ma bihi kwumu ya muolo (12) si maakasa kana ti misiini mimye sa mikeele ya maakabuono Nzaami mpyibi ya mwiĩ mu mbaa yi alagha. A mukogho! Me mu nkooro a kana lilo ba-Dzwife baafwunu me. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Mu emakye be ba-Dzwife liikagwene osa kana ti Nzaami kughu osiili ba bákpi? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Meme si áakansimi odzwana a nkwumu a Yiisu musi Nadzarete mu manzili mwohono. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Mamo me mandagha ma ákangyighili me ku Yerusaleme. Mu litumu li ógwi me bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami. Meme áakando baba ngili balagha mu maboloko ya me áakankihi ti bakadzwa bo. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Me aakubulungye mu manzo mama lisamana ma ba-Dzwife mwohono mu okasyeme bo ya me áakansiini bo bakatswagha nkwumu a Nzaami. Mu nkehe a me yi a mpini, me áakamweẽ bo kimini tee mu mabvulu mama bunzyi.»<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole lyele bu ágyiŋi nde mayele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">9.1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22.6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />«Etsughu nga-emõ me ákangye ku Damase ya litumu lwohono ya esala ki ógwi me bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />A mukogho! Me ándi mu nzili, ku bele a matala mama embehe, me áamono otsyeme ku obvulu tala mu osehene, ku ófi ku yulu, ya óyabwa mu me ya ba bákagye nzili mõ ya me. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Bihi bwohono líibwi ŋa nsie, ya me áangyughu likyi li líkalyele kundaa me mu Eebere ti: “Sawule, Sawule, mu emakye we li mu okamwehẽ me kimini? Mpara yi a bwunu kundaa we bu gwene okihi, ti anga ngoomo wu li mu okasa ngyi ŋa bali mu okakulu nde munkumu!” <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Ya me áamfwulu ti: “Mfumu, we na?” Mfumu ábvuhulu me ti: “Me ngu Yiisu, ngu me we li mu okamwehẽ kimini. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Lo sighili ya temene mu myili mi we. Me aamoŋono kundaa we mu osa kuulu we kala musala a me ya mpughulu a me mu mi áamono we mu me, ya mu mi àansuo me we ŋa àamfirimoŋono me kundaa we. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Me sa akala nkwulu we ŋa myaã mi baara ba, ya mimi baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. Me kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o me aangweghe we, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />buulu we dzubulu bo mihi, bapala ku mpyibi a nswi mu ogya ku otsyeme, bapala mu litumu li Satana mu osomo mu lili Nzaami. Bo babagha kolokolo a masumu ya babagha kaba lili pfa li baba ngili, mu nzili yi a kana mu me.”»<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole bili mu mi mitala esala e nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />«Mu obo, mukogho Angiripa, me ka ánsi nkyini mu limono lili mayulu lilo o. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Lo me áanduo nsomo kundaa baara baba Damase, tumu kundaa baba Yerusaleme, mu etsulu e nsie kii Yude, ya kundaa bikaana biili ka bili ba-Dzwife o. Me áanduomo bo bagyiŋi mayele, babvughuru kundaa Nzaami, ya basuo bigyighili bi bifaana ya ogyiŋi mayele. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Me mu obo ba-Dzwife baasyimi me mu nzo a nzaami ya baakasagha odzwa me. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Lo Nzaami li mu okakebe me, ya tee mu etsughu kii lolo, me ndi mpughulu kundaa bike-bike ya kundaa bakwuru, kwono ku ndagha obwehe ŋa yulu a mi ólyele mibighili ya Moyidze, ti mandagha mamo mafaana okeele. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Mandagha mamo me ma: Kriste faana omono mpara ya nde li wu a nsomo mu osighili ŋa kara li ba bákpi. Nde faana otsala nsia a otsyeme kundaa ba-Dzwife ya kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o.»<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole lyele Angiripa asa kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Poole ákabili mu okala nyuru a nde ya bu alyele ndagha oyo, Fesetuse ábili mu likyi lili mpini: «Poole we lala li a lo! Mayele mwohono ma li a we maagwi we lala!» <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Lo Poole ábvuhulu ti: «Fesetuse, wu a nkara budziri! Me ka aambyele lala o! Lo mandagha ma ndyele me mama ngaŋma ya mama bunsumu. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Mu kuulu mukogho soolo mandagha mamo mwohono, ya me nkughu obili ŋa nkulu a nde ya kana lwohono. Me ngyighili osoolo ti nde ka dzimini si ndagha mõ mu mo o, mu kuulu mandagha mamo ka máluru mu ensweghe o. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />A mukogho Angiripa! We aakasa kana mu mibighili? Me nsoolo ti we aakasa kana mu mye.» <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Angiripa ábvuhulu kundaa Poole ti: «Osyili eki-kiri we peene a me mu kuulu me nkala mukriste!» <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Poole ályele kundaa nde ti: «Ngu okala eki-kiri, bwunu we matala malagha, kala ti Nzaami dzyi, ka okala yini a we o, lo ya baara bwohono ba bali mu okagyughu me lolo li. Nyaã be likala ti anga me, lo gwene a minkana mimi mu bisyeẽ mi!»<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Mukogho, mfumu a etsulu e nsie, Berenise ya babo bwohono ba bábwi-nsini, bátemene. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Bo bágyene ku mfwunu, báfuunu bo-a-bo ti: «Mbwuru wu ka aagyighili ndagha si mõ o yi bakughu odzwa nde bwunu we olo nde mu boloko.» <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Angiripa ályele kundaa Fesetuse ti: «Mbwuru wu ali wu onyaã, kala ti nde ka aaluomo Sedzare alamana ndagha a nde o.»<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Bagweghe Poole ku Rome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Mu matala ma bágwolo munkaana ti bihi lisomo mu bwara mu ogye ku Itali, bágwi Poole ya baara ba boloko babake ŋa myaã mi mfumu a ekuru ki bambumbulu nkama (100) wu a nkwumu Yulyuse. Nde áli mu mpwumu a bambumbulu yi baakata ti Mpwumu yi a Onguste. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Bihi líisomo mu bwara bubu bvulu lili Adaramite bu búkagye ku mambwuu mama Adzi ya bihi líigyene mu nzili a mubu. Bihi líili ya Arisitarake, musi Masedwane wu a ku Tesalonike. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Mu etsughu ki éluono, bihi líito ŋa bvulu lili Sidõ ya líigwumu oŋo. Yulyuse wu áakagwolo Poole mu embwuru, ágwi nde muswa mu oyimono bandughu ba nde buulu bo babaha nde. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Bu limara oŋo, bihi líinama mu mukogho-mukogho a elyi kii Syipere mu kuulu libara efulu ki ékaghala mfulu kundaa bihi. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Bihi líipala mubu mbembehe li bitsulu bi nsie bibi Silisi ya Pamfili, ya bihi líisughuru ŋa bvulu lili Mire mu etsulu e nsie kii Lisi. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Oŋo, mfumu a ekuru ki bambumbulu nkama (100) bu amono bwara bubu bvulu lili Aledzanderi bu búkagye ku Itali, ásohobo bihi omo. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Mu bitsughu bilagha bihi líikagye buke-buke mu bwara, ya mu mpara bihi líyito ŋa nkulu a bvulu lili Kinide. Buulu efulu ékakahaba bihi mu ogye linkulu, bihi líiluru minkiŋi ŋa nto a elyi ki baakata Salemone ya líigyene mukogho-mukogho mu ngulu yi a elyi kii Kerete. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Bwara búkagye mu mpara yi alagha mu mukogho a madza ya bihi líiyito ŋa ebini emõ ki baakata ti Mambwuu ma Mabwe, ŋa bele a bvulu lili Lasaya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Matala malagha máluru bihi oŋo, ya osomo mu bwara ya ogye mu madza áli oli ndagha yi a mpara, mu kuulu matala mama okuru nswele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">okuru nswele </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nswele yi bákakuru yo ŋa masini ma ndo yi a dzwa, mu osomo mvulu a nsomo.</char></note> mu bala áli ayi máluru. Poole ágyehe bo ya ályele ti: <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />«Bandughu ba me, me ndi mu omono ti dzwe li sa likala li libi. Bilogho ya bwara bikughu opfighili, ya bihi-meme si likughu opfihili bumweẽ bu bihi.» <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Lo mfumu a ekuru ki bambumbulu nkama (100) ábvulu okasa kana mu mbwuru wu aakabiri bwara ya mu nga-a-bwara. Nde ka ádzyi ogyughu Poole o. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Lo buulu mbwuu ka yíli a bu oluhu ndo yi a mpie yi alagha o, ba balagha bákihi etsimi kii omara oŋo. Bitsimi bi bo áli ti, bo bákughu oto ku Fenikise, mbwuu mõ yi a Kerete. Yo yíli bwaha ku Sude-Este ya ku Nore-Weste.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Efulu ki enene mu mubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Mana efulu ki edzuunu ki eekafa ku Sude bu etemene, bo bámono ti bakughu onama etsimi e mfwunu a bo, ya bu basohobo enkulu ki eekatehebe bwara mu madza, bo bágyene mukogho-mukogho a elyi kii Kerete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Lo ŋa mbihi a mana matala, efulu e nkiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">efulu e nkiri </char><char style="ft" closed="false">efulu kii minyimi</char></note> ki baakata ti efulu ki Nore-Esete, ki eekafa ku minguo mimi elyi, ébwi ofulu mu mpini. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Efulu ébiri bwara, ya buulu bihi ka líli a bu ofirisa o, bwara búkabulugye a bihi magye-agye. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Bu líkaluru ŋa bele a elyi-lyi kii Koda, ki ékakyi bihi efulu, bihi líisi mpini mu osomo mu bwara bu busala baba libaha. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Ba baakasala mu bwara, básohobo bwara bu busala bubu libaha munsa bwara bu bunene. Bo bádziŋi bwara bu bunene misyi, ya bu bamono nzalamweẽ ti mara bakwogho a bihi tee ku dzyele lili mukogho a mubu wu a Libi, bo bátubu mu madza enkulu kii endehẽ ki eekatehebe bwara. Ya bányaã efulu ékagye a bihi magye-agye. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Etsughu ki éluono, buulu efulu ékanyihĩ bihi mu mpini, bo bátsili pa li matsulu mu mubu, <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />ya mu etsughu kii bitere, bo bomo bátsili mu mubu nkpaã a eko yi aakasa ti bwara bukagye ya muti wu aakakwara yo. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Mu bitsughu bilagha, tala ya baŋomaŋomo ka bífirikamoŋono o, efulu ka édzuunu si eke o, ya bihi ka lífirisyili a emiini kii obvwughu o.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Bitsughu bilagha bíiluru biili bo ka báli o. Ya Poole bu atemene ŋa kara li bo ályele ti: «Bandughu ba me, kala ti be ali liigyughu me, ti linyaã omara ŋa Kerete, nkini ka likaabwana a efulu ki enene ki ya opfihili bilogho byehene bi o. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Lo mu matala ma, me nduomo be mu okala a bukyini. Mu kuulu ka oli a mbwuru si mumõ mu be wu aapfihili laama li nde o, yini a bwara buubyi. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Mu kuulu mu mpyibi yi, ngye-yulu a Nzaami, Nzaami wu aabagha me ya wu aakansalala me, aayamoŋono kundaa me <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />ya aalyele me ti: “Poole, ka kala a nzalamweẽ o, mu kuulu bafaana olamana we ŋa nkulu a Sedzare. Nzaami aagwi we bwehe ya mu nkooro a we, banganda ba we baba midzye sa bakala mweẽ.” <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Me mu obo bandughu ba me likala a bukyini! Me ndi a kana mu Nzaami ti mandagha ma aalyele nde me sa makeele. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Bwara bu bihi-a-be sa buyitsaŋama ŋa yulu a elyi emõ.»<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Mpyibi oyo áli yi a kwumu ya na (14) yi líkabulugye bihi magye-agye mu mubu wu a Adiryatike. Mu kara-a-kara a mpyibi, ba baakabulusala mu bwara bábaghala ti bihi líito be-bele a nsie. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Bo bágyeele muyighi madza, ya bábagha mankpaã makwumu-matere ya nsaama (37). Bu bafirisele ŋa nkulu, báfirigyeele ya bábagha mankpaã makwumu-muolo ya mataana (25) mama muyighi. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Bu bamono nzalamweẽ ti mara bayikaghara ku yulu a mameẽ, bo básurulu binkulu bina bi biikatehebe bwara mu madza ku mbihi a bwara, ya bo bákasughu mukolo ti bwihi bu baakya. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Lo buulu ba baakasala mu bwara bákasagha obara, bo básurulu bwara bu busala buu libaha mu mubu, ya bási mpere yi oyitere binkulu bi biikatehebe bwara mu madza, ku nkulu a bwara bu bunene. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Poole ályele kundaa mukwuru a ekuru ki bambumbulu nkama ya bambumbulu ti: «Kala ti baara ba ka bakala munsa bwara o, lo be ka libvwughu o!» <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Bambumbulu bátsyiri misyi mi bwara bu busala buu libaha ya bányaã bo bugye mu madza.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Bu bákakebe ti bwihi bukya, Poole ábwono baara bwohono ti badza, ya ályele ti: «Etsughu kii lolo me kii kwumu ya bina (14) ki lili mu okakebe be, ya kiili be elogho odza we. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Mu obo, me mbuono be mu odza mu kuulu be lili a nzala a bi-odza mu obvwughu. Mu engaŋma, mbwuru si mumõ mu be ka apfihili si lifu li mutswi a nde limõ o.» <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Bu amana obili, nde ágwolo limpa, bu abvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami ŋa nkulu a bo bwohono, átsyiri lo ya ábwi odza. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Bo bwohono bábagha bukyini ya boho si bágwolo bilogho báli. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Munsa bwara bihi líili nkama-ywolo ya makwumu-nsaama ya baara basemene (276). <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Bu bagyughuru, bo bátsili matsulu mama mburu a bele mu mubu mpaala bwara buleẽ.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwara budzyama mu madza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Bwihi bu buki, ba baakasala mu bwara ka báfirikasoolo nsie yi bámono bo o. Lo bo bátaala furu li mubu li líli a dzyele lilagha. Bo bágwolo munkaana wu obiri bwara tee oŋo, kala ti bakughu oleene. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Mu obo, bo bányana binkulu bi biikatehebe bwara mu madza ya bányaã bye mu mubu. Bo bányana si misyi mi mankaba ma maakabiri bwara. Ŋa mbihi, bo bakuhubu nkpaã eko yi nene ku nkulu a bwara mpaala efulu etsiini bo ya ebiri bo ku mukogho a mubu. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Lo bo bábvuulu ekumu e dzyele munsa mubu. Mutswi a bwara ákaghara mu dzyele ya bwara ka búfirikanyiĩ o. Etsulu kii mbihi étsaŋama mu nkooro a mampo ma mubu ma mákagya mu mpini. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Bambumbulu bágwolo munkaana wu odzwa baara ba boloko. Mu kuulu bo báli a nzalamweẽ ti mfangolo mumõ mu bo abwa mu madza, bara mu otsaba. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Lo mfumu a ekuru ki bambumbulu nkama ákahaba bo mu kuulu nde ákasagha obvwuhu Poole. Nde ágwi litumu kundaa ba basoolo otsaba mu obwa nsomo mu madza ya bapala ŋa nseghe. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Ba bake báfaana onama bo mu okumu mu yulu a mabaya, bwunu we bipa bi bwara. Obo me bu óbvwughu baara bwohono ya báto ŋa yulu a nseghe mukughu, gwene a epfwumu.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Poole ku elyi kii Malete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Bu libvwughu baba mukughu ya mweẽ, bihi líigyughu ti nkwumu a elyi ekye Malate. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Baara ba baakakala ŋa elyi ekye bábwana a bihi mu embwuru ki elagha. Bo bábvughu mbaa yi nene, báti bihi mbili mu oyagyoro, mu kuulu mvulu ákanoõ ya óli a mpie. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Poole átolo byeghe li nkwi ya átubu lo ku mbaa. Mpili ásuru munsa byeghe lilo mu nkooro a kyaŋana, ánabara nde ŋa ekee. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Baara baba elyi bu bamono ntaala wu áakatsyi ŋa ekee e nde bábili bo-a-bo ti: «Ngaŋma, mbwuru wu baara aakadzwa! Nde aabvwughu mu mubu, lo bunsumu bu Nzaami ka buli mu ogwa nde muswa mu okala mweẽ o.» <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Poole ákubulu ntaala kunsa mbaa, lo nde ka ámono mpara o. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Baara bákakebe omono bu oobyimi nyuru a nde, bwunu we ku aakpa nde nkaã. Bo bákebe edzighi elagha ya ka bámono ndagha yi a mpara yi áabwi mu nde o. Mu obo, bo básobo bitsimi, bábwi okabili ti nde li nzaami.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Bitaa-taa bibye, óli a mansie ma mfumu a elyi ekye. Nkwumu a nde áli Pubiliyuse. Nde ábwana a bihi kundaa nde ti anga bandughu ba nde, ya bihi líiluhu bitsughu bitere ku nzo a nde. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Taara a Pubiliyuse áli a mukaama ya mumweẽ wu makili ákaluru nde. Poole áyitala nde ŋa mbughu ŋa ágyoŋomo nde, bu asamana, ánaã nde myaã, ya ádzuhu nde. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Ŋa mbihi a mandagha mamo, baara bwohono baba elyi ba báli a mabyele bágyi si kundaa nde, ya nde ádzuhu bo. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Bo bágwi bihi budziri bu bulagha ya mu matala ma lísomo bihi bwara mu ogye, bo bágwi bihi bilogho bi líli a bihi nzala a bye.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole to ku Rome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Ŋa mbihi a bangoono batere, bihi líigwolo bwara bu búluhu ndo yi a mpie yi alagha ŋa elyi. Bwara bubo búfi ku bvulu lili Aledzanderi, nkwumu a bo «<char style="qt">Dyosokure</char>», mbaala ti, «banzaami ba bali bambu». <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Bihi líito ŋa bvulu lili Sirakuse, ya líiluhu bitsughu bitere oŋo. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Bu limara oŋo, bihi líinama mukogho a mubu, ya líiyito ku Rengyo. Ŋa mbihi a etsughu emõ, efulu kii ku Sude ébwi ofulu ya bihi líiyipala ku bvulu lili Punzolo mu bitsughu byele, <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />oko bihi líimono bandughu mu kana ba bábuono bihi mu oluhu bitsughu nsaama ya bo. Obo me bu líyato bihi ku Rome. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Bandughu mu kana baba ku Rome bu bagyughu mandagha ma líbwana a bihi, bágyi tee ŋa yu lili Apiyuse ya ŋa ebini ki baakata ti Manzo matere mu oyabwana a bihi. Poole bu amono bo, ábvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami ya ábagha bukyini. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Mu matala ma líto bihi ku Rome, bágwi Poole muswa mu okala mu nzo yi a nde ngasighi ya bágwi nde mbumbulu wu áakabulukebe nde.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poole luo ku Rome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Ŋa mbihi a bitsughu bitere, Poole áti bakwuru ba ba-Dzwife baba ku Rome mbili ku nzo a nde. Bu babvuŋunu, nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Baana ba taara a me, me ka aangyighili ndagha si mõ yi mbi kundaa baara ba bihi ya kundaa bipfu bi ekulu ki bataara ba bihi o, lo baasyimi me ku Yerusaleme ya baatyeghe me ŋa myaã mi ba-Romẽ. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Bo bu bamana ogwa me bifwulu, bo baakadzyi onyaã me, mu kuulu bo ka baabagha ebili ki baadzwa me o. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Lo ba-Dzwife ka baakadzyi o, ya me aakaranduomo ti mukogho Sedzare alamana ndagha a me, gwene a okala a etsimi kii ofwunu baara ba ekaana e me. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Me mu obo me aanduomo omoŋono ya omoõ ya be. Mu ngaŋma, mu nkooro a kana li Isarayele me ndi mu minkana mimi bisyeẽ mi.» <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Bo bályele kundaa nde ti: «Bihi ka liigyagha mukaana si mumõ wu aafi ku Yude mu nkooro a we o. Ka oli a mbwuru si mumõ o mu bandughu mu kana wu aagwi bihi nsia bwunu we wu aalyele bihi mandagha ma mabi mu we. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Lo bihi lidzyi ti weme lyele bihi bitsimi bi we. Mu kuulu bihi ligyighili osoolo ti mu mambughu mwohono, baara bali mu okatemene nsumu emvuŋunu ki li mu okanabara we.»<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Bo bási lagha li baafiribvuŋunu ya Poole. Etsughu ekye bu eto, baara bágyi balagha ku nzo yi ákakala nde. Obaana epala tee nkonkolo, Poole ákaluo ya ákabaala mandagha mwohono ma matala Emfumu e Nzaami. Nde ákasagha bu aapeene a bo mu kuulu bakihi mandagha ma ákalyele nde bo mu mi mitala Yiisu, obaana mu Mikyene mi Moyidze, tee mu mibighili. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Baara bana bákihi mandagha ma ákalyele nde bo, babake bábihi osa kana. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Mu matala ma bákabvughuru bo, bo-a-bo nkini áli ka bákagwihini o, ya Poole ábwehe ndagha yi: «Mufulu a Ngili ábili bubwe kundaa bataara ba be mu mubighili Edzayi.» <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Nde ályele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">«Gye yilyele kundaa baara babo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Be sa ligyighili ogyughu, lo ka libaghala o.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Be sa ligyighili otala, lo ka limono o.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Mu kuulu mikolo mi baara ba ayi miikubu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Bo baakyihi matswi ma bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Bo baadzwi mihi mi bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">mpaala banyaã omono mu mihi mi bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">banyaã ogyughu mu matswi ma bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">banyaã obaghala mu mikolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">mu obo, banyaã ogyiŋi mayele, mpaala me ndzuhu bo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Edz 6.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:14-15">Mat 13.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mar 4.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:10">Luk 8.10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:40">Dzã 12.40</ref></char> </note>.»<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />«Be lifaana osoolo ti Nzaami aagweghe si nsia yi a obvwughu kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. Bo, sa bagyughu!» [<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Poole bu amana obili obo, ba-Dzwife bábvughuru mu okabulubaŋana bo-a-bo].<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Poole áluhu bamvulu buolo mu nzo yi ofuru. Nde ákabwana baara bwohono ba bákayamono nde. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Nde ákatsala nsia a Emfumu e Nzaami ya ákaluo mu kana lwohono ya mu bumpoholo bwohono mandagha ma matala Mfumu Yiisu-Kriste.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>